(740, 'doggie-doo-voice-over', 'Doggie Doo voice over', '<p>The voice of the long running Doggie Doo TV Advert shown in the UK.</p>', 'poo kids', 'Doggie Doo Voice Over - This advert has now been on UK television for over 3 years now. It\'s still one of the most requested children\'s toys every Christmas.', '<h2>Kids Toys TV advert</br>\r\n<p>When I was asked to voice this, I asked \"what is Doggie Doo?\" Then I saw it and laughed. I had to voice it.<br>\r\nOne of the first things I did was go and buy it. I\'ve not played it but it sits in the box ready for when my daughter is old enough.<br>\r\nI get texts every year from friends hearing this on the tv.<br>\r\nI had no idea how popular it was going to be. Turns out every year they sell thousands along with <a href=\"gooey-louie-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Gooey Louie TV Advert\">Gooey Louie</a> and <a href=\"pig-goes-pop-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pig goes Pop\">Pig goes Pop</a>.\r\n</p>', '<br><h2>What on earth is Doggie Doo?</h2>\r\n<p>Been nagging your parents for a puppy? You may change your mind after cleaning up lots of Doggie Doo. With plenty of giggles, watch as the greedy pup gobbles up all the treats and poops on the lawn. If it happens on your turn then standby, you better clear it up! The first player to scoop three poops wins!<br>When it\'s your turn to feed him you get a chance to pump his lead and see if a \'little present\' follows.</p>', 'doggie-doo-voice-over.jpg', 'lWHjCGWFerI', 'Doggie Doo Voice Over | UK TV Advert by Guy Harris', '<h2>Can I help \'Doo\' your job?</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for an energetic and enthusiastic voiceover? Please get in touch via the form opposite. As I\'ve said, I\'ve voiced countless kids\' ads, so take a look at my <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover page</a> to get a better idea of what I\'m capable of. And if you\'re planning to release your ad around Christmas time, you may be interested in my <a href=\"santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voice</a>. I\'d be very happy to send a short sample before you book me. Just send a few lines of the script so you can be sure I\'m right for the brand or project. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>', 'Feb 2017', '1', 'doggie-doo-voice-over', '5', '', 'As seen on TV,  The Doggie Doo voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(743, 'iboy-football-commentator', 'iBoy Football Commentator Voice', '<p>I had the chance to voice a small football-commentary style part in Netflixâ€™s indie superhero film iBoy. Itâ€™s only a blink-and-youâ€™ll-miss-me moment, but great fun to do and another quirky addition to the growing list of <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">football commentator voiceovers</a> I seem to attract.</p>', 'football commentator sport announcer', 'iBoy Football Commentator â€“ Guy Harris recorded a football-style commentary cameo for the Netflix film iBoy. Hear the clip and explore more football commentator', '<h2>Why do I get so many footy jobs?</h2>\r\n<p>It always makes me laugh that I donâ€™t actually watch football, yet Iâ€™m forever booked for <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football commentator style voice\">football commentator-style voiceovers</a>. Even ITV once asked me to voice the promo for a new series of Play to the Whistle, which turned out really well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>My commentary work now includes jobs for <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/betfred-football-commentator\" title=\"Betfred football commentator\">Betfred</a>, <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat UEFA Commentary\">Just Eat UEFA</a>, <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/pizza-hut-delivery-football-commentator-voiceover\" title=\"Pizza Hut football voiceover\">Pizza Hut</a>, <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice\" title=\"Man City commentator voice\">Manchester City</a>, and even international brands like <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover\" title=\"Turkish Airlines football commentary\">Turkish Airlines</a>. Not bad for someone who doesnâ€™t follow football.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It was another voiceover friend who told me Iâ€™d ended up commentating on Spurs and Man U in this Netflix film. I didnâ€™t even realise at the time!</p>', '<h2>More about iBoy</h2>\r\n<p>If you havenâ€™t seen it, iBoy follows Tom, a teenager whose life changes after an encounter with local thugs leaves smartphone fragments embedded in his brain. After waking from a coma, he discovers he has strange new powers and sets out for revenge, along with trying to protect his friend Lucy.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Itâ€™s a gritty, clever British sci-fi film, and it was fun to provide a little moment of commentary within it. Another unusual gig to add to the ever-growing football commentary list.</p>', 'iboy-football-commentator.jpg', 'lgHexqrHh0s', 'iBoy Football Commentator Voiceover | Guy Harris on Netflix', '<h2>Need a football commentator voice?</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re working on a promo, trailer, sketch, or commercial and need a fast, energetic football commentator style, feel free to get in touch. I can send a short sample before you book me. Just send over a few lines of script and Iâ€™ll record something so you know Iâ€™m the right fit.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can also hear more examples on my main <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voiceover\">football commentator voiceover page</a>, which includes global brands, UEFA campaigns, comedy reads, and more.</p>\r\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\r\n    <audio controls style=\"width:100%; max-width:420px;\">\r\n        <source src=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\r\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n    </audio>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;\">\r\n        Football Commentator Showreel â€“ Guy Harris\r\n    </p>\r\n</div>', 'Feb 2017', '1', 'iboy-football-commentator', '3', 'iBoy voiceover\",\"football commentator voice\",\"Netflix movie voice', 'iBoy football commentator cameo on Netflix', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(747, 'siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice', 'Siegecraft Commander Trailer Voice', '<p>Once again, I\'m back to voice another promo with my deep British accent for this trailer.\r\n</p>', 'game patrick stewart', 'Guy Harris lends his powerful trailer voice to Siegecraft Commander â€” a fantasy strategy game filled with explosive action and immersive world-building.', '<h2>Just another game trailer.</h2>\r\n<p>It has to be said that I\'m not going to turn a job down when it comes to being the voice of the <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" title=\"video game trailer voice\">trailer</a>. <br>\r\nVoicing video games is a very long drawn out process with many hours of voicing. Lots of takes and often thousands of lines. I love doing that too, but to do the 1 minute promo for it is a no brainier.<br>\r\nWe start with a deep trailer-esq style and move into a crazy <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IC8ZHC_vgvc\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Patrick Stewart Style\">Patrick Stewart</a> style voice to sell the silliness of the gameplay.\r\n</p>', '<br>\r\n<h2>What is Siegecraft about?</h2>\r\n<p>Blowfish studios presents Siegecraft Commander<br>\r\nIn turn-based matches, plan the location of the towers, units and walls in your fortress to outmaneuver your foes, then tactically think and precisely aim when starting your attack! In real-time, construct a base that can win the war and start an all-out offensive. <br>\r\nBoth offer easy-to-learn strategic elements combined in subtle ways to yield a rich tactical experience!</p>', 'siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice.jpg', 'QfnHt7Ze4BE', 'Siegecraft Commander Trailer Voice - Trailer by Guy Harris', '<h2>Need a trailer voice?</h2>\r\n<p>Working on an a game trailer? Does it need to be fun like this? Do get in touch. Use the form here and lets chat. I\'d be very happy to send a sample before you book me. Just send a few lines of the script first so you can be sure I\'m right for the brand or project. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>', 'Nov 16', '1', 'siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice', '3', '', 'Game trailer Voice - Siegecraft Commander.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(748, 'patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice', 'Patrick Stewart Impression Voiceover', '<p>The original Money Supermarket advert voice... Mr Patrick Stewart.</p>', 'impression, soundalike, parody', 'Need a Patrick Stewart-style voice? Guy Harris recreates the iconic MoneySuperMarket delivery. Trusted by CBS, NFL, Minecraft, and more. Listen now.', '<h2>My Patrick Stewart Sound-a-Like</h2>\r\n<p>From *Star Trek* to *X-Men*, I love the gravitas and quirkiness of Sir Patrick Stewartâ€™s voice. This is my homage to the legend.</p>\r\n<p>The original voice of TVâ€™s MoneySuperMarket adverts, you\'re now watching my faithful recreation of that iconic delivery.</p>\r\n<p>For other projects using my Patrick Stewart-style voice, check out:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover\">Hide The Corpse â€“ Dark and dramatic narration</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\">Lending Crowd â€“ Calm, confident delivery</a></li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>Your Kind of Supermarket?</h2>\r\n<p>MoneySuperMarket.com Group PLC is a British price comparison website specialising in financial services, from mortgages to credit cards and loans.</p>\r\n<p>It grew to become a household name thanks in part to its memorable TV adverts â€“ and of course, the legendary voice that launched the campaign. Patrick Stewartâ€™s delivery gave those ads their *gravitas with a wink*, and set the tone for years to come.</p>\r\n<p>For a parody, homage, or tongue-in-cheek campaign in that iconic style, Iâ€™ve got you covered.</p>', 'patrick-stewart-impression.jpg', 'IC8ZHC_vgvc', 'Patrick Stewart Impression Voice â€“ Guy Harris Sound-a-Like', '<h2>Feel Epic and get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>Searching for a voice like Patrick Stewart? Something with some gravitas? Please get in touch. It always helps to know the usage first to enable me to better quote you. It would be a pleasure to add you to my client list.</p>', 'July 13', '1', 'patrick-stewart-impression', '3', '', 'The Money Supermarket voice!', '', '<h2>Need a Patrick Stewart Sound-a-Like?</h2>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re creating a spoof, an epic promo, or a narrator with authority and warmth, Iâ€™ve voiced scripts in this style for:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>TV campaigns</strong> like <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart\">CBS & NFLâ€™s King Henry</a></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Gaming clients</strong> including <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover\">Minecraft Backpack Promo</a></li>\r\n  <li><strong>Corporate promos</strong> such as <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover\">European Collaboration Summit</a> and <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\">Lending Crowd</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Feel epic and get in touch! If you need a trusted voice artist with a studio that delivers broadcast-quality audio fast, <a href=\"contact-guy\">contact me today</a>.</p>', '', '', '', 'character-voiceovers.jpg', '', '', ''),
(749, 'horizon-zero-dawn-voice', 'Horizon Zero Dawn â€“ Attenborough Style', '<p>A parody-style David Attenborough voiceover for Horizon Zero Dawn, delivered with wit and precision by Guy Harris.</p>', 'David impression gaming parody', 'Attenborough-style voiceover for Horizon Zero Dawn by Guy Harris. Game trailer meets nature doc parody. Explore more character reads and parody scripts.', '<h2>Another epic collaboration with IGN</h2>\r\n<p>Getting the email from <strong>IGN</strong> was a real treat. I\'m often on their site scouting for new games, trailers and voiceover opportunities. As someone who grew up on the ZX Spectrum, C64 and PS3, lending my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Voiceover\">Attenborough-style narration</a> to this trailer was pure joy.</p>\r\n<p>We nailed the tone quickly. They had a vision for a nature documentary-style parody, and we had a laugh crafting something unique. If you liked this, have a listen to my other Attenborough projects, such as <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Turkish Airlines parody\">the Turkish Airlines spoof</a> or <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Cracking Ice Attenborough Voice\">Cracking Ice</a>, a frosty nod to Attenboroughâ€™s iconic delivery.</p>', '<h2>What is Horizon Zero Dawn?</h2>\r\n<p><em>Horizon Zero Dawn</em> is an open-world RPG developed by Guerrilla Games. It follows Aloy, a skilled hunter living in a post-apocalyptic world ruled by machines. Her journey to uncover her origins and reclaim the Earth is packed with cinematic sequencesâ€”perfect for a nature-meets-gaming-style narration.</p>\r\n<p>And letâ€™s face it... those giant robot giraffes are practically crying out for an <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"Generate your own Attenborough script\">Attenborough-style breakdown</a>.</p>', 'horizon-zero-dawn-voice.jpg', 'I_AbMKJbNEc', 'Horizon Zero Dawn Voice â€“ Attenborough Style by Guy Harris', '<h2>Searching for an explorer?</h2>\r\n<p>Need something with gravitas and a dash of humour? I can provide narration in the style of Sir David Attenboroughâ€”perfect for trailers, spoofs, explainer videos, and more. <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Soundalike Voiceover\">Have a listen to more examples</a> or <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Get in Touch\">get in touch</a> for a bespoke quote.</p>\r\n<p>This is not affiliated with Sir David himself. But itâ€™s delivered with deep respect for his tone, pace and style. No profanity. No AI cloning. Just good, clean parody.</p>', '2017-02-02', '1', 'horizon-zero-dawn-voice', '5', 'david impression\", \"gaming parody\", \"nature voiceover', 'Attenborough for IGN on this PS4 game.', '', '<h2>Want a voice like this?</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re looking for a realistic <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover Artist\">David Attenborough voiceover</a>, Iâ€™ve got you covered. Whether itâ€™s for a trailer, a documentary spoof, or a branded explainer, I bring the tone, pace, and polish youâ€™d expect.</p>\r\n<p>Scripts must stay respectfulâ€”no profanity, no claiming to be him. But if youâ€™ve got something fun and creative in mind, <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">drop me a line</a> and letâ€™s discuss it. Or try out the new <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"Try the Script Generator\">Attenborough Script Generator</a> to bring your idea to life in a few clicks.</p>', '', '', '', 'attenborough-voice-og.jpg', '', '', 'attenborough-voice-og.jpg'),
(753, 'pathe-news-jack-fm', 'Pathe News sketches for Jack FM', '<p>I love being asked to voice in the old Pathe voice style. It\'s rather spiffing I say.</p>', '', 'Pathe News Jack FM - Sketches for Jack in Oxfordshire. Part of a series of fun How to guides in that retro 1940\'s classic British voice style.', '<h2>Keeping the history alive</h2>\r\n<p>I love doing this classic voice. The PathÃ© voice is part of my repertoire that I love to showcase and I\'m also addicted to the PathÃ© YouTube channel. I can get lost watching endless videos on there. As you\'ll see on my <a href=\"pathe-news-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pathe VoicÃ©\">PathÃ© voice page</a>, I have a lot of experience with this particular voiceover style, so please feel free to get in touch if you\'d like my <a href=\"https://www.pathevoice.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"PathÃ© News Voiceover\">PathÃ© News Voiceover</a> for your next project!</p>', '<h2>History of Pathe</h2>\r\n<p>Before television, people came to movie theatres to watch the news. British PathÃ© was at the forefront of cinematic journalism, blending information with entertainment to popular effect. Over the course of a century, it documented everything from major armed conflicts and seismic political crises to the curious hobbies and eccentric lives of ordinary people. If it happened, British PathÃ© filmed it. I find this style fascinating and it\'s a fun voice for any voiceover artist to do, so I was really pleased when Jack FM asked me to do it. Jack FM is a radio station based in Oxfordshire and they were a pleasure to work with on this job.</p>', 'pathe-news-jack-fm.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/316132827&amp;color=ff5500&amp;auto_play=false&amp;hide_related=false&amp;show_comments=true&amp;show_user=true&amp;show_reposts=false\"></iframe>', 'Pathe News sketches Jack FM - Voiced by Guy Harris', '<h2>If this be up your street, get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you are looking for a style similar to this Pathe News piece, do please <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"get in touch\">get in touch</a>. I\'ll gladly send you a sample first to see if my voice is right for your promo or brand. If you\'re not looking for a Pathe news style, one of my other <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial\">commercial</a> or <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceovers\">character voiceovers</a> might be right for your project!</p>', 'April 2017', '2', 'pathe-news-jack-fm', '3', '', 'Pathe News style sketches for Jack FM', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(762, 'bbk-travel-insurance-voiceover', 'BBK travel Insurance Voiceover', '<p>A natural UK voiceover for the BBK travel Insurance explainer.</p>', 'Explainer', 'BBK travel Insurance Voiceover - Another natural voice style for this product. A UK voiceover was needed and I got the call. Conversational they requested.', '<h2>Another natural voice style</h2>\r\n<p>I\'m very comfortable with this type of delivery. It\'s the one I\'m asked for most of the time. Lets face it, the voiceover for an explainer video should carry the content along but not dominate it; it should sound conversational and appealing, whilst making the information as easy to process as possible. Hopefully, my extensive experience with <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video\">explainer video voiceover</a> is why I keep getting booked. It\'s nice to work with some new and interesting brands and it\'s also a pleasure when the end result has been mixed and mastered well too. Just like this.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Who are BBK</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.bbkonline.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"BBK\">BBK\'s</a> motto is \'the Brighter way\'. Whether you\'re an individual, a family, or as a business, they aim to help you fulfill a secure and brighter life. By leveraging our research, technology, and foresight they offer you superior products and services, to ensure a financially secure future. They provide you with an annual travel insurance policy designed to cover the whole family in one; it\'s designed to give you and your family peace of mind and comfort while you\'re out, exploring the World! BBK is a class act and they put a lot effort into producing what I think is a great explainer video (and I\'d know as I\'ve done a few dozen by this point!).</p>\r\n', 'bbk-travel-insurance-voiceover.jpg', 'E4qpxtFnwRQ', 'BBK Travel Insurance â€“ Voiceover Explainer', '<h2>Need a voice for your brand?</h2>\r\n<p>Trusted by global brands, let me help with your product video. If you need a little more convincing, watch my <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover show reel</a> or my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video\">explainer video voiceover show rell</a>. What ever you need, lets chat. To make it easier for you, I\'d love to send you a sample first to see if my voice is right for the brand or project you are working on. Just get in touch and tell me a little more about your brand and your project!</p>', 'May 17', '1', 'bbk-travel-insurance-voiceover', '5', '', 'A natural English voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(768, 'compare-my-wedding-voice', 'Compare My Wedding Voice', '<p>A mock come dine with me style</p>', 'come dine', 'A parody packed with attitude. Guy Harris voices this mock â€œCome Dine With Meâ€ style ad for Compare My Weddingâ€”funny, sharp, and bang on brand.', '<h2>Another awesome project!</h2>\r\n<p>This was a fun job working with the guys at <a href=\"https://sunandmoonstudios.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Sun & Moon studios\">Sun & Moon studios</a> in Bristol. They produce some awesome animations for big clients including the BBC which I\'m happy to say I was voicing too.<br> They wanted something a little quirky. A bit like Dave Lamb on Channel 4\'s <a href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/come-dine-with-me\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Come dine with me\">Come dine with me</a> show.<br>Once again S&M delivered a great product for what should be a great website idea. Proud once again of the association.\r\n</p>', '<br><br>\r\n<h2>Who are Compare my Wedding.com?</h2>\r\n<p>CompareMyWedding.com was one of the UK\'s most celebrated wedding comparison sites, with brides and grooms-to-be across the UK using the site to help plan their big day.<br>\r\nIf you are connected to the wedding industry, you should get listed as a supplier.<br>\r\n</p>', 'compare-my-wedding-voice.jpg', 'kg6MZG4gMmM', 'Compare My Wedding Voice - wedding comparison site', '<br><h2>Do you need a quirky voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>If you liked this cheeky style, do let me know. Will this style work with your project or promo?<br>\r\nTo make it easier for you, I\'d love to send you a sample first to see if my voice is right.<br>\r\nFill in the form now, tell me more and lets get started.</p>', 'June 17', '1', 'compare-my-wedding-voice', '3', '', 'A quirky come dine with me voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(770, 'opel-the-future-is-everyones', 'Opel - The Future is Everyone\'s', '<p>A soft narration style for this huge web campaign for the car giant.</p>', 'soft narration pulled back natural', 'Opel - The Future is Everyone\'s. I loved this. Not only was it a huge web campaign for Opel but the voice session was great. A very understated delivery.', '<h2>An understated, soft-spoken voiceover for Opel\'s TV Ad.</h2>\r\n<p>I gave a soft-spoken voiceover for Opel\'s new TV Ad. A soft-spoken tone is perfect for inspirational videos and it\'s a great fit with Opel\'s ad. Depending on the clients I\'m working with on a daily basis, I\'m often asked to go from softly spoken to a hard sell; it all depends on the variety of promos, games, adverts and features I\'m providing voiceover for. Opel came along and asked for something \'pulled back\' and we talked a little more about what exactly they were after. I think I\'m pretty good at understanding what a client needs, so we tried this and Opel loved it!. Up until now, I hadn\'t seen the final cut, and I love to find the result of my work a few weeks down the line. I hope you enjoy the delivery and, more importantly, Opel\'s message.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Opel\'s The Future is Everyone\'s Message?</h2>\r\n<p>Wherever we look, we encounter new technology and breakthrough inventions that have the power to change our lives forever.\r\n<a href=\"https://www.vauxhall.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Opel Website\">Opel</a> wants everyone to profit from those changes. This is why Opel constantly strives to make sure that innovations are accessible to as many people as possible. This sense of purpose is deeply rooted in the DNA of the brand; they implement the latest technology in their products and services, all geared towards the wider public. Because it\'s only when an innovation is available to everyone, that it has the power to truly improve our world. I think Opel has an inpiring message and it was great to work with them on this advertisement. If you\'d like to see more examples of my various TV ad voiceovers, take a look at my <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TITLE\">commercial voiceover page</a> </p>', 'opel-the-future-is-everyones.jpg', 'N4cZtq6UBRI', 'Opel - The Future is Everyone\'s - Soft narration', '<h2>Need a voiceover thats a little less \'in ya face?\'</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for a softer, less \'in ya face\' voiceover, then I\'m the right man for the job. I can perform a variety of different voices to suit your promo or campaign. If you\'d like a better idea of my repertoire, you may like to check out my <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"character voiceover\">character voiceover page</a>\r\n. Google me or read a little more <a href=\"voiceoverguy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TITLE\">about me</a> and you\'ll see I\'m trusted by big name brands and have been in the voiceover industry for a long time. Do get in touch. I\'d love to send you a sample first to see if my voice is right for your brand. Visit the <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Get in touch!\">contact page</a> </a>now and tell me a little more about your project.</p>', 'June 17', '1', 'opel-the-future-is-everyones', '5', '', 'Opel - Soft natural narration', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `messages2` (`id`, `url`, `page_title`, `info`, `search_terms`, `page_desc`, `text1`, `text2`, `image`, `video`, `meta_title`, `bottomtext`, `date`, `whatvideo`, `alt`, `rating`, `twitter`, `hometext`, `santa`, `ntext1`, `ntext2`, `ntext3`, `ntext4`, `nimage1`, `nimage2`, `nimage3`, `nimage4`) VALUES
(771, 'bugs-in-kitchen-voice', 'Bugs in the Kitchen', '<p>Another kids Tv Advert Voice.</p>', 'kids toys tv', 'Guy Harris delivers the high-energy voiceover for Bugs in the Kitchen. A fast-paced, fun and frantic kidsâ€™ toy advert packed with bug-chasing excitement.', '<h2>My Voice is still on Kids\' TV!</h2>\r\n<p>I\'m back on the TV for another kids\' toy commercial. If you\'d like to listen to a backlog of some of my work, check out my <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TV Ad Voiceover\">commercial voiceover page</a>. It\'s nice to be asked, again and again, to voice TV adverts for kid\'s toys. Obviously my voice seems to be a good fit for the toy industry and I think the fact that I enjoy it so much comes through in my performance. Again and again, I\'m asked: \"We need an energetic voice for this ad please, Guy\". If it\'s not <a href=\"doggie-doo-voice-over\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Doggie Doo\">Doggie Doo</a> or <a href=\"minecraft-combat-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Minecraft Handbook\"> Minecraft Handbook</a>, I\'m constantly told I\'ve been heard on other TV adverts on the younger generation TV channels for various toys and games, and then my <a href=\"santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voice</a> is heard everywhere on the run-up to Christmas. </p>', '<h2>What is Bugs in the Kitchen?</h2>\r\n<p> Bugs in the Kitchen is a three-dimensional board game from Ravensburger. In this game, the main bug is actually a battery-operated Hexbug that moves around the maze-like board. If you\'re familiar with Hexbugs, they are animatronic insects that vibrate and move just like real creepy crawlers. In the game, players become exterminators and it\'s up to you to not only trap the bug but do it before your opponents. Ravesnburger is a brilliant toy company with some great board games. I\'ve worked with them many times. </p>', 'bugs-in-kitchen-voice.jpg', 'iit8RT5SW6A', 'Bugs in the Kitchen â€“ Toy Commercial Voiceover', '<h2>Are you looking for a voice with energy and excitement?</h2>\r\n<p>The ideal voiceover for toys and board games is full of energy and excitement. And this is something I\'ve performed again and again for different clients. If you have a toy or board game and you\'re looking for the idea voiceover to complete your TV or online ad, then we can definitely work together! If you want to hear a little more of my material, you may like to listen to my show reel on my <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"game trailer voice page\"> game trailer voice page</a>. With a brief search on Google, you\'ll see that I\'m trusted by big name brands and have been in the industry for a long time. If you\'re interested, please fill in the form and tell me more about your product or project!</p>', 'July 17', '1', 'bugs-in-kitchen-voice', '3', '', 'Bugs in the Kitchen Tv Advert', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(772, 'warwings-game-trailer-voice', 'Warwings Game Trailer Voice', '<p>The test campaign in the UK for this epic game by MiniClip.</p>', 'pilot', 'Warwings Game Trailer Voice - Another awesome game by MiniClip. Take to the skies and join the battle in epic WWII dogfights! As seen on TV.', '<h2>As seen and heard on TV.</h2>\r\n<p>I provided voiceover for the commercial trailer for a great mobile game. Working once again with another great agency in London, they asked me to provide a pilot voice for a trailer for a game called WarWings. They asked for a nice bit of energy and the 1940s moustached pilot style.  This direction was all I needed and they were happy with the end result. I\'ve done a lot of <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TV commercial voiceover\">TV commercials</a> now and I think I\'ve gotten really good at working out exactly what clients want. Often, the video has been made and the last thing they need is the voiceover, so it helps to be able to get my bearings quickly and I usually get the finished audio back to them on the same day.</p>', '<h2>What is WarWings?</h2>\r\n<p>Mobile gamers are going to love WarWings and it was lots of fun to talk about in the trailer. Gear up and don your helmet; the BEST WWII Aerial combat game is here! Get into the cockpit of your fully customizable, historically accurate \"warbird\" and experience the most epic World War II aerial dogfights ever! Fly solo as a lone wolf or team up with ally squadrons to control the skies. Compete against millions of players worldwide. Destroy enemy squadrons and climb global PvP leaderboards. <a href=\"https://twitter.com/warwingsmobile\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Download now\">Download now</a>.</p>', 'war-wings-game-trailer-voice.jpg', 'OqQ3N633hb8', 'Warwings Game Trailer â€“ Cinematic Voiceover Style', '<h2>Need a pilot voiceover for your trailer?</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for the perfect old-fashioned WWII voice? Or maybe even the old <a href=\"pathe-news-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pathe voice style\">Pathe style voice</a> that the BBC used for decades? Whatever your project, I can help add the finishing touches with a high-quality, pitch-perfect voiceover. If you need to look through more of my previous work, take a listen to my <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"movie trailer voiceover\">movie trailer</a> and <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"game trailer voiceover\">game trailer</a> voiceovers. If it helps, I can send you a sample of your script first, to help you see if my voice is right for your brand. Please <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Get in touch!\">get in touch</a> </a> and tell me a little more about your project!</p>', 'July 17', '1', 'warwings-game-trailer-voice', '3', '', 'Warwings Game Trailer Voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(774, 'wirecard-male-voice-over', 'Wirecard | Male voice over explainer', '<p>Outsourcing and white label solutions for electronic payment transactions.</p>', '', 'Wire card - A Male voice over was needed to explain it.  An independent provider of outsourcing and white label solutions for electronic payment transactions.', '<h2>Male voiceover for Wirecard explainer video</h2>\r\n<p>I recently helped Wirecard with this great explainer video. Wirecard had asked me to voice another one of their videos and they brought me along for this one as well! All of the animation on this video was handled by <a href=\"https://www.nordnord.tv/en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Nord Nord official site\">Nord Nord</a> in Hannover, Germany, and as is the case with all of the best explainer videos, there are some lovely animations throughout. The whole audio mix is really nice, too â€“ which is something you learn to appreciate in the voiceover business! It\'s great working with such a professional team. I\'m so pleased with the overall finished I\'ll probably be using this as one of my demos for my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TITLE\">explainer video voice</a> now!</p>', '<h2>What is Wirecard?</h2>\r\n<p>Wirecard AG is one of the Worldâ€™s leading independent providers of outsourcing and white label solutions for electronic payment transactions. Wirecard supports companies in accepting electronic payments from all sales channels. A global multi-channel platform bundles international payment acceptances and methods, supplemented by fraud prevention solutions.  If you have a business with a product or service that is a little more complicated, like Wirecard, then an explainer video is often the best way to explain exactly what makes your business better than its competitors!</p>', 'wirecard-male-voice-over.jpg', 'hrNwFGOaf-Q', 'Wirecard Explainer Voiceover â€“ Male VO by Guy Harris', '<h2>Need an explainer video voice?</h2>\r\n<p>The explainer video voice is the style I\'m asked for most of all. Clients come to me because they need a clear, trusting, honest voice with a bright, standard English accent that everyone is likely to understand. Is this the style you need for your <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TV AD Voiceover\">TV ad</a> or <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video\">explainer video</a>? I\'m always looking for new projects and I\'m more than happy to send a free sample from your script so that you can tell whether my voice is a good fit for your brand. If you\'re interested, <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Get in touch!\">get in touch</a> </a> and tell me more about it. Let\'s get started!</p>', 'Jan 2017', '1', 'wirecard-male-voice-over', '3', '', 'British Male voiceover- explainer', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(776, 'micropolitics-under-14-handball-team', 'Micropolitics - U14 Handball Team', '<p>The voiceover for a new campaign from Egyptian news organization Mada Masr.</p>', 'soft natural', 'Micropolitics - Voiceover of Under 14 Handball Team Voiceover The film capture the unseen power struggles and immorality in seemingly innocuous organisations.', '<h2>A soft natural narration</h2>\r\n<p>I provided the voiceover for this funny, creative advertisement for the Egyptian news organisation Mada Masr. When I saw the scripts and watched the un-narrated visual, I knew I wanted to be part of this project. Working with the team at Mango Jam in Dubai, the client and writers all attended the session which made the direction so much easier to work with as we were able to talk through everything. This is the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bF2Ps_7OZ4w\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"2nd\">2nd</a> of a fun two-ad campaign designed to renew readersâ€™ interest in politics by highlighting the many ways politics happens all around us, every day. Ref: <a href=\"https://www.adweek.com/creativity/this-news-sites-fun-ads-remind-us-that-everythings-political-not-just-government/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Adweek Website\"> Adweek</a>.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Who are Mada Masr?</h2>\r\n<p>Mada Masr is an independent Egyptian news organization dedicated to producing intelligent and engaging journalism.<br>Under 14 Handball Team sarcastically elaborates on how bureaucracy and corruption are not just reserved for parliamentary affairs. The two films capture the unseen power struggles and immorality in seemingly innocuous organisations. The other being <a href=\"micropolitics-suzys-beauty-salon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Suzy\'s Beauty Salon\">Suzy\'s Beauty Salon</a>. This was a brilliant, creative project and I had a lot of fun working with them.\r\n</p>', 'micropolitics-under-14-handball-team.jpg', 'iDqf6eHiI-Q', 'Micropolitics - Under 14 Handball Team Voiceover', '<h2>Need my voice for your project or brand?</h2>\r\n<p>Do you need a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"commercial voiceover\">professional commercial voiceover</a>, or perhaps an <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video voiceover</a>? A great voiceover starts with a great script. Got a great script that needs the right voice? Let me send you a sample first to see if my voice is right for your brand. Please <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Get in touch!\">get in touch</a> and tell me more about your project.</p>', 'Feb 17', '1', 'micropolitics-under-14-handball-team', '5', '', 'Micropolitics -  Under 14 Handball Team. ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(777, 'micropolitics-suzys-beauty-salon', 'Micropolitics - Suzy\'s Beauty Salon', '<p>The voiceover for a new campaign from Egyptian news organization Mada Masr.</p>', 'soft natural', 'Micro politics - The voiceover for Suzy\'s Beauty Salon sarcastically elaborate on how bureaucracy and corruption are not just reserved for parliamentary affairs', '<h2>A natural close mic read.</h2>\r\n<p>I voiced this visual masterpiece in February 2017 and knew it was going to turn out great. The team at Mango Jam did a great job of the sound design and mix. A witty <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=iDqf6eHiI-Q\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Advert 2 -- Youth Handball Team\">two-ad</a> campaign designed to renew readersâ€™ interest in politics by highlighting the many ways politics happens all around us, every day. We all know what office politics are like. But thereâ€™s a pleasure in seeing how far the politics in someone elseâ€™s workplace truly ripple. Ref: Adweek.\r\n</p>', '<br>\r\n<h2>Who are Mada Masr?</h2>\r\n<p>Mada Masr is an independent Egyptian news organization dedicated to producing intelligent and engaging journalism.<br>Suzyâ€™s Beauty Salon sarcastically elaborate on how bureaucracy and corruption are not just reserved for parliamentary affairs.<br>Both capture unseen power struggles, immorality, bribery, pilfering, conspiring and more among two seemingly innocuous groups: a team of hairstylists and a <a href=\"micropolitics-under-14-handball-team\" title=\"youth handball team film\">youth handball team</a>.\r\n</p>', 'micropolitics-suzys-beauty-salon.jpg', 'bF2Ps_7OZ4w', 'Micropolitics - Suzy\'s Beauty Salon Voiceover', '<h2>Looking for a voice with credibility?</h2>\r\n<p>These videos were lots of fun to work on and the director had great vision and the session was awesome. Got an script that needs the perfect <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"commercial voiceover\">commercial voiceover</a> to bring it to life? Let me send you a sample first to see if my voice is right for your brand. Click the <a href=\"contact-guy\"  title=\"Get in touch!\">contact page</a> </a>, tell me more, and let\'s get to work.</p>', 'Feb 17', '1', 'micropolitics-suzys-beauty-salon', '5', '', 'Suzy\'s Beauty Salon Voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(778, 'articulate-game-voiceover', 'Articulate Game Voiceover', '<p>Another tv advert for another great kids\' toy</p>', 'commercial children energetic', 'Articulate Game Voiceover - Describe as many card entries as possible to your team mates in 30 seconds without giving begins with or sounds like clues.', '<h2>Smyths Toys Voice</h2>\r\n<p>I provided voiceover for an TV ad for the kids\' edition of Articulate, one of the most popular board games in the World. Over the years, I\'ve provided voiceover for lots of toy commercials, including plenty of ads for <a href=\"https://www.smythstoys.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Smyths Toys Official site\">Smyths Toys</a>.<br>\r\nI have lots of experience working with toy companies and my voice is used by some major <a href=\"gooey-louie-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Ideal Toys Gooey Louie\">toy brands</a> worldwide, which makes me really proud. I can bring warmth and energy to the script and add that little bit of sparkle to your campaign.<br>\r\nThe toy industry is a big part of my workload and it\'s just as fun as it sounds. Please feel free to check out some of my <a href=\"voiceover-news\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"My Voiceover News Blogs\">other work</a> to see if my voice is right for your <a href=\"spiderman-car-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Spiderman Toy\">toy</a>, game, promo or brand.</p>', '<h2>What is Articulate?</h2>\r\n<p>Articulate is the fast-talking description game for kids with between 4 and 20 players. Describe as many things on the cards as possible to your teammates in 30 seconds without giving \"begins with\" or \"sounds like\" clues. Sound easy? Well, that depends on who you\'re teamed-up with! Articulate is all about finding the quickest, easiest way to describe something to your teammates and it\'s so much fun.<br>\r\nArticulate for Kids follows on from the spectacularly successful adult description game and can now be played by kids as young as 6 and as old as 12. It\'s great when a game mechanic works so well that it translates perfectly to different audiences! Articulate is the perfect family game to play at Christmas and it was a lot of fun to work on the TV ad!</p>', 'articulate-game-voiceover.jpg', 'qMfHdzdqBBo', 'Articulate Board Game Voiceover â€“ British Narrator', '<h2>Looking for a voice with energy and fun?</h2>\r\n<p>As you can tell from my website, I love voicing these kinds of jobs. And as my daughter gets a little older, there\'s a really good chance she\'ll hear my work (I wonder if she\'ll recognise me?). My vocal tone is bright, happy, and quirky, which is seems to be a perfect match for toys and board game commercials! If you\'d like a little help figuring out whether my voice is right for your project, please <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Get in touch!\">feel free to get in touch</a> </a>and ask me to provide a sample of your script.</p>', 'Aug 17', '1', 'articulate-game-voiceover', '3', '', 'Articulate Game Voiceover by Smyths Toys', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(787, 'home-composting-explainer-voice', 'Home Composting Explainer Video', '<p>Just me, Guy Harris, explaining how composting works.</p>', '', 'Guy Harris provided the voiceover for a helpful explainer video by Warwickshire County Council that tells people how to set up their own compost bin. ', '<h2>Explaining How to Make Compost at Home</h2>\r\n<p>The more we learn about the environment and our impact on it, the more important it is for us to conserve energy wherever we can and to reduce our waste. Thatâ€™s why Warwickshire County Council made this home-composting explainer video. Thereâ€™s been a big green revolution in the UK and weâ€™re getting really good at recycling, but there are a lot of questions about what can and canâ€™t go into our compost bins, so this explainer video should be really helpful. I love doing explainer videos as I think theyâ€™re the best way to give a lot of information to an audience in a quick and easy format. If youâ€™re interested in learning more about explainer videos, have a look on my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"explainer video voice\"> explainer video voiceover page </a>.</p>', '<h2>About the Home Composting Video</h2>\r\n<p>Anyone whoâ€™s ever tried to make compost at home will know that thereâ€™s a lot more to it that just chucking all your food waste into a bin and hoping for the best. There has to be the right amount of heat, the right combination of nitrogen-rich and carbon-rich ingredients. If you add too much of the wrong thing or not enough of the right thing, the chemistry goes all wrong and it can slow down or completely halt the composting process. Itâ€™s great to see councils like Warwickshire County Council taking some initiative and promoting home composting. You can visit the explainer video at its home on the <a href=\" https://www.warwickshire.gov.uk/composting\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Warwickshire Council Composting\"> Warwickshire Country Council Composting page</a>, which also has a range of helpful guides about all-things-composting.</p>', 'home-composting-explainer-voice.jpg', 'GQlUsZcj-s0', 'Home Composting Explainer â€“ Voiceover by Guy', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re making an explainer video and youâ€™re in need of voiceover, then Iâ€™m definitely interested in working with you. Take a look on my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"explainer video voice\"> explainer video voiceover page </a> to get a better idea fo what I can do. And if youâ€™re still not sure if Iâ€™m right for your project, I\'m happy to record a sample of your script for free. Please feel free to get in touch if you have any questions!</p>', '', '1', '', '0', '', 'A composting explainer video', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(788, 'why-use-a-voiceover', 'Why use a voiceover (Vo Artist)?', '<p>A question asked far too often having not budgeted for it properly to begin with.</p>', 'top tips question help', 'Why use a voiceover? It\'s a question people always ask prior to wanting to part with money on what is often an afterthought when producing their awesome content', '<h2>Booking a professional voice</h2>\r\n<p>One difference between a finished visual <a href=\"micropolitics-suzys-beauty-salon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"A master piece of filming\">master piece</a> with a pro voice and a cheap one, from someone with a laptop and mic and charging you a fiver, is the credibility that goes with it. No one is saying ALL cheaper voice options are bad, however, pay for an experienced professional and you are guaranteed audio that sounds high quality and more likely, a voice thats already familiar with big name brands, which brings that credibility to your product or brand too.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Is a voiceover expensive?</h2>\r\n<p>It\'s all relative. You are paying for years of <a href=\"voiceoverguy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Experienced Voiceover\">experience</a>. You are paying for the voice to understand what you are trying to sell or promote, and read it the way you want to tell your story.<br>Your basic studio fee includes the use of their professional equipment, so this should always be factored in. Then you will pay for usage on top. Be honest (and organised) with how and where your advertisement is going to be used. Unless you agreed a buyout, you may have a larger-than-anticipated usage invoice further down the line once you\'ve broadcast it and added it to all your social media channels. </p>', 'why-use-a-voiceover.jpg', 'TqkdBK8mBW8', 'Why Use a Voiceover? 6 Reasons to Hire a Pro', '<h2>How quick can I get a voice over?</h2>\r\n<p>As most professional voiceovers have their own <a href=\"voiceover-studio\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Home Studio\">studio at home</a>, it\'s not uncommon for you to have same day delivery of your audio. If you specify, you can have it edited or de breathed so all you have to do, is throw it on your video timeline, maybe add some processing, adjust the levels with your music track and away you go. A professional voice has seen your script hundreds of times and you can expect the whole process to be quick and easy.<br>\r\nDon\'t risk damaging your reputation. let the voice be as strong and powerful as your brand. If you have any questions about voiceover and if you\'d like to book my services, please <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>!\r\n</p>', 'Oct 17', '1', 'why-use-a-voiceover', '0', '', 'Why use a voiceover? Good question.', '', '<p>So, using a professional voiceover artist can be expensive if you don\'t plan everything out. But it needn\'t be. And, perhaps an additional question should be asked: how much potential profit are you risking by taking cheap shortcuts with your advertising campaigns. I think there are some great up-and-coming voiceover artists with lower rates, but the very cheap ones are rarely worth the money. \r\n</p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(793, 'how-to-do-cartoon-voiceover', 'How to Do Cartoon Voiceovers', '<p>Ever wanted to get into the world of voice over for animation?</p>', 'blog', 'Want to get into cartoon voiceovers? Guy Harris shares expert tips, character styles, warm-ups, and gear advice for becoming a successful animation VO.', '<h2>How to Do Cartoon Voiceovers</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™ve found your way to this blog post then youâ€™re either interested in how to do cartoon voiceovers or youâ€™re interested in hiring Guy Harris for his formidable cartoon voiceover skills... If youâ€™re making a cartoon, <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a> with Guy and ask him to read a sample of your cartoon script. You can also listen to a range of Guyâ€™s different voices on his <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover Page\">Character Voiceover</a> Showreels. Otherwise, keep reading if youâ€™d like to learn a few tips about how to do professional cartoon voice overs.</p>', '<h2>Cartoon Voiceover Acting is Acting</h2>\r\n<p>Perhaps it goes without saying, but voiceover is acting. Itâ€™s vital to keep this in mind when doing cartoon voice overs.  Itâ€™s not just about having a rich voice and speaking clearly; you have to convey a range of emotions, react to imaginary situations, and respond to other voiceover actors. If the cartoon hasnâ€™t been animated yet, you will have to try your best to imagine yourself in the scene. If you can imagine the scene clearly, it will be easier to give a believable voiceover performance.</p>', 'acting.jpg', 'toy-story-woddy.jpg', 'How to Do Cartoon Voiceovers â€“ Beginner Tips', '<p>If you are providing voiceover work for a cartoon character that was previously voiced by someone else, then you have to listen very carefully to the previous voiceover actorâ€™s work. Listen to the intricacies of the characterâ€™s voice, making note of their accent, tone, pitch, speed, etc. Mimicry comes naturally to some of us, but it is possible to learn it. Often, a good way of working out how to make your own voice sound like someone elseâ€™s is to figure out whether the voice is coming from deep down in the chest and the throat, or if it is coming from the throat on its own, or perhaps it is coming from the nose and it has a nasally N sound running through it. If youâ€™d like to hear how itâ€™s done, give Guyâ€™s <a href=\"star-wars-character-voices\" title=\"Star Wars impressions\">Star Wars impressions</a> a listen.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>I hope this has helped a few readers better understand how to do a cartoon voiceover. Cartoons are more popular than ever â€” for children and adults alike â€” so itâ€™s a brilliant industry for any actor to get involved with.</p>', '', '3', 'How to Do Cartoon Voiceovers', '0', '', 'How to Do Cartoon Voiceovers', '', '<h2>Donâ€™t Be Afraid to Gesticulate</h2>\r\n<p>If you watch any videos of voiceover actors recording lines for a cartoon, youâ€™ll notice that most of them move their arms around and often move in other ways that mirror how their cartoon characters behave. As long as you donâ€™t hit the microphone when youâ€™re gesticulating, it can be a great way for you to get into character. Making realistic facial expressions and gesticulations helps you believe what youâ€™re saying, and it helps you place yourself in the cartoon scene more effectively. </p>', '<h2>Listen Carefully</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re unsure about a scene, take a moment to think about your cartoon characterâ€™s situation, listening to the other characters in the scene. When you listen to cartoon voiceovers that donâ€™t work, the main thing youâ€™ll notice is that the characters donâ€™t seem to be reacting to each other. Often, thereâ€™s an awkward pause or their tone of voice doesnâ€™t seem to reflect the situation. Good voiceover actors listen to the scene theyâ€™re in, especially to the other voiceover actors theyâ€™re working with. Taking a moment to really think about the scene can sometimes help you find the right tone of voice to deliver a brilliant cartoon voiceover performance. </p>', '', '', 'listen-carefully.jpg', 'acting.jpg', '', ''),
(796, 'questions-about-voiceover-agencies', 'Voiceover Agencies - The Facts', '<p>Whether youâ€™re looking to hire voiceover actors or youâ€™re trying to make a successful career as one, youâ€™ve probably considered getting in touch with a voiceover agency. This brief guide will hopefully answer a lot of your questions about voiceover agencies.</p>', '', 'Questions About Voiceover Agencies. Just starting out and wondering if you need an agent? A guide to agencies and the pros and cons of having one.', '<h2>What are Voiceover Agencies?</h2>\r\n<p>Voiceover agencies represent a range of voiceover actors; they catalogue the various abilities of their clients and look for appropriate voiceover work for them. They also serve as a mediator between their clients and the various businesses and broadcasting companies who would like to hire them, negotiating contracts on their behalf.</p>\r\n', '<h2>Who Uses Voiceover Agencies?</h2>\r\n<p>Voiceover agencies are used by a huge range of people across many different industries. Here is a small, non-exhaustive list of the kinds of people who use voiceover agencies:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Advertising agencies</li>\r\n<li  style=\"font-size: 18px;\" >Individual businesses making TV and radio ads</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Radiobroadcasters</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Cartoon animators</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Childrenâ€™s toy manufacturers</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Travel companies </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">App designers</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Computer game companies</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Foreign film companies in need of dubbed voiceovers</li>\r\n\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'questions-about-voiceover-agencies.jpg', 'guide-to-becoming-a-voiceover-artist2.jpg', 'Common Questions About Voiceover Agencies Answered', '<br>\r\n\r\n<p>Voiceover agencies are also used by the voice actors they represent. If an agency is prestigious enough, it may make more sense to you as an actor to have them represent you as opposed to representing yourself. Perhaps youâ€™re just starting out and you have a lot of talent but no reputation in the industry to show off your abilities. This is where a voiceover agency could prove very useful, as it can help burgeoning voiceover actors to get a few jobs under their belts.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>What are the Pros and Cons to Using Agencies?</h2>\r\n<p>No two agencies are exactly the same, so everything in this section should be taken lightly. There are some general pros and cons to voiceover agencies that you may like to consider:</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><b>Pros for actors</b></p>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Agencies are a great way to generate work for actors as they have far-reaching marketing strategies and industry connections. </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Voiceover agencies are ideal for people new to the industry who donâ€™t know what to charge or how to find work.</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">As agencies do all of their own marketing, they are great for people who have other jobs or donâ€™t want to spend any time marketing themselves and are happy to take whichever jobs come their way.</li>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><b>Cons for actors</b></p>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Agencies have large rosters of clients (other voiceover actors) so you may be forced to compete with a lot of similar people â€” especially if the agency has a lot of voice actors similar to you. Depending on the agency and your range of voices, you may be quite far down the pecking order.</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">You wonâ€™t have as much control over the different jobs you do. Of course, you can always say no to work, so youâ€™ll have control in that way, but as with the point above, you maybe not be considered for certain jobs because the agency has put you into certain niches in relation to their different clients. For example, even if you can do 100 different voices, you may only ever receive work for 10 of them because this is where you fit into the agencyâ€™s wider roster of clients. </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Once youâ€™re an established voiceover actor, you may not need an agency to find you work, so you will be needlessly haemorrhaging money in fees to the agency for getting you work you might have been able to get on your own. </li>\r\n<br>\r\n<p><b>Pros for businesses</b></p>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Agencies can be the quickest way to find a good voiceover actor as they will have discerning recruitment practices that ensure they only hire people who are right for the job.</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Although agencies often charge more than independent voiceover artists, their prices are often much clearer and may even be available on their website without having to ask for a bespoke quote.</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">If you are likely to need a few different voiceover actors at once, it may work out better to go straight to an agency as opposed to taking the time to find each different voice independently. Agencies know their clientsâ€™ different abilities intimately and will be able to recommend the right people for the job.</li>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n<p><b>Cons for businesses</b></p>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">To account for the agencyâ€™s fee, you will often pay more for a voiceover actor from an agency than for an independent voiceover actor who negotiates their own prices. </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">You will have to do all of your dealings with the agency, which can slow things down a little. If youâ€™re in a hurry, this can be a huge negative. Working with a voiceover actor like Guy, who you can talk to directly, usually means that a job can be completed on the same day it is asked for. </li>\r\n\r\n<p>Voiceover agencies are a vital part of the industry and they may be the right choice for you, so I hope this guide has proven useful. But donâ€™t stop here, carry on researching before you make any big decisions! It may even be worth contacting a few agencies to ask them how they work. <br>\r\nIf youâ€™re interested in some voiceover work and would like to work directly with Guy, then feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">get in touch</a> and to listen to a range of his different voices on his <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy Commercial Showreel!\">commercial showreel!</a></p>', 'Nov 2017', '3', 'Questions About Voiceover Agencies', '0', '', 'Llooking to hire VoiceOver actors?', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(797, 'guide-to-becoming-a-voiceover-artist', 'Becoming a Voiceover Artist?', '<p>Youâ€™ve found your way to this page either because youâ€™re interested in becoming a voiceover artist or because youâ€™re interested in hiring one. If itâ€™s the later, please feel free to contact Guy and request a free sample to hear whether his voice is right for your brand. It always helps to have natural talent in the voiceover industry, but talent will only get you so far; hopefully, this guide will answer a few of the big questions about what voice over artists do and how to pursue a career in voiceover.</p>', '', 'Youâ€™ve found your way to this page either because youâ€™re interested in becoming a voiceover artist or because youâ€™re interested in hiring one. ', '<h2>What Do Voiceover Artists Do?</h2>\r\n<p>Because itâ€™s not a very common career, voiceover artists are often asked to describe or explain what they do on a daily basis. The answer isnâ€™t actually that straightforward as voiceover artists work in radio and TV advertisements, films, TV programs, cartoons, computer games, apps, podcasts, recordings on public transport, voice recordings on childrenâ€™s toys, talking books for children, corporate phone messages, voice recordings for theatre shows, voice-dubbing on foreign-language filmsâ€¦ the list goes on. If anyone requires a voice recording for their product or service, they usually employ a voiceover artist to help them. </p>', '<p>Of course, a voiceover artist may choose to specialise in one particular area, but itâ€™s usually best to broaden your skillset as much as possible so that you can take on more work. Not only will a wider repertoire of voices and work experience make for a better career â€” itâ€™s also much more fun! There are so many other jobs you could do instead of voiceover work, so hopefully having a good time and enjoying what you do is a big reason why youâ€™re interested in the voiceover industry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For a better idea of the different jobs you may be asked to do in the voiceover industry, take a look at some of Guyâ€™s showreels across a range of industries:</p>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial voiceover\">Commercial voiceover</a> </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\"  title=\"Movie trailer voiceover\">Movie trailer voiceover</a></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"on-hold-voice\"  title=\"Company on-hold voiceover\">Company on-hold voiceover</a></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"voiceover-imaging\"  title=\"Voiceover imaging\">Voiceover imaging</a></li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\"><a href=\"santa-voice\"  title=\"Santa Voicever\">Santa,</a> <a href=\"halloween-voice\"  title=\"Halloween Voice\">Halloween,</a> and other seasonal voiceover jobs</li>\r\n<p>You may also be asked to do a range of cartoon voices and impressions of well-known voices. Take a look at Guyâ€™s character voice showreel for some inspiration:</p>', 'guide-to-becoming-a-voiceover-artist.jpg', 'Ad85PPvSfbc', 'How to Become a Voiceover Artist â€“ Starterâ€™s Guide', '<p>Work on a few standard voices, as well as a non-regional British or American voice, as these voices are often popular for countrywide advertisement campaigns. You donâ€™t have to sound just like the other people in the business, but customers may ask you to do certain standard accents and kinds of voices, so itâ€™s good to have them in your repertoire. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>To record yourself, youâ€™ll need a decent microphone, a sound recording program on your computer, and a pop filter to cut off the loud popping sounds you sometimes get from plosive letters like P, B, D, K, and T. If youâ€™re just recording yourself at home, then a walk-in closet full of clothes is a good substitute for a soundproof recording booth. Later, when youâ€™ve getting lots of paid work, you can fork out the big bucks for your own recording studio!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Once youâ€™ve worked on your talents and are confident with your abilities, you may have to take some free jobs to fill out your portfolio before you can start getting paid work. However, make sure you donâ€™t undervalue your service once you start charging clients; voiceover work is a real skill, and the right voice can make a huge difference to a product, film, advertisement campaign, etc. </p>', 'Nov 2017', '1', 'Guide to Becoming a Voiceover Artist', '0', '', 'A guide to getting into Voiceover.', '', '<h2>Voiceover, Voice Over, Voice-over: are there other names for voiceover artists?</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re going to work in the voiceover industry, youâ€™re probably going to see various different ways of spelling it. The main variations are voice over, voiceover, and voice-over. There definitely isnâ€™t a consensus about which is the correct spelling, and perhaps this kind of linguistic pedantry isnâ€™t important to you, but as youâ€™ll be marketing yourself in the industry, it is worth giving it a little thought. </p>\r\n<p>Merriam-Webster and the Oxford English Dictionary both list the hyphenated version as correct: voice-over. However, are large proportion of the industry seems to prefer voiceover. There is a similar debate about whether to call it voiceover artist, voice acting, voiceover acting, etc. Perhaps the ultimate decider should be the potential customers who search for your service using Google. Here are the approximate global monthly searches for the various voiceover terms:</p>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Voice acting has between 10k and 100k searches each month </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Voice over artist has between 1K and 10K searches each month </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Voice over agencies has between 1K and 10K searches each month </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Voiceovers has between 1K and 10K searches each month </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Voice talent (slightly vaguer) has between 1K and 10K searches each month </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Professional voice over has between 100 and 1K searches each month </li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Professional voice over artist has between 10 and 100 searches each month </li>\r\n<p>So, even if you donâ€™t really care about the linguistic nitty gritty, itâ€™s pays to make sure your website and business cards use the terms most people are familiar with. </p>', '<h2>How to Become a Voiceover Artist</h2>\r\n \r\n<p>If you have a talent for performing different voices â€” perhaps youâ€™re great at impressions, or perhaps you have a lovely, rich voice that is ideal for radio and television advertisements â€” then the next step for you is practice. A lot of practice. Natural talent has given you an interest in voiceover work, but it will only get you so far. You need to try a bunch of different voices, really experimenting with your own range, tone, various accents, etc. The best way to do this is to make lots of recordings of your own voice and play them back. Listen to yourself with a critical ear, comparing your recordings to other professional voiceover artists, asking yourself whether your voice is too high, too deep, whether you are enunciating the words clearly enough, etc. </p>\r\n', '', '', 'guide-to-becoming-a-voiceover-artist2.jpg', 'guide-to-becoming-a-voiceover-artist3.jpg', '', ''),
(804, 'what-is-explainer-video-voiceover', 'Explaining the Explainer Video Voice?', '<p>On the VoiceoverGuy blog and news page, weâ€™re trying to explain and demystify a range of different voiceover styles, techniques, and genres. This blog post will look at explainer videos, exploring how they work, how effective they can be, and how important the voiceover element is to the finished product. If youâ€™re especially interested in the subject and would like to book Guyâ€™s services, feel free to get in touch. You may also like to have a look at the extensive range of <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\"  title=\"Explainer Videos\">Explainer Videos</a>  featuring Guyâ€™s voiceover work. Guy will provide you with a sample of your script so that you can be sure he is right for your brand â€” and if heâ€™s not quite the right fit, heâ€™ll happily recommend someone who is!</p>', 'natural conversational', 'What is Explainer Video Voiceover? Who uses explainer videos? Why they work and how you can find the perfect Male Voiceover for your next Explainer.', '<h2>What is an Explainer Video?</h2>\r\n<p>An explainer video is a short video that explains an idea, collection of data, or perhaps a product/service as concisely as possible. Explainer videos are often animated, as this style works well with graphs, figures, and any other explanatory content. \r\nExplainer videos are usually short â€” often between 90 and 120 seconds â€” and they usually have a very clear message. Good explainer videos use a concise â€˜whyâ€™, â€˜howâ€™, and â€˜whatâ€™ structure to explain their subject matter. </p>\r\n', '<br>\r\n<p>There is a huge difference between a well-handled explainer video and a poorly handed one; have you ever noticed the difference between a good teacher and a terrible teacher? A good teacher can make any subject seem easy and accessible. A good explainer video works in the same way, and this video about conserving water is a great example:</p>', 'what-is-explainer-video-voiceover.jpg', '4rOrSN8YoQM', 'What Is an Explainer Video Voiceover? Answer here', '', '', '1', 'Explain the explainer voiceover', '5', '', 'What is the Explainer Video Voiceover?', '', '<h2>How Important is Voiceover in Explainer Videos?</h2>\r\n \r\n<p>All of the best explainer videos use straightforward language with clear, high-quality voiceover work. This is where Guy Harris comes in! Voiceover is an integral part of any explainer video as it performs the bulk of the explanatory work, with the visuals simply backing it up. A good explainer video script should be so clear and concise that it gets the message across even if someone is only listening to the video. The tone of voice should also suit the subject matter or the brand of the company making the video. </p>\r\n', '<h2>Infographic Videos â€” Explaining Statistics</h2>\r\n \r\n<p>Infographics are an incredibly popular medium because they provide very fast, effective way to illustrate, compare, and contrast a range of facts and statistics. An explainer video may be an animated version of an infographic and this can be a brilliant way for a company to explain and contextualise the statistics it has generated from a recent survey or research project. If you have complicated data and youâ€™re looking for a way to do it justice and get the message out there, then an animated explainer video might be exactly what you need. </p>\r\n', '', '<h2>Explain Your Unique Service</h2>\r\n<p>Explainer videos can also serve another purpose: they are a brilliant way for businesses with unique or complex products or services to explain exactly what they do. If your product or service is brilliant, but its benefits arenâ€™t immediately obvious, it may be a good idea to make a video that explains just how good your product or service is. In this way, your explainer video also serves as an advertisement for your business, but it is hopefully fascinating enough for people to share with others they think might be interested. Take a look at the Renault UK Service video below to see how itâ€™s done:</h2>\r\n<p>In many markets, the only way to be successful is to have a unique selling point â€” something that sets your product or service apart from the rest. If you do have the perfect USP, then an explainer video may be the perfect way for you to get that message across to potential customers. Sometimes explainer videos are the best way to ensure potential customers understand just how good your service is. \r\n<br><br>\r\n\r\n<p>I hope this blog post has been useful and that it has helped a few readers understand the merits of a well-made explainer video. If you have any questions or would like to book Guyâ€™s voiceover services, please <a href=\"contact-guy\"  title=\"Get in touch!\">get in touch!</a></p>', 'how-important-is-voiceover-in-explainer-videos.jpg', 'infographic-videos.jpg', '', '');
INSERT INTO `messages2` (`id`, `url`, `page_title`, `info`, `search_terms`, `page_desc`, `text1`, `text2`, `image`, `video`, `meta_title`, `bottomtext`, `date`, `whatvideo`, `alt`, `rating`, `twitter`, `hometext`, `santa`, `ntext1`, `ntext2`, `ntext3`, `ntext4`, `nimage1`, `nimage2`, `nimage3`, `nimage4`) VALUES
(806, 'voice-over-videos-animals', 'Voice Over Videos - Animals', '<h2>Voice Over Videos: Animals</h2>\r\n<p>This blog post is a fun but practical look at animal voice over videos. Weâ€™ll look what animal voiceover is, some iconic animal voiceover work, and weâ€™ll discuss some of the best ways of capturing animalsâ€™ voices. This blog post is relevant to aspiring voiceover artists and to anyone making videos who requires professional animal voiceover (such as film or advertising producers). If youâ€™re interested in hiring Guy for his animal voiceover prowess, please feel free to <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy\"  title=\"Get in touch\">get in touch.</a> Guy is happy to read a sample of your script for you, so that you can decide whether or not his voice is right for your film/brand.  </p>', '', 'Animalâ€‘led videos deserve voiceovers that talk their talk. Guyâ€¯Harris delivers fun, personable voiceovers for wildlife and animal explainer films.', '<h2>What Exactly is an Animal Voiceover Video?</h2>\r\n<p>An animal voice over video is any video featuring animals where voiceover actors provide the voices of the animals. These videos can be live action â€” filming live animals and dubbing the voiceover work over the top, or they can be animated (cartoon, CGI, stop animation, etc.). Animal characters are especially popular with children, and this is something Disney, Pixar, Studio Ghibli, etc. have all tapped into. </p>\r\n', '<h2>The Most Iconic Animal Voiceover Work</h2>\r\n<p>It is really helpful, in any discussion of animal voiceover, to look at some of the best iconic examples. Any attempt to mention the best animal voice-over work is subjective, so weâ€™ll just mention a few of the most famous characters and the voiceover actors responsible. The Lion Kingâ€™s Mufasa was voiced by James Earl Jones (also the voice of Darth Vader) and his rich, regal voice was a fan favourite for Simbaâ€™s father and the King of the Savanna. In fact, Jones did such a brilliant job that he has been recast as Mufasa in the new live-action production of The Lion King. </p>\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'voice-over-videos-animals1.jpg', 'voice-over-videos-animals4.jpg', 'Voiceover for Animal Videos â€“ Natural, Fun, Warm Delivery', '<br>\r\n<p>When youâ€™re taking approach (B), it may help to make a list of the different characteristics you associate with the animal, humanizing the animal as much as possible. When you have a list of characteristics, you can start to imagine what kind of person the animal might sound like. Tip: it may help to imagine what job your animal character would have if it were a person, or what socio-political background it might come from. The fastest route to your animal characterâ€™s voice may be to do an accent from the part of the world this animal is from. For instance, itâ€™s an obvious choice to do a friendly Australian accent if youâ€™re asked to provide voiceover for a kangaroo character! </p>\r\n\r\n<p>We hope this animal voiceover guide has been interesting and informative. If youâ€™re an aspiring voiceover artist and you need a little inspiration, make sure you take a look Guyâ€™s <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover\"  title=\"character voiceover reel\">character voiceover reel. </a> And if youâ€™d like Guy to provide animal voiceover for your upcoming production, please <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy\"  title=\"Get in touch\">get in touch.</a></p>', '', '3', 'Voice Over Videos: Animals', '0', '', 'Voice Over Videos: Animals', '', '<p>Donald Duckâ€™s raspy voice is as iconic as voiceover work gets. It works because although heâ€™s speaking English, his voice still quacks and clearly resembles the sounds ducks make. The original voiceover actor responsible for Donald Duck was Clarence Nash, who spent his childhood imitating the noises made by birds and farmyard animals. Itâ€™s difficult to imagine a world without Donald Duckâ€™s unique voice, but itâ€™s safe to assume that weâ€™d have had a very different Donald Duck without Clarence Nashâ€™s excellent voiceover work!\r\nScooby-Doo is another iconic character with a very recognisable voice. This mystery-solving Great Dane is famous for being the clumsiest, most cowardly member of his investigative team and his voice sounds as though someone actually taught a dog how to talk in the real world. A big part of what works about Scooby-Dooâ€™s voice is similar to what works with Donald Duckâ€™s: he speaks English words (kind of), but he sounds like a dog! We wouldnâ€™t have Scooby-Dooâ€™s iconic voice if it wasnâ€™t for Don Messick, the legendary voice actor who was also responsible for Droopy, Muttley, and Papa Smurf!<p>', '<p>We could spend ours writing about the various classic cartoon animal characters and the voiceover actors behind them, but it might also help to look at a more recent animal character. Puss in Boots from the Shrek series was an immediate hit with fans. Even though he doesnâ€™t sound like a cat, per se, there was something about Antonio Banderasâ€™s dulcet Spanish voice that seems to ring true with the character.</p>', '<h2>How to Capture Animalsâ€™ Voices </h2>\r\n<p>There are countless different ways to capture an animalâ€™s. However, we can split up the approach into roughly two different camps: (A) make your voiceover sound like the animal (as with Donald Duck and Scooby-Doo), or (B) make your voice suit the humanised version of the animal youâ€™re providing voiceover work for (as with Mufasaâ€™s regal tones and Puss in Bootâ€™s feisty Spanish accent). Both approaches work and they arenâ€™t really in opposition to each other â€“ they just work in different contexts. \r\nWhen youâ€™re taking approach (A), the best thing you can do is listen to recordings of the animal youâ€™ve been asked to provide voiceover for. Do impressions of their noises and see if you can incorporate these noises into your voiceover. One piece of advice is to avoid sacrificing too much clarity and diction when performing your animal voice; itâ€™s important to sound like the animal, but itâ€™s more important for the audience to be able understand you â€” especially if youâ€™re providing voiceover work for an advertisement!</p>\r\n', '', 'voice-over-videos-animals2.jpg', 'voice-over-videos-animals5.jpg', 'voice-over-videos-animals3.jpg', ''),
(807, 'guide-to-regional-english-accents', 'A guide to regional English accents', '<p>\r\n<br>The term â€˜English accentâ€™ means different things to different people. To Americans, an â€˜English accentâ€™ is interchangeable with â€˜British accentâ€™ and it usually means a posh Southern English accent, or a kind of Cockney accent found only on EastEnders or Oliver Twist. But there are so many different English accents for aspiring voiceover actors to practice and perfect. \r\nIn Britain, travelling twenty minutes in the car can bring you to people with a drastically different accent. Mastering as many different accents as possible will ensure you get more work, and itâ€™s also a really satisfying skill to practice. In this British voice over guide, weâ€™ll look specifically at several different English regional accents, discussing what makes them unique and giving you a few pointers.</p>', '', 'Guide to regional English accents - Looking for a career in Voiceover? Want to know how regional accents fit into your new job? Heres a handy guide.', '<h2>Short Cuts to an â€˜Englishâ€™ Accent</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re from anywhere outside of England, it can be tricky to pin down a general-purpose English voice-over accent. But as this is one of the most widely sought-after accents, itâ€™s worth developing. It doesnâ€™t help that there are countless distinct English accents, including Geordie, Yorkshire, Scouse, Cockney, Manchester, Kentishâ€¦ the list goes on. There are countless differences between these different accents, but there are some general rules that tend to occur across most English accents. If youâ€™re trying to get the basics of a standard English accent, remember the following three rules:</p>\r\n', '<br><p>\r\n1)	Pronounce the â€˜Râ€™ at the end of words as an â€˜ahâ€™. So, car is â€˜kaaâ€™ and â€˜RPâ€™ is â€˜ah-peeâ€™. An obvious exception to this is the West Country accent, where the â€˜Râ€™ is emphasised as â€˜Arrrâ€™ (a little like a pirate).<br>\r\n2)	Allow your vowels to be longer than with most other accents in the British Isles, such as with Welsh, Scottish, Irish, and Northern Irish accents. So, â€˜wowâ€™ is said with your mouth wide open so that it sounds full and round. </p>\r\n', 'english-accents1.jpg', 'english-accents2.jpg', 'Regional English Accent Guide â€“ Voiceover Artist Tips', '<h2>Geordie (From Newcastle upon Tyne)</h2>\r\n<p>-	Say â€˜ganâ€™ instead of â€˜goâ€™ and â€˜ganninâ€™ instead of â€˜goingâ€™. <br>\r\n-	For â€˜alrightâ€™, say â€˜ah-reetâ€™.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Mancunian (From Manchester)</h2>\r\n<p>- Shorten some of your vowels. â€˜Lovelyâ€™ becomes â€˜luv-lehâ€™.<br>\r\n-	Replace â€˜thâ€™ with an â€˜Fâ€™ or a â€˜Vâ€™ sound. So â€˜withâ€™ becomes â€˜wivâ€™, which rhymes with give.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Scouse (From Liverpool)</h2>\r\n<p>-	Pronounce the â€˜Tâ€™ sound in many words as a fricative, which has an â€˜Sâ€™ sound in it. It is very hard to transcribe exactly what this sounds like, but try imagining â€˜seâ€™ on the end of the word. So â€˜rightâ€™ becomes â€˜rightseâ€™. </p>\r\n<p>-	Pronounce a â€˜Kâ€™ sound right in the middle of your throat, and allow it to crackle slightly. As it is particularly difficult to describe the Scouse accent, you may like to check out this English \r\nLike a Native video.<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=R_C4PDSfQJA\" title=\"English Like a Native video.\">English Like a Native video.</a></p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>West Country (Cornwall, Devon, Dorset, Somerset, Gloucestershire, and Wiltshire)</h2>\r\n<p>-	Pronounce the rhotic â€˜Râ€™ in the middle and end of words. This is a hard â€˜Râ€™ sound that does not appear in most other accents in England â€” especially at the end of words. So, â€˜areâ€™ is â€˜arrâ€™ and â€˜loverâ€™ is â€˜love-errâ€™.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<h2>The RP Accent</h2>\r\n<p>With all of this chat about regional accents, weâ€™ve neglected RP, which is sometimes called BBC English or The Queenâ€™s English. RP stands for â€œReceived Pronunciationâ€ and it sounds reasonably posh to most British ears. Although RP is loosely defined as the regionally neutral accent of England, it is most often found in the south. For a comprehensive exploration of the RP accent, you may like to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PcIX-U5w5Ws\" title=\"watch this video.\">watch this video.</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Thatâ€™s all we have time for in this guide to English accents. As times goes on, there will be more guides to various British accents. If youâ€™re interested in Guyâ€™s voiceover skills, make sure to <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy\"  title=\"Get in touch\">get in touch</a> and request a sample of his work. </p>', '', '3', '', '0', '', 'Guide to regional English accents', '', '<br>\r\n<p>3)	Similarly, make sure to emphasise the â€˜Wâ€™ at the end of words. So, â€˜wowâ€™ sounds like â€˜Wuh-aah-wuhâ€™. \r\nThere are so many intricacies to think about, but these three starting points may get you on the right track. If youâ€™re a voice-over actor and an accent isnâ€™t coming naturally to you, sometimes all you need to do is find a way into the accent. Perhaps thinking about the â€˜Râ€™ sounds at the end of words as â€˜ahâ€™ will help you, or perhaps remembering to round and emphasise the â€˜Wâ€™ sound at the end of words will help you. Once youâ€™ve found your way into an accent, all you have to do is practice it as much as possible. Read out scripts and sections from books to test your accent out on as many different words as possible. And record yourself often so that you can listen back with a critical ear. \r\n</p>', '', '', '<h2>Regional English Accents</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>There are so many different English accents to consider that we wonâ€™t have nearly enough time to go through them. Instead, letâ€™s consider a couple of tips for a few of the more common regions to help you find your way into the accent. As always, there are so many different kinds of speakers and other factors that determine how people sound, so these guidelines are by no means perfect.</p>', 'english-accents4.jpg', '', '', 'english-accents3.jpg'),
(808, 'the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up', 'Setting up your Recording studio', '<p>Here at Voiceover Studio Finder, we have extensive experience working in the recording industry\r\nand have seen countless different recording studio set-ups over the years. So, we decided to put\r\ntogether this brief guide to the perfect recording studio set-up. The intricacies of sound recording\r\ntechnology canâ€™t be covered in one article, so we hope that this brief guide can point a few budding\r\nenthusiasts in the right direction. Please <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">get in touch</a> if you have any questions or if youâ€™d like to add\r\nyour own voiceover recording studio to our network!</p>', '', 'The perfect recording studio set up. Starting out oil Voiceover? Want to know what you need to buy? How to set it up? Pros and Cons a handy guide.', '<h2>Go Big: Choose the right room</h2>\r\n<p>Generally speaking, the bigger the recording space the better. A larger room will not only make\r\nroom for groups of people (which is especially important if you ever want to record a live band, for\r\nexample), it will also make for better acoustics. Making a larger recording studio now could also save\r\nyou upgrading later on, once you start to book plenty of recording sessions. Obviously, you may have\r\nto just work with the space you have, but definitely spring for a larger room if you can afford it.\r\nIdeally, youâ€™re looking for a room with good acoustics. As we said above, the larger the room the\r\nbetter, but there are other specific conditions that ensure good acoustics, such as high ceilings and\r\nhard (brick or concrete) walls that are as asymmetrical as possible. Itâ€™s also ideal for it to be on the\r\nground floor as footsteps are much quieter on the ground floor than on floorboards.</p>', '<h2>Give Your Room an Acoustic Treatment</h2>\r\n<p>Churches and Cathedrals have especially good acoustics\r\nIf you want to stand out from the competition and make everyone who chooses your studio sound great, itâ€™s not enough to find the perfect room; youâ€™ll also need to give the room an acoustic treatment. Donâ€™t worry, this isnâ€™t as daunting as it sounds. \r\nHave you ever noticed the black or dark grey foam panels in recording studios? These panels are used to absorb sound, reducing the natural reverb in a room. This allows you to record only the desired voiceover or music without any unwanted reverb. However, if you overuse foam panels you can remove all of the natural reverb in a room; the result can make sound recordings unnaturally flat. This is where diffusors come in. Diffusors help scatter sound in a controlled way, allowing you to obtain a full, balanced range of sound frequencies. This topic can get complicated and warrants its own blog post, but hopefully weâ€™ve got you thinking along the right lines.</p>', 'the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up.jpg', 'the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up.jpg', 'The Perfect Voiceover Recording Studio Setup Guide', '<br>\r\n<p>Thatâ€™s everything in this brief guide to the perfect recording studio set-up. We could of course write an extensive guide ten times the size, but we hope this introduction sets a few readers off in the right direction!</p>', '', '3', 'The perfect recording studio set up', '3', '', 'The perfect recording studio set up', '', '<h2>Consider Your Location</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re building your recording studio at home, then you donâ€™t really have a choice when it comes to location. However, if youâ€™re looking for a suitable site, then the potential noise from the surrounding area should be carefully considered. For example, cars and other vehicles can produce a lot of noise, especially during rush hour. Add honking horns into the mix and there could be a problem. To combat that, make sure your studio is as far away from a road as possible â€” even if this just means situating the studio on the back of the property, away from the road. </p>\r\n<p>Nature has its own array of noisy interruptions, such as wind, rain, birds, etc. Avoid noisy winds by ensuring your studio site isnâ€™t in an exposed position. Trees can provide a lot of cover from wind, but their leaves also rustle loudly in the wind and they provide a habitat for birds and insects, which can make a lot of noise of their own. Rain can be very noisy if the roof is hollow or made from plastic or corrugated metal. </p>', '<h2>Security for Your Studio</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>If youâ€™ve managed to find a secluded location, then youâ€™re probably onto a winner. However, there is a security risk that comes with this, as your studio will be filled with expensive equipment that may attract the attention of thieves. Thieves are more likely to target secluded locations, so make sure you install a security system, motion-sensor lights, and anything else you need to keep your studio secure. </p>', '<h2>Hardware</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>In this article, we wonâ€™t give you a direct brand endorsement for any specific brand of microphone or recording equipment, as there are so many great set-ups, and itâ€™s more about how you put it all together. With recording hardware, generally speaking you get what you pay for, but make sure to do a thorough price comparison and read reviews before making any big investments. One thing that is essential for vocal recordings â€” especially voiceover work â€” is a pop filter (or a pop shield). These help filter out the more abrupt plosive sounds in speech, especially with certain words with P, B, D, K, and T in them. The good news is that pop filters are very cheap and they last forever.</p>', '<h2>Software</h2>\r\n<p>As there is a lot to consider, we will do a more in-depth article all about recording software in the near future and ensure that we link to it here. </p>', 'the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up2.jpg', 'the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up3.jpg', 'the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up4.jpg', 'the-perfect-recording-studio-set-up.jpg'),
(809, 'which-recording-studio-software-is-best', 'The Best Recording Studio Software?', '<p>Previously, weâ€™ve talked a lot about how you can set up the perfect recording studio, and we felt it\r\nwould be useful to write a follow-up guide that covers the best recording studio software. Music\r\nproduction software comes in so many different varieties that it can be tricky to figure out which\r\none will best suit your needs. Ultimately, no recording studio is best, as many have found their own\r\nniche within the recording industry. However, one particular piece of software might be the perfect\r\nfit for your needs and, hopefully, this guide will point you in the right direction.</p>', '', 'Confused about studio software? Guy Harris shares his top voiceover DAW picks with pros, cons and tips for choosing the best recording software for VO work.', '<h2>Introduction to all Digital Audio Workstation Software</h2>\r\n<p>In many cases, a piece of recording studio software is referred to as a digital audio workstation, or\r\nDAW, for short. All DAWs are designed to facilitate recording voiceover or music. Some DAWs try to\r\nmake this process as easy as possible, and some offer a multitude of functions to allow you to\r\nexperiment with and edit your recordings. But no recording software will do your job for you, as you\r\nstill need to provide excellent quality music or voiceover in the first instance. Many software\r\ncompanies will tell you that your recording software is the most important part of your studio set-\r\nup, but it usually isnâ€™t. For example, voiceover recorded with a good microphone in a room with\r\ngood acoustics onto a basic DAW will be better than voiceover recorded with a bad microphone in\r\nyour bathroom onto the most expensive DAW out there!</p>', '<h2>Garageband</h2>\r\n<p>Some version of Garageband can be found on most modern Apple computers and that might put a\r\nfew people off who are looking for the â€˜bestâ€™ professional recording studio software. However,\r\nGarageband is a great piece of software for beginners or voiceover artists who arenâ€™t looking to do\r\nanything exceptionally complicated in the editing process. Garagebandâ€™s visuals help you get a rough\r\nidea of the song or composition youâ€™re making, and it has several ready-to- go settings for voice,\r\nguitar, piano, etc. But the best thing about Garageband is that itâ€™s completely free if you own an\r\nApple computer. Itâ€™s incredible that Apple offers such a solid piece of recording software absolutely\r\nfree. If youâ€™re new to recording software, then Garageband is probably the one for you.</p>', 'which-recording-studio-software-is-best.jpg', 'which-recording-studio-software-is-best2.jpg', 'Best Recording Studio Software for Voiceovers', '<h2>Avid Pro Tools</h2>\r\n<p>For many experts in the recording industry, Pro Tools is the standard software. Some people refuse\r\nto work with anything else and might even look down on you if you donâ€™t use itâ€¦ As Pro Tools is\r\npretty much the industry default, there are school and college programs dedicated to it. As with any\r\nreally complex software, the complexity usually exists to allow you to change and edit as much as\r\npossible, but this means that there is an incredibly high level of knowledge required before you can\r\nbegin to record and edit sound at a component level. Pro Tools is available for both Apple and PC;\r\nhowever, many people complain that it is a little buggy on PC, so this is worth keeping in mind.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>We hope youâ€™ve found this article useful and that one or two readers have made their minds up\r\nabout which recording studio software is best for their needs. If youâ€™d like to register your recording\r\nstudio with Voiceover Studio Finder, please donâ€™t hesitate to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">get in touch</a></p>', '', '3', 'Which Recording Studio Software is Best?', '3', '', 'The best recording studio guide.', '', '<h2>FL Studio</h2>\r\n<p>FL Studio is also a great piece of software for beginners. As itâ€™s one of the most popular DAWs, it has\r\na lot of support and an online community where members tend to help each other out. Have a\r\nquestion about FL Studio? Chances are someone else has asked the same question already and a few\r\nhelpful experts have answered the question or made a step-by- step YouTube video. FL Studio isnâ€™t\r\nquite as user friendly as Garageband, but it is still reasonably straightforward. You may need to do a\r\nlittle reading before you get started, but FL Studio will let you do pretty much everything you could\r\nwant from a good piece of recording software!</p>', '<h2>Logic Pro</p>\r\n<p>If you have an Apple and would like more advanced software than Garageband, then Logic Pro may\r\nbe the DAW for you! Widely regarded as one of the best DAWs around, Logic Proâ€™s real selling point\r\nis its advanced interface, with countless features that allow the user to manipulate whatever theyâ€™re\r\nrecording. Another selling point for Logic Pro is that it has its own in-built MIDI composition tool that\r\nis perfect for songwriters who like to make things up as they go along. Logic Pro offers so many\r\nfeatures that you could use it for years and still find new little tricks up its sleeves.</p>', '', '', 'which-recording-studio-software-is-best3.jpg', 'which-recording-studio-software-is-best4.jpg', '', ''),
(810, 'guide-to-a-northern-irish-accent', 'Guide to a Northern Irish Accent', '<p>As voiceover artists, weâ€™re sometimes asked to perform accents outside our native region. In November, we published <a href=\"guide-to-regional-english-accents\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Guide to Regional English Accents\">a guide to regional English accents</a>, and now weâ€™re following up with this guide to the Northern Irish accent.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>This sometimes-maligned but undeniably distinctive accent is gaining popularity across TV, radio, and film. More Northern Irish talent is making it into the spotlight, and as a voice artist, it never hurts to have one more accent under your belt.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong>Quick note:</strong> I donâ€™t offer this accent professionally â€“ but Iâ€™ve created this page to help others looking to learn it or use it in their own performances. I specialise in British male voiceover work and <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voice Demos\">character voiceovers</a>, but hopefully this guide helps you sound a bit more Belfast, even if you\'re from Birmingham.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Scroll down to learn a few Northern Irish celebrity voices, regional quirks, and common sounds to practise!</p>\r\n', '', 'Master the Northern Irish accent with tips, phrases, and examples from British voiceover artist Guy Harris. Learn sounds, words, and how to practise.', '<h2>Listen to Northern Irish Celebrities</h2>\r\n<p>The first tip is to listen to as many Northern Irish celebritiesâ€™ voices as possible. Often, when weâ€™re\r\nasked to do a regional accent, weâ€™re really being asked to sound like a specific celebrity, so this is a\r\ngreat place to start. It also helps to have a specific impression in mind, instead of simply trying to do\r\nthe accent. Focusing on doing an impression of a famous Northern Irish actor or actress could give\r\nyou a way into the Northern Irish accent in general. Some well-known Northern Irish celebrities you\r\nmight like to listen to:<br>\r\n- Christine Blakely (TV presenter)<br>\r\n- Eamonn Holmes (TV presenter)<br>\r\n- Nadine Coyle (singer in Girls Aloud)<br>\r\n- Eddie Irvine (racing driver)<br>\r\n- Jamie Dornan (actor)<br>\r\n- Rory McIlroy (golfer)<br>\r\n- David Healy (footballer)<br>\r\n- Van Morrison (singer)<br>\r\n- Colin Murray (radio DJ)<br>\r\n- James Nesbitt (actor)<br>\r\n- ZÃ¶e Salmon (TV presenter)<br>\r\n- Liam Neeson (actor)<br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n', '<h2>The R Sound in Northern Irish Accents</h2>\r\n<p>One of the aspects of the Northern Irish accent that sets it apart from many other UK accents is the\r\nletter R at the end of words. All Northern Irish accents (thatâ€™s right, there are lots!) use a\r\npronounced rhotic R on words that end with the letter R. Most English regional accents (with the\r\nexception of the West Country) do not say a rhotic R at the end of a word. If you canâ€™t tell quite what\r\na rhotic R is, say the word â€˜careerâ€™. The first R you come across in the word will be rhotic and the second might not be. In Northern Irish, both Rs are rhotic. So, if you want to say the word â€˜carâ€™, say\r\nâ€˜careerâ€™ and take the â€˜eerâ€™ off the end.\r\nAnother way of capturing this sound is to say the letter R loudly and embrace your inner pirate. Say\r\nâ€˜Arrrâ€™ and really pronounce that R. Put a K in front of that pirate â€˜arrrâ€™ and youâ€™re probably on the\r\nright track!\r\n</p>\r\n', 'guide-to-a-northern-irish-accent.jpg', 'guide-to-a-northern-irish-accent2.jpg', 'Guide to a Northern Irish Accent | VoiceoverGuy', '<h2>Add a Few Northern Irish Words or Phrases</h2>\r\n<p>Even a slightly dodgy accent can be saved if you throw in a few well-known phrases. A handful of these can really help sell your performance. Here are some examples:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><strong>Wee</strong> â€“ means â€˜smallâ€™, but also used to make things sound friendlier. E.g. â€œI\'ll have a cheeky wee pint.â€</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Bout ye</strong> â€“ means â€œhow are you?â€ (Short for â€œwhat about you?â€)</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Banjaxed</strong> â€“ completely broken or knackered. â€œMy backâ€™s banjaxed!â€</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Craic</strong> â€“ means gossip/fun. â€œWhatâ€™s the craic?â€ or â€œHeâ€™s good craic.â€</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Aye</strong> â€“ just like in Scotland, it means â€œyes.â€</li>\r\n  <li><strong>Awk</strong> â€“ often used like â€œahhâ€ or â€œohhhâ€ in front of a sentence. â€œAwk sure, leave it with me.â€</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Listen to native speakers and try dropping these into your delivery naturally. And if youâ€™d like a hand with a <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voice Demos\">character voice</a> or a bespoke accent impression, <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">get in touch</a>. Iâ€™m always happy to chat!</p>\r\n', '', '3', 'British voice over: Guide to a Northern Irish Accent', '0', '', 'British Voiceover - Guide to a Northern Irish Accent', '', '<h2>The -ow Vowel Sound in Northern Irish Accents</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Another important sound youâ€™ll have to practice is the â€˜owâ€™ vowel sound. In Northern Ireland, they\r\nhave a very tight, rigid mouth when they say â€˜cowâ€™, â€˜nowâ€™, or â€˜howâ€™ and this makes the sound shorter\r\nand less round than most other UK accents. This sound is a little more like a â€˜Yâ€™ than a â€˜Wâ€™ to many\r\npeopleâ€™s ears, but itâ€™s not the same as a Y. This sound is perhaps the trickiest part of capturing the\r\nNorthern Irish accent, but itâ€™s essential.</p>\r\n<p>The â€˜owâ€™ sound also sounds a little different in the middle of a word. Take â€˜flowerâ€™, for example:\r\nwhile an RP English accent may say â€˜flaow-wuhâ€™, the Northern Irish accent says something a little like\r\nâ€˜floy-yerâ€™ or â€˜flarrâ€™. The vowel sound is shorted so much that the word sometimes sounds like one\r\nsyllable. This is a tricky sound for anyone outside of Northern Ireland to get right because no one\r\nelse does something similar. But, practice makes perfect, and make sure you listen to how the\r\nnatives say it when you start to struggle.</p>\r\n', '', '', '<h2>Need a British Male Voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for a reliable <a href=\"british-voiceover\" title=\"British Male Voiceover\">British voiceover artist</a> with 25+ years of experience, Iâ€™m happy to help. I donâ€™t offer the Northern Irish accent, but I can turn around most UK regional styles or provide <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voice Demos\">character voiceovers</a> the same day. Let me know what you need voiced!</p>\r\n', 'guide-to-a-northern-irish-accent3.jpg', '', '', ''),
(811, 'cartoon-voiceover-guide', 'Cartoon Voiceover Guide', '<p>There are so many kinds of voiceover work â€” such as <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" >commercial voiceover,</a> <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" >explainer videos, </a> <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" >film trailer voiceover, </a> etc. â€” but cartoon voiceover is usually held in the highest regard. Perhaps this is\r\nbecause cartoons have given us many of our most beloved characters, such as Homer Simpson, Bugs\r\nBunny, Donald Duck, Lisa Simpson, Eric Cartman, Stewie Griffin, and so many more. If youâ€™d like to\r\nwork on creating voiceover for memorable cartoon characters, then this guide is for you. And if\r\nyouâ€™d like to hire Guy for your cartoon production, check out his <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" >character voiceover showreels</a> or\r\n<a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" >get in touch</a> to ask him to send over a free sample of your script.\r\n</p>', '', 'Cartoon Voiceover Guide: Creating memorable characters - A great bog on how to come up with the different voices for the many projects you will be asked for.', '<h2>Watch Lots of Cartoons</h2>\r\n<p>The first thing you should do is watch a lot of cartoons! But donâ€™t just watch them â€” listen to them\r\ntoo. Listen to the different voices and imagine the voiceover artist sitting in a recording studio\r\nperforming. Keep a pen and paper handy and make notes on the various voices you hear. Note down\r\nwhen something sounds good and why, but also make note of when it doesnâ€™t sound good; you can\r\nlearn as much from peopleâ€™s mistakes as from their successes!</p>\r\n', '<h2>Think About Range Rather Than Gender</h2>\r\n<p>Bart Simpson is one of the most famous cartoon characters of all time. Bart is the quintessential\r\nnaughty little boy, yet heâ€™s voiced by a woman. Comedian and voiceover actress Nancy Cartwright is\r\nthe voice of Bart Simpson and fans of the show would be forgiven for not realising that Bart wasnâ€™t\r\nvoiced by a young boy. Cartwrightâ€™s vocal pitch and intonation is perfect for Bart Simpson; your voice\r\nmight be a good fit for someone who looks completely different to you, so make sure you keep an\r\nopen mind.</p>', 'cartoon-voiceover-guide2.jpg', 'cartoon-voiceover-guide.jpg', 'Cartoon Voiceover Guide: Creating memorable characters', '<br><p>Thatâ€™s it for this cartoon voiceover guide. Cartoon voiceover is an incredibly rewarding job and often\r\nthe voiceover actorâ€™s enjoyment is clearly evident from their performance. If you enjoy yourself,\r\nyouâ€™ll perform better â€” so make sure you have fun!</p>', '', '3', 'Cartoon Voiceover Guide: Creating memorable characters', '3', '', 'How to Create a memorable character', '', '<h2>Try a Bad Impersonation of a Famous Person</h2>\r\n<p>A good shortcut to finding a voice full of personality is to attempt an impression a famous person or\r\ncharacter. Stewie from Family Guy was loosely based on Rex Harrison, and Stimpy from Ren &amp;\r\nStimpy was based on Peter Lorre. Find an actor or actress who already has lots of character and try\r\nan exaggerated impression of them. Even if your impression isnâ€™t very good, the attempt has\r\nprobably pushed your voice in several interesting ways, giving you a really distinctive voice.</p>', '<h2>Study the Drawings of Your Character</h2>\r\n<p>When trying to pull a characterâ€™s voice out of thin air, itâ€™s often helpful to study any drawings the\r\nanimators have of your character. Even if they havenâ€™t made the animation yet, there will be plenty\r\nof concept art for you to look at. Look at the character and consider where their voice is most likely\r\nto come from. Their nose? Their throat? Deep down in their stomach? Take Santa Clause as an\r\nexample. <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Guyâ€™s Santa voiceover\">Guyâ€™s Santa voiceover</a>  is deep and booming, as Santa has a rather round figure and he\r\nlooks like his voice would be just as big and round. Itâ€™s no coincidence that most people who perform\r\nthe voice of Santa opt for a deep voice that comes from the belly: this voice really fits the characterâ€™s\r\nappearance. Similarly, if your character is a tiny little mouse, you should probably make your voice\r\nhigh-pitched and nasal. Thinking about your cartoon characterâ€™s appearance can give you more than\r\nenough information to come up with a believable voice for them.</p>', '<h2>Think About Your Characterâ€™s Personality</h2>\r\n<p>The last thing that makes a huge difference to any cartoon characterâ€™s voice is their personality.\r\nHomer Simpson is a donut-eating, beer-guzzling buffoon, but heâ€™s also a sweet man, underneath it\r\nall. Homerâ€™s voice captures his personality perfectly. However, if you watch some of the early\r\nSimpsons episodes, youâ€™ll notice that Dan Castellaneta hadnâ€™t quite honed his Homer Simpson voice\r\nyet. It was almost right, but it lacked depth; it sounded like a cartoonish impression of Homer. As\r\ntime went on, Castellaneta got to know Homer a lot better and he was able to give him a much more\r\nnuanced voice as a result. Think about your characterâ€™s personality. Think about their lifestyle and\r\ntheir relationships with the other characters. The better you know your character, the easier it will\r\nbe for you to give them a truly unique voice.</p>', '', 'cartoon-voiceover-guide3.jpg', 'cartoon-voiceover-guide4.jpg', 'cartoon-voiceover-guide5.jpg', ''),
(812, 'top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly', 'Voice-over Narration in Movies', '<p>Voiceover is used in most TV and online advertisements, as well as in cartoons and explainer videos.\r\nBut voiceover narration is also used in countless films to help tell the story. When used badly,\r\nvoiceover narration feels hackneyed or unnecessary; when used well, voiceover narration talks\r\ndirectly to the viewer, creating an immersive cinematic experience. In this article, weâ€™re going to\r\ndiscuss our top 5 films that use voice-over narration perfectly. Give it a read to see if your favourite\r\nvoiceover performance makes the list!</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', '', 'Top 5 Films that use Voice-over Narration Perfectly - Many films use narration. If you\'d like to find out who uses it and how it\'s done. Read on this guide.', '<h2>5) Goodfellas</h2>\r\n<p>Goodfellas makes good use of voiceover narration throughout, but its intro is the most memorable\r\npart and perhaps one of the most memorable film intros of all time. It starts with â€˜As far back as I can\r\nremember, I always wanted to be a gangsterâ€¦â€™ and it goes on to describe how the main character\r\n(played by Ray Liotta) began his life of crime. This intro works well because it sets the tone for the\r\nentire story in the first line and in perfectly introduces the filmâ€™s protagonist. The tone is friendly,\r\nlight, and informative. Starting the film from Ray Liottaâ€™s perspective ensures that the audience is on\r\nhis side from the start, even though heâ€™s going to do many terrible things throughout the story.\r\nGood voiceover speaks directly to the audience and can help them side with the bad guys, and\r\nsometimes even root for them!</p>', '<h2>4) Memento</h2>\r\n<p>As with almost every Christopher Nolan film, much of Mementoâ€™s success relies on mystery and the\r\ngradual revelation of new information, so weâ€™ll keep this section free of spoilers. Memento follows\r\nLeonard (played by Guy Pearce), a man who cannot maintain new memories for long, due to a head\r\ninjury. Leonard is trying to find his wifeâ€™s killer. Leonard forgets everything that has happened the\r\nprevious day when he sleeps and voiceover narration is used to great effect as it helps the audience\r\nget an idea of whatâ€™s going on in his head. Voice-over narration is absolutely crucial to the story, as\r\nso much of the drama is concerned with Leonardâ€™s internal struggle to remember whatâ€™s happening\r\nâ€” whoâ€™s good and whoâ€™s bad, etc. Voiceover gives us a direct line to Leonardâ€™s mind, showing us\r\nwhat he doesnâ€™t understand or canâ€™t remember. A lot of the drama comes from the fact that we\r\nknow something Leonard has forgotten â€” without voiceover, this would be impossible.</p>', 'top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly2.jpg', 'top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly.jpg', 'Top 5 Films that use Voice-over Narration Perfectly', '<p>I hope you enjoyed our top 5 list of films that use voiceover narration perfectly! Guy Harris is an\r\nexperienced voiceover artist with a wide repertoire of voices to offer different productions and\r\ncommercial brands. If youâ€™d like to work out whether Guyâ€™s voice is right for your brand, listen to his\r\n <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">character voiceover show reels </a> and get in touch. Ask Guy to sample your script for free!</p>', '', '3', 'Top 5 Films that use Voice-over Narration Perfectly', '3', '', 'The top 5 Films with perfect Narration', '', '<h2>3) American Psycho</h2>\r\n<p>American Psycho is a disturbing story of a mentally unhinged psychopath called Patrick Bateman\r\nwho goes on a murder spree in the New York yuppie scene in the 80s. Much of the filmâ€™s best\r\nmoments involve voiceover, as Patrick (played by Christian Bale) talks us through his skincare routine\r\nor frets about his co-workersâ€™ superior business cards. The voiceover work is often funny, despite the\r\nfilmâ€™s dark themes. And, just as with Goodfellas, the voiceover pulls us closer to the narrator and\r\nmakes us almost root for him, despite his evil deeds. As the film is more about Patrickâ€™s unhinged\r\nthoughts, the voiceover allows the audience to hear his thoughts and understand his motivations.\r\nItâ€™s impossible to imagine American Psycho without Baleâ€™s excellent voiceover performance!</p>', '<h2>2) Fight Club</h2>\r\n<p>Fight Club is one of director David Fincherâ€™s masterpieces, and many of the best scenes make use of\r\nvoiceover narration. Fight Club was originally a bestselling novel, written by Chuck Palahniuk, and\r\nthe challenge was to carry over the successful complexity of the novel to the big screen adaptation.\r\nVoiceover is often used in Fight Club to outline the narratorâ€™s (played by Edward Norton) reflections\r\nabout society, consumer culture, etc. Itâ€™s a vital tool used to tell us more about the main character.\r\nHowever, the best aspect of the filmâ€™s voiceover narration is that is also misses vital information! In\r\nFight Clubâ€™s voiceover, we get such a close look at the main character that we canâ€™t see the big twist\r\ncoming! Fight Club has one of the best examples of an unreliable narrator in film and it wrongfoots\r\nthe audience several times. But rather than annoying the audience by misleading them, they are\r\ndelighted and impressed that the film could surprise them so much. In this way, it works much like a\r\nmagic trick done right under your nose, while the magicianâ€™s sleeves are rolled up!</p>', '<h2>1) The Shawshank Redemption</h2>\r\n<p>Morgan Freemanâ€™s voiceover work is legendary. Since The Shawshank Redemption, he has done\r\nvoiceover work for the CBS Evening News show, the narration for March of the Penguins, and several\r\nDiscovery Channel documentaries. You could say that The Shawshank Redemption was the start of\r\nFreemanâ€™s illustrious voiceover career, and itâ€™s easy to see why... Freeman isnâ€™t the filmâ€™s main\r\ncharacter; heâ€™s a secondary character, and it is with this secondary perspective that we see the story\r\nunfold. This perspective is key to the filmâ€™s success as there are key bits of information that the\r\naudience canâ€™t know until right at the very end of the story. Another reason the voiceover narration\r\nworks is because Morgan Freemanâ€™s voice as the character Red is warm, wise, and inviting; this helps\r\nthe audience feel at least slightly more comfortable in a film set almost wholly in a prison.\r\nUltimately, despite its depressing setting, The Shawshank Redemption is about hope and about\r\nchanging your life, and Morgan Freemanâ€™s rich voice helps evoke and explore these themes\r\nperfectly. Itâ€™s impossible to imagine The Shawshank Redemption without voiceover narration, and\r\nitâ€™s impossible to imagine anyone other than Morgan Freeman in this role!</p>\r\n', '', 'top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly3.jpg', 'top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly4.jpg', 'top-5-films-that-use-voice-over-narration-perfectly5.jpg', ''),
(813, 'five-tips-to-improve-your-radio-voice', '5 tips to improve your radio voice', '<p>If you are considering a career in voiceover or in radio broadcasting, then you probably already\r\nsuspect that your voice sounds nicer than the average personâ€™s. Perhaps youâ€™ve been complemented\r\non your voice before or perhaps youâ€™ve even done a little amateur radio broadcasting while at\r\nuniversityâ€¦ Whichever angle youâ€™re coming from, it never hurts to work on your skills, so here are\r\nfive tips to improve your radio voice.</p>', '', 'Discover 5 key tips from Guy Harris to improve your radio voice, boost confidence, sharpen delivery, and sound more polished whether live or pre-recorded.', '<h2>1) Be Yourself</h2>\r\n<p>When many people enter into a voiceover or radio broadcasting career, they try to imitate their\r\nfavourite radio celebrities, or they perhaps try to sound a little like actors or musicians famous for\r\ntheir voices. However, the more effort you put into trying to sound like James Earl Jones, the less\r\ntime youâ€™ll have to develop your own sound. And, in the world of radio voiceover, your sound is your\r\nidentity. Being yourself also has an added bonus, as radio broadcasting has become increasingly\r\ninformal, meaning that a more relaxed tone and demeanour is actually exactly what a modern\r\naudience expects.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', '<h2>2) Record Your Voice in Professional and Casual Settings</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>No matter how much of a natural you are, youâ€™ll still need to practice, and for a voiceover artist or\r\nradio presenter this involves listening to recordings of your voice, both when youâ€™re on the radio and\r\njust when youâ€™re having a conversation with your friends in the pub. Compare your tone of voice, its\r\ndepth, clarity, warmth, etc, and compare how natural you sound in both settings. If you can isolate\r\nhow you sound when youâ€™re just chatting with friends, you can bring that natural demeanour to your\r\nradio shows â€” this is especially valuable if you have to often read from scripts as doing so can make\r\nyour voice sound flat and unexciting.</p>', 'five-tips-to-improve-your-radio-voice4.jpg', 'five-tips-to-improve-your-radio-voice.jpg', 'Radio Voiceover: Five tips to improve your radio voice', '<p>Thatâ€™s it for this radio voiceover guide. I hope readers have learned a few practical tips to improve\r\ntheir radio voiceover skills. If youâ€™re interested in Guyâ€™s voiceover skills, check out his <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"commercial\r\nvoiceover reel\">commercial\r\nvoiceover reel</a> or get in touch and request a bespoke sample of your script.</p>', '', '3', 'Radio Voiceover: Five tips to improve your radio voice', '0', '', 'Five tips to improve your radio voice', '', '<h2>3) Consider Your Accent Very Carefully</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Gone are the days of the stilted BBC RP accent where most broadcasters sounded the same. Radio\r\npresenters all over the UK now come fromâ€¦ all over the UK. Regional accents are absolutely fine for\r\nradio, but you may have to standardise parts of your accent or at least lose some of the more\r\nesoteric dialect words. Listen to other regional radio presenters to figure out how to strike balance\r\nbetween regional and standard English. If you can find this balance you can work in both local and\r\ncountry-wide radio broadcasting. You donâ€™t have to lose your voiceâ€™s regional identity, but you can\r\nprobably temper it slightly, making it more appealing (and understandable) to a wider audience.</p>', '<h2>4) Practise Your Improvisational Skills</h2>\r\n<p>Working in radio often requires you to think on your feet â€” especially when talking to the public\r\nover the phone. Phone-ins are necessarily off script, as are most interviews. Sure, you can write out\r\nthe questions, but you canâ€™t predict all of the answers ahead of time. Itâ€™s also important that you\r\ndevelop your ad-libbing skills as you will probably often find yourself reading out badly written\r\nscripts. If you can quickly ad-lib a script to suit your own voice and style, youâ€™ll sound much more\r\nnatural to your audience. Itâ€™s difficult to fast-track your improvisation and ad-lib skills, as theyâ€™re\r\nskills you develop on the job, but if you keep these skills in your mind, youâ€™ll be able jump on the\r\nright opportunities and be ready for potential pitfalls.</p>', '<h2>5) Edit Your Radio Scripts</h2>\r\n<p>Many people who start working in radio are surprised that most presenters â€” no matter how\r\nnatural they sound â€” work from scripts. Scripts keep even the most seasoned professionals from\r\nmeandering into conversational cul-de- sacs. However, even a well-written script may not suit your\r\nparticular style, dialect, or voice. Improv and ad-libbing will only get you so far, so a little scan over\r\nthe script before the show is always a good way to iron out any kinks and make sure your show runs\r\nsmoothly. Take a red pen and make a few notes for yourself and donâ€™t be afraid to rewrite\r\nsomething in your own voice. As long as the message is similar, there shouldnâ€™t be a problem.</p>', '', 'five-tips-to-improve-your-radio-voice2.jpg', 'five-tips-to-improve-your-radio-voice3.jpg', 'five-tips-to-improve-your-radio-voice4.jpg', '');
INSERT INTO `messages2` (`id`, `url`, `page_title`, `info`, `search_terms`, `page_desc`, `text1`, `text2`, `image`, `video`, `meta_title`, `bottomtext`, `date`, `whatvideo`, `alt`, `rating`, `twitter`, `hometext`, `santa`, `ntext1`, `ntext2`, `ntext3`, `ntext4`, `nimage1`, `nimage2`, `nimage3`, `nimage4`) VALUES
(821, 'etisalat-celebrating-victory-football-commentator-voice', 'Etisalat Football Commentator Voiceover', '<p>Another football commentator voiceover in the bag, this time celebrating a Premier League win with Etisalat.</p>\r\n\r\n', 'footy', 'Guy provided his football commentator voice for Etisalat\'s new ad. Any fan of Man City should get a real kick out of this ad! Click on the link to see more!', '<h2>My Football Commentator Voice for Etisalat</h2>\r\n<p>Etisalat asked me to provide my football commentator voice for their Celebrating Victory campaign, marking Manchester Cityâ€™s Premier League success. Itâ€™s a lively spot packed with fans singing, cheering, and celebrating in classic match-day style, and my commentary bookends the video perfectly.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you enjoy this style, check out more projects where brands needed the same high-energy football sound, including my <a href=\"/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat Football Commentator Voice\">Just Eat UEFA</a> job, the <a href=\"/betfred-football-commentator\" title=\"Betfred Football Commentator Voice\">Betfred</a> campaign, and even Netflixâ€™s <a href=\"/iboy-football-commentator\" title=\"iBoy Football Commentator Voice\">iBoy</a>. For the full overview of what I do in this style, see my main <a href=\"/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">Football Commentator Voice</a> page.</p>', '<h2>Who Are Etisalat?</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.etisalat.ae\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Etisalat\">Etisalat</a> is a major telecoms company based in the UAE, operating across Asia, Africa, and the Middle East. With millions of customers and a huge footprint across digital services, they regularly produce sports-themed campaigns, so a football commentator voice made perfect sense for this one.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Working with international brands is a big part of my job, whether it\'s Etisalat, <a href=\"/turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover\" title=\"Turkish Airlines Football Commentator Voice\">Turkish Airlines</a>, <a href=\"/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice\" title=\"Manchester City Football Commentator Voice\">Manchester City</a>, or <a href=\"/pizza-hut-delivery-football-commentator-voiceover\" title=\"Pizza Hut Football Commentator Voice\">Pizza Hut Delivery</a>. If your brand needs that authentic match-day energy, I can help.</p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\r\n    <audio controls style=\"width:100%; max-width:420px;\">\r\n        <source src=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\r\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n    </audio>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;\">\r\n        Football Commentator Showreel â€“ Guy Harris\r\n    </p>\r\n</div>', 'etisalat-celebrating-victory-football-commentator-voice.jpg', 'tn6fNYwtGc4', 'Etisalat Celebrating Victory Football Commentator Voice', '<h2>Get in Touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you need a football commentator voice for a commercial, promo, explainer, or social spot, feel free to get in touch. I can turn jobs around quickly from my broadcast studio, and Iâ€™m always happy to send a short sample from your script before you book.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can also hear more of my work across different styles, including my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice\">David Attenborough-style narration</a>, my <a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voice\">Santa voice</a>, and my clean <a href=\"/apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Style Voice\">Apple-style voice</a>. Whatever you need, Iâ€™m here to help.</p>', 'April 18', '1', 'etisalat-football-commentator-voice-guy-harris', '5', 'football commentator voice\",\"Etisalat voiceover\",\"sports commercial voice', 'Football commentator voice for Etisalat', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(823, 'govind-trailer-deep-male-voice', 'My Govind Trailer ', '<p>A deep, characterful voice for Dharam Seva Records</p>', '', 'Guy Harris provided a deep male voice for Dharam Seva Records\' My Govind video, which celebrates the Sikh faith and inspires younger generations. Find out more!', '<h2>My voiceover works rarely brings me the same job twice!</h2>\r\n<p>Anyone looking to make an <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">advertisement</a> an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> or a <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" title=\"Movie Voiceover\">movie voiceover</a> will need a professional voiceover artist to take their video to the next level. This means that I get all kinds of surprising jobs that make my job incredibly rich and never boring. It\'s safe to say that Dharam Seva Records is one of the most unique companies I\'ve ever had the pleasure of working for. They asked for a deep, Ian McKellen-style voice and I\'m very pleased with how the final video came out. I should say that I\'m especially impressed with the mix on the video; they are clearly very talented over at Dharam Seva Records!</p>\r\n', '<h2>A Little More about Dharam Seva Records</h2>\r\n<p>Dharam Seva Records is a non-profit music label that was founded in 2013 with the sole purpose of preserving and promoting the ethics, history, and heritage of the Sikh religion through music and other media. As a non-profit, Dharam Seva Records is headed by volunteers, Kaka Mohanwalia and Bill Mato, who both have a lot of experience working in the Bhangra music industry. Dharam Seva Records produce Sikh music with \"moral-based\" content and this video alone is testament to the quality of their productions!</p>', 'govin-trailer-deep-male-voice.jpg', 'WRbvbrHN-Tw', 'Govind Movie Trailer â€“ Deep Male Voiceover', '<h2>Getting in touch with me</h2>\r\n<p>Whether you\'re working on an an advertisement, a trailer, a cartoon, or anything where you need high-quality male voiceover skills, I am always happy to hear from new clients. You\'ll find all of my contact details on my <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">contact page</a>, including email, telephone, etc. Please get in touch and tell me a little about your project. If it helps you figure out if I\'m right for your project, I am more than happy to provide a sample of your script for free.</p>', 'April 18', '1', 'govin-trailer-deep-male-voice', '3', '', 'A short trailer for Dharam Seva Records', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(824, 'european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice', 'Patrick Stewart Voice', '<p>A softer version of my Patrick Stewart voice</p>', '', 'Guy Harris provided the voiceover for the European Collaboration Summit . A softer version of his Patrick Stewart voice has worked out really well!', '<h2>My voice on the promo for the European Collaboration Summit Mainz</h2>\r\n<p>I love the final edit of this video. They asked for a calm voice that was both strong and softly spoken. I experimented a little and found that my <a href=\"patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\" title=\"Patrick Stewart Impression\">Patrick Stewart voice</a> was a great fit. In the past, Iâ€™ve been asked for my Patrick Stewart voice for louder, more up-beat promos, so it was nice to use it for a slower, more contemplative video. The visuals and overall editing on this video is great and Iâ€™m very pleased to be part of it. If youâ€™d like to hear more from my Patrick Stewart voice, check out my <a href=\"siegecraft-commander-trailer-voice\"  title=\"Siegecraft Commander\">Siegecraft Commander</a> and <a href=\"minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover\"  title=\"Minecraft explainer\">Minecraft explainer</a> videos.</p>\r\n', '<h2>European Collaboration Summit in Mainz</h2>\r\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.collabsummit.eu\" target=\"_blank\" title=\" European Collaboration Summit\"> European Collaboration Summit Mainz </a> is a huge conference event where people can network and attend talks about a variety of digital and business development subjects, such as Office 365, Azure, SharePoint, and Digital Transformation. The summit focuses on collaboration, on encouraging businesses to come together to create something bigger and better than they could on their own. This inspirational motive informed the production of this promo video and I love how it came together.</p>', 'european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice.jpg', 'DLih0NZHPJI', 'Patrick Stewart Voice for the European Collaboration Summit ', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> or <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> and youâ€™re looking for a voice a little like this one Iâ€™ve used for the European Collaboration Summit, then please feel free to get in touch. Always happy to hear about a new job. To take things easier, Iâ€™m happy to provide a sample of your script so that you can figure out if my voice is a good fit for your brand.</p>', 'May 18', '1', 'european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice', '0', '', 'European Collaboration Summit Voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(826, 'g-fuel-golden-apple-pear', 'G-Fuel-Golden Apple-Pear', '<p>Another quirky commercial for G Fuel</p>', '', 'Guy Harris provided the voiceover for the G-Fuel Golden Apple Pear advertisement. With an epic voiceover that\'s a prefect fit for the advert and the product.', '<h2>My voiceover on the latest G Fuel ad!</h2>\r\n<p>This is the second advertisement I\'ve voiced for G Fuel and I love the sense of humour they bring to their advertising campaigns. Take a look at another ads on their <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=krHsf8pSilM\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"G Fuel\">You Tube channel</a>. For the ad I was asked to do recently, they asked for an epic, godlike voice, and I think I\'ve delivered. I think the voice is a little like the classic <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer voice</a>, which I always love doing!</p>', '<h2>A little more about G Fuel</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://gfuel.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"G Fuel\">G Fuel</a> is an American energy drink company with a big difference: they sell the formula to make the drink and they avoid the huge amounts of sugar other energy drinks companies put into their products. G Fuel\'s brand focuses on the idea of providing people with healthy energy drinks and it\'s getting increasingly popular. This promo video was a lot of fun to voice and I hope to work with them for a third time in the future!</p>', 'g-fuel-golden apple-pear.jpg', 'QyoQKVmLnCY', 'G-Fuel Golden Apple Pear â€“ Energy Voiceover by Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on an <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">advertisement</a>, <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">game trailer</a> and you\'d like a voice similar to the one I used for this G Fuel promo, then please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. If it makes things easier for you, I\'m happy to provide you with a sample of your script so that you can hear if my voice is right for your project.</p>', 'May 18', '1', 'g-fuel-golden apple-pear', '3', '', 'G-Fuel Golden Apple Pear Voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(828, 'english-voiceover', 'English voiceover artist', '<p>I\'ve worked with companies from all around the World and I\'d like to encourage any business, wherever you\'re based, to get in touch if you\'re looking for professional English voiceover.</p>', 'male british', 'Guy Harris has provided English voiceover for dozens of companies around the World. He has worked with brands based in Norway, France, Bahrain... Get in touch!', '<h2>Professional English Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve worked with companies in France, Norway, Egypt, Bahrain, and UAE â€” to name just a few that come to mind! None of these countries speak English as a first language, but all of them, for various different reasons, require the services of a professional English voiceover artist. I have my own recording studio and do all of my work from there; if you send me over a script, chances are I can email you my full voiceover by the end of the day. If you\'re interested, check out a variety of my work, such as my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a>, <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceovers</a>, my <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer voiceover</a>, and my <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">game trailer voiceover</a>. I also have various <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character voiceovers</a> in my repertoire, if that\'s what you\'re looking for.</p>', '<h2>English is everywhere in the voiceover industry</h2>\r\n<p>I don\'t know if it\'s necessarily a good thing for everyone that English is the language of business between so many countries around the World, but it\'s definitely a good thing for English voiceover artists like me! English isn\'t just spoken by Brits, Irish, Americans, Canadians, Aussies, New Zealanders, South Africans... the list goes on; it\'s also used by countries who don\'t speak English as a first language who want to communicate with other non-English-speaking countries. And, because English is so widespread, it has proven to be the most useful language for global business. If English ceases to be the most useful language, the international business community will choose another language (perhaps Mandarin or Spanish, for example). In the meantime, I\'ll continue to enjoy providing English voiceover for companies all round the World.</p>', 'english-voiceover-britain.jpg', '', 'British English Voiceover â€“ Guy Harris, Trusted UK Male VO', '<h2>Get in touch (wherever you are)</h2>\r\n<p>So many of the brands I\'ve worked with around the World are incredible and I hope I\'ll continue to foster working relationships with big and small brands the world over. If you need an English voiceover for your next project, please don\'t hesitate to get in touch. Tell me more about your brand and your products. Let\'s work together on your next big project!</p>', 'June 18', '1', 'english-voiceover', '3', '', 'Available wherever you are in the World', '', '<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<h2>A few examples of my international voiceover work</h2>\r\n<p>I keep careful record of every brand I work for and there are just too many great companies based in different countries around the World to mention them all here. I\'ll just give a small but illustrative selection of the range of countries, brands, and projects I\'ve been part of:\r\n\r\n', '<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The work I did for the Norwegian software developer Kantega involved my tried-and-tested <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voice</a>.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The voiceover work I did for Egyptian news broadcaster <a href=\"micropolitics-suzys-beauty-salon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mada Masr\">Mada Masr</a> makes use of my soft documentary-style voice.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>A small part of the <a href=\"etisalat-celebrating-victory-football-commentator-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Etisalat Voiceover\">Etisalat Man City celebration promotional video</a> features my football commentator voice. Based in Abu Dhabi, Etisalat is one of the biggest telecommunications companies in the UAE and they were a pleasure to work with.</p>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>The Bahrain telecommunications company Viva asked me to provide voiceover for their <a href=\"viva-bahrain-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Viva\">promotion video</a> and I\'m pleased with how the promo came together.</li></p>', '', '', 'english-voiceover-guy-harris.jpg', 'english-voiceover.jpg', '', ''),
(830, 'snickers-football-commentator-voice', 'Snickers Football Commentator Voice', '<p>A fun World Cup project voicing Snickers Arabiaâ€™s football commentator ads.</p>', 'Snickers football commentator', 'Snickers Arabia booked Guy Harris for a series of high-energy football commentator voiceovers during the World Cup. Watch the ads and hear the commentary style.', '<h2>Watch the Snickers Arabia Campaign</h2>\r\n<p>Despite not being a big football fan, I seem to land a lot of football commentator voiceovers â€” and Iâ€™m definitely not complaining! Snickers Arabia got in touch after hearing my <a href=\"football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">football commentator voice style</a> and booked me for several World Cup ads. If you\'d like to hear more examples, you can also check out my <a href=\"iboy-football-commentator\" title=\"iBoy Football Commentator Voice\">iBoy football commentator</a> or my <a href=\"betfred-football-commentator\" title=\"Betfred Football Commentator Voice\">Betfred commentator voice</a> projects.</p>', '<h2>Working With Snickers Arabia</h2>\r\n<p>Snickers hardly needs an introduction â€” itâ€™s one of the worldâ€™s most recognisable chocolate brands. The team in Arabia were brilliant to work with and wanted a lively, high-energy football commentator performance. If youâ€™d like something similar, have a listen to more of my <a href=\"just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat Football Commentator\">Just Eat commentator work</a>.</p>', 'snickers-football-commentator-voice.jpg', 'GNaTR4Ai8Lo', 'Snickers Football Commentator Voiceover â€“ Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in Touch</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re creating a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voice\">explainer video</a>, or a sports-themed promo and need a strong football commentator voice, feel free to get in touch. Iâ€™m always happy to record a short sample from your script so you can check whether my delivery is right for your project.</p>', 'June 18', '1', 'snickers-football-commentator-voiceover', '3', 'snickers voiceoverâ€,â€œfootball commentator voiceâ€,â€œsports commercial voice', 'Football commentator voice for Snickers Arabia.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(833, 'morrisons-wonky-in-store-voiceovers', 'Morrisons Wonky Range - In store', '<p>A cockney guy talking about Morrisons\' wonky veg...</p>', 'cockney', 'Voiceover for Morrisonsâ€™ Wonky Veg campaign. Guy Harris brings warmth, humour, and character to the supermarketâ€™s in-store messaging across the UK.', '<h2>The voice of Morrison\'s Wonky Fruit & Vegetable range</h2>\r\n<p>Morrisons recently asked me to provide a friendly <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/cockney-voice?in=voiceoverguy/sets/characters-voices\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Cockney Voiceover\">cockney voiceover</a> for their in-store announcements about their Wonkey Range of fruit and veg. I\'ve got quite a lot of different voices and impressions in my <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character voiceover showreel</a> but Cockney is one of my favourites. I do a lot of in store voiceovers, including the voice of Wickes, Asda, Co Op, Costcutter Poundland, B&M and many others. I\'m actually a fan of Morrison\'s Wonky Fruit and Veg Range, so it was great to give these in store adverts a quirky close mic feel. It\'s great working with one of the UK\'s biggest Supermarket brands! I\'ve done some work with Tesco too!</p>', '<h2>A little more about Morrisons</h2>\r\n<p>I usually like to write a little bit about the companies I work with, but Morrisons really don\'t need much of an introduction. The company can actually trace its heritage back to 1899, when William Morrison started an egg and butter business in Bradford. Safe to say, they sell a lot more than butter and eggs now in their 498 stores around the UK! Morrisons\' Wonky Range is such a great way to reduce wasting all of the wonderful food British farmers make. While lots of supermarkets only accept the most ascetically pleasing fruit, Morrisons accepts all of the weird and wonky produce from British farmers. I love this idea and I really like Morrisons. I\'ve actually worked with them before and you\'ll hear my spooky <a href=\"halloween-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Halloween Voice\">Halloween Voice</a> in Morrisons stores this October.</p> ', 'morrisons-wonky-in-store-voiceovers.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/475711659&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe>', 'Morrisons Wonky Voiceovers â€“ In-Store Promo VO by Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Do you need a voice like this one for your next <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or perhaps for an in-store announcement? Well, I\'m always happy to hear from people keen to work with me, so don\'t hesitate to get in touch. If it makes it easier to decide, I\'m happy to provide a sample of your script for free to help you see (hear) if my voice is the right fit for your brand.</p>', 'July 18', '2', 'morrisons-wonky-in-store-voiceovers', '5', '', 'Morrisons\' Wonky Range Voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(835, 'lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover', 'Patrick Stewart Voiceover', '<p>I love pulling out my Patrick Stewart voice every now and then!</p>', '', 'Guy Harris provided his deep Patrick Stewart-style voice for this great ad for financial investment company LendingCrowd. Click to find out more!', '<h2>Watch the video</h2>\r\n<p>Recently, I was contacted by LendingCrowd and asked to provide a voiceover for their great-looking new TV ad. I read the script and listened to what they asked of me, then I suggested my <a href=\"patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Patrick Stewart Voiceover\">Patrick Stewart voice</a> and they agreed that it was a perfect fit. This voice isn\'t necessarily a perfect impression of Patrick Stewart, but it\'s not really trying to be; it\'s over the top and a lot of fun. This voice is deep, confident, manly, and with more than a little whimsy. This is one of my favourite voices to pull out of the bag. If you\'d like to hear more examples of my Patrick Stewart-style voice, check out my <a href=\"nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"NFL on CBS\">NFL on CBS</a> and <a href=\"european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"European Collaboration Summit\">European Collaboration Summit</a> videos.', '<h2>A little more about LendingCrowd</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\" title=\"LendingCrowd\">LendingCrowd</a> describes itself as a \'fast-growing peer-to-peer lending platform\'. They match investors who are looking for a better return on investment with businesses looking for small business loans. Essentially, LendingCrowd is a great way for investors and people needing investments to find each other. It was great to work with these guys on their TV ad and I liked the close-mic, softly softly approach to the classic Patrick Stewart voice. Sometimes, a shouting message isn\'t needed!</p>', 'lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover.jpg', '258614888', 'LendingCrowd Patrick Stewart Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> or <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> in need of my Patrick Stewart voice? If so, I\'d love to hear from you, so please feel free to get in touch. I\'m always happy to work with new brands and I have a huge range of voices for you to choose between. If it makes it easier for you, I\'m more than happy to provide a free voiceover sample from your script so that you can hear whether or not I\'m right for your project.</p>', 'July 18', '0', 'lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover', '3', '', 'Patrick Stewart-style voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(837, 'champion-eleven-football-commentator-voice', 'Football Commentator Voice', '<p>For someone who doesn\'t play or watch any football, I seem to get a lot of football voiceover gigs!</p>', 'Champion Eleven footy', 'Guy Harris performed his best football commentator voice for Champion Eleven Football, a great new game from Meogames! Find out more or download the app today!', '<h2>My best football commentator-style voiceovers</h2>\r\n<p>Iâ€™ve somehow become the go-to guy for football commentator voiceovers â€” despite not being a massive football fanatic! Clearly Iâ€™ve absorbed enough from the TV to sound convincing. This style is something Iâ€™m booked for regularly, from high-energy ads to fast-paced gaming projects.</p>\r\n<p>If youâ€™d like to hear more examples of this style, check out my work for \r\n<a href=\"snickers-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Snickers Football Voiceover\">Snickers Arabia</a>, \r\n<a href=\"iboy-football-commentator\" title=\"iBoy Football Commentator Voice\">Netflixâ€™s iBoy</a>, and the \r\n<a href=\"football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Main Football Commentator Page\">main football commentator showcase</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- MP3 PLAYER -->\r\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\r\n    <audio controls style=\"width:100%; max-width:420px;\">\r\n        <source src=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\r\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n    </audio>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;\">\r\n        Football Commentator Showreel â€“ Guy Harris\r\n    </p>\r\n</div>', '<h2>My voiceover for Champion Eleven</h2>\r\n<p>Champion Eleven was a great project with a brilliant creative team at Meogames. I voiced the full in-game commentary for the app, adding pace, drama and punch to every match moment. If you enjoy football gaming, you can see even more of my sports-style reads on the <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">Game Trailer Voice</a> page.</p>', 'champion-eleven-football-commentator-voice.jpg', 'm6UDuRCOH8U', 'Champion Eleven Football Game â€“ Sports VO Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you need my commentator voice for your next game, <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">game trailer</a>, or <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial spot</a>, please donâ€™t hesitate to get in touch. Iâ€™m always happy to send over a short free sample from your script so you can see whether Iâ€™m the right fit.</p>\r\n<p>You can also explore more of my commentary-style reads on my <a href=\"football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">main football page</a> or listen to other styles such as my <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Voice\">Attenborough voice</a> or <a href=\"apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Voice Style\">Apple-style reads</a>.</p>', 'August 18', '1', 'champion-eleven-football-commentator-voice', '3', 'football commentator voice\",\"game trailer voice\",\"sports commercial voice', 'Football commentator voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(838, 'little-monster-media-movie-voice', 'Movie trailer - Little Monster Media', '<p>A punchy movie trailer voice with a lot of impact!</p>', '', 'Guy Harris performed his movie trailer voice for Little Monster Media\'s big radio imaging and SFX promotion video this year. Click on the link for more!', '<h2>My movie trailer voice for a great radio imaging company!</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve known and worked with Adam from Little Monster Media for many years, so it\'s always nice when he gets in touch with another job for me. Little Monster Media needed me to riff on my <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer voice</a> while reading their really funny script. Adam wanted to advertise LMM\'s complete radio imagining and SFX package and I LOVE how quirky and fun the finished product is. You can check out my <a href=\"voiceover-imaging\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Radio Imaging Voiceover\">radio imagine service</a>, if you\'re interested, and you may like to listen to a few of my other movie trailer voiceovers, such as my <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lw3_DUx5jrk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Rocket and Groot Voiceover\">Rocket and Groot</a> and <a href=\"turtle-strike-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Turtle Strike Voiceover\">Turtle Strike</a> videos!</p>', '<h2>A little more about Little Monster Media</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://littlemonstermedia.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Little Monster Media\">Little Monster Media</a> is an audio production company based in Bristol. They have years of experience and accolades to their name and htey specialise in creating \"cutting-edge radio imaging FX and sound design for radio, TV, and online.\" Little Monster Media is a great company and it was a pleasure, as always, to work with them. It\'s a big compliment when an audio production company asks you to do the voiceover work for their big advertisement and it was great to work with Adam and the others at Little Monster Media. I wish them all the best with this promotion!</p>', 'little-monster-media-movie-voice.jpg', 'Cncd3VgDQ9s', 'Little Monster Media Movie Trailer Voice | Voiceover Guy', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Do you need my movie trailer voice for your next <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">radio ad</a>? If you do, I\'d be more than happy to hear from you, so please feel free to\r\n<a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. If you need to hear a little more of my voice before you make a commitment, I\'ll be more than happy to send over a sample of your script, free of charge.</p>', 'Aug 18', '1', 'little-monster-media-movie-voice', '3', '', 'A movie trailer voiceover for Imaging', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(843, 'michelin-cross-climate-voiceover', 'Michelin Cross Climate Explainer', '<p>A great, detail-rich explainer video for Michelin.</p>', '', 'Guy Harris is the voice of Michelin\'s new Cross Climate Plus tyres explainer video. These tyres are designed to excel in warm, rainy, and icy conditions!', '<h2>Another high-quality explainer video</h2>\r\n<p>When Michelin got in touch to ask if I\'d voice their upcoming explainer video, I jumped at the chance. Michelin is one of the biggest automotive brands out there and I\'m always keen to work with the big buys! They had an interesting product with an intelligent feature that needed a little bit of explaining. This is where <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> come in... It\'s the perfect type of video when your product is complex enough that you need to spend a little longer to explain what makes it so good. </p>', '<h2>A little more about Michelin</h2>\r\n<p>I like to discuss the brands I work with in this section of my blogs, and there\'s a lot to say about <a href=\"https://www.michelin.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Michelin\">Michelin</a> that I don\'t have time for here. Michelin is one of the biggest tyre companies in the world. It\'s a true specialist brand and I think it\'s a good thing that all of their R&D resources can go into developing new car tyre technologies, like theirCross Climate Plus tyres! I like Michelin\'s approach to writing this explainer video and it was a lot of fun to work with them!</p>', 'michelin-cross-climate-voiceover.jpg', '4rOrSN8YoQM', 'Michelin Cross Climate Tyres Explainer Video | Guy Harris', '<h2>Need Voiceover for your Next Explainer Video? Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or explainer video and you need a voiceover a little like this one I worked on for Michelin, please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I\'m happy to give you a free voiceover sample from your script so that you can see (or hear) whether I\'m right for your brand.</p>', 'Oct 18', '1', 'michelin-cross-climate-voiceover', '3', '', 'A bright, quirky voiceover style', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(844, '4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice', '4 Music â€” ID Mobile Sponsor', '<p>A bright, quirky voiceover style for these short bumper ads on 4 Music</p>', 'able', 'Guy Harris is the voice of ID Mobile sponsor bumper ad on 4 Music. Click on the link to learn more about the voiceover and how you can can work with Guy Harris!', '<h2>Voicing short sponsor bumpers for ID Mobile</h2>\r\n<p>Sponsor bumpers are a great way to connect with the viewership or listeners of the best TV shows and radio shows. You\'ve probably seen hundreds of them before and not really realised you were being advertised to. They appear at the start and the end of every ad break and always connect the brand with the show. ID Mobile asked me for a bright, quirky sort of voice and I think I\'ve delivered exactly what they wanted. If you\'d like to hear a few more examples of this style, check out my <a href=\"dead-daises-promo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Dead Daisies Voiceover\">Dead Daisies</a>, and <a href=\"horlicks-promo-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Horlick Voiceover\">Horlicks</a> videos. However, it\'s also worth noting that I voice all little voices in the background too! </p>', '<h2>A little more about ID Mobile</h2>\r\n<p>In case you hadn\'t heard of them before, ID Mobile is an online retailer that specialises in cheap mobile phones and sim-only deals. I was impressed to see that they sell all the latest phones too; it\'s not just old phones. I\'m always happy to be the voice of smaller, up-and-coming brands, but I\'m also especially pleased to have my voice featured on <a href=\"https://www.channel4.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"4 Music\">4 Music</a>. I think these sponsor bumpers look and sound great, so I\'\'m really pleased with how they\'ve turned out!</p>', '4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice.jpg', '6zOVX7VeH2Y', '4 Music â€” ID Mobile Sponsor Bumper Voice | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you need a voiceover professional with a range of voices like the ones featured in ID Mobile\'s sponsor bumpers on 4 Music, please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. Whether you\'re working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or something else altogether, I\'ve voiced literally hundreds of different things and I\'m always happy to hear from anyone who would like to work with me.</p>', 'Oct 18', '1', '4-music-id-mobile-sponsor-bumpers-voice', '5', '', '4 Music - ID Mobile Sponsor', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(847, 'falcon-alkoholfri-attenborough-voice', 'David Attenborough Falcon\'s Beer', '<p>A great little TV ad for Falcon\'s Alkoholfri beer</p>', '', 'Guy Harris provided the David Attenborough-style voiceover for Falcon\'s Alkoholfri (alcohol-free) beer. This is a great Sweedish beer, and a great advertirement', '<h2>Check out my latest David Attenborough voice commercial</h2>\r\n<p>As I often say, I prefer not to roa href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voice</a> for every single brand that asks. I like to test the water a bit, rread the script, and make sure that the idea behind the commercial is good. I\'m not nearly as selective with my other impressions, but I\'m asked for my David Attenborough voice all the time, and I\'m only ever as good as the last ad I provided voiceover for, so I like to make sure it\'s great. Fortunately for me, Falcon\'s ad was really nicely made. If you\'d a few more examples of my Attenborough voice, check out my <a href=\"horizon-zero-dawn-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Horizon Zero Dawn Voiceover\">Horizon Zero Dawn</a> and <a href=\"cracking-ice-david-attenborough-impression\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Cracking Ice Attenborough Voiceover\">Cracking Ice</a> videos.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Falcon</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://carlsberggroup.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Falcon Beer\">Falcon</a> is a Swedish brewery founded in 1896 by John L Skantze. It was founded Falkanberg, in Sweden, which is where it gets its name. The brewery continued to be successful for decades until Carlsberg bought the company in 1996. Falcon is still a much-beloved beer and this ad they had me voice captures a little bit of what makes the brand so good. It also required me to learn and deliver some pretty difficult Swedish words â€” something I think I managed pretty well! It was great to work with these guys. It was a great script and I\'m really happy with how the whole thing turned out!</p>', 'falcon-alkoholfri-attenborough-voice.jpg', 'nMCbAEXuvQs', 'Falcon Alkoholfri Beer Commercial | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch if you\'d like to work with me</h2>\r\n<p>If you like what you heard on this Falcon commercial and you\'d like me to do something similar for your next <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>, or perhaps for an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, then please feel free to get in touch. I have a vast range of different voices and I am always happy to try something new. If you need to hear a sample of my voice reading your script, I will be more than happy to oblige. Let\'s make something great together!</p>', 'Nov 2018', '1', 'falcon-alkoholfri-attenborough-voice', '3', '', 'Looking for a David Attenborough voice?', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(848, 'le-becks-natual-voiceover', 'A British Voiceover for Le Becks', '<p>Another great ad to show off my natural voiceover style</p>', 'apple, understated,  relaxed', 'Guy Harris provided his natural British voiceover style for Le Becks\' new ad. This commercial discusses the clever new can design of Becks\' premium beer.', '<h2>My Natural Voiceover Style</h2>\r\n<p>Despite adding so many different strings to my voiceover bow, my natural voiceover style is still what most companies ask of me. Over the years, I\'ve added more and more voiceover styles to my repertoire, such as my <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer voice</a>, <a href=\"santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santaâ€™s voice</a>, <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voice</a>, and many other <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character voices</a>. And, while I\'ve had great success with many of these voices (especially my Attenborough voice), I will always prefer to use my natural style. I think this is where being English comes in handy as it\'s the voice the majority of brands want for their commericals.</p>', '<h2>A Little Background on Le Becks</h2>\r\n<p>The drinks company, Becks, needs no introduction for anyone who enjoys a good lager. The brewing company was originally based in Bremen, in north Germany, but it was bought by an American brewing company called Interbrew and has been based in St. Louis, in Missouri, ever since. This move makes sense, given Beck\'s international presence â€” and it still holds onto its German origins, despite its new American home. It was a pleasure to work on the Le Becks commercial and I think the fascinating can will turn a few heads and get people talking. I really like how the final ad turned out and I\'d be happy to work with Becks in the future</p>', 'le-becks-natual-voiceover.jpg', 'jp0MB4F0bHA', 'Le Becks Natural Advert â€“ British Voiceover by Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in Touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> or even an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> and you need a natural voiceover style like this one I provided for Le Becks, please feel free to get in touch. I am always pleased to hear from someone new and I\'m always happy to provide a free sample of your script if you\'d like to hear, first hand, whether or not my voiceover is a good fit with your brand.</p>', 'Nov 18', '1', 'le-becks-natual-voiceover', '5', '', 'My natural British voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(849, 'christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice', 'Santa Voice for Xmas Party Fireworks', '<p>Another opportunity to show off my Santa VoiceOver skills at a Live event.</p>', 'father christmas pyro', 'Guy Harris provided his tried and tested Santa voice for a Christmas Party Fireworks event run by the incredible company, Pyro Productions. Find out more!', '<h2>Santa Voiceover for a Christmas Party!</h2>\r\n<p>Despite Santa\'s mythical status, most of us have a very strong idea of what Santa sounds like. His voice is round, deep, and jolly! Santa is too busy at Christmastime to do his own voiceover for every single event, so he lets me jump on a few of the jobs for him... I\'ve provided my <a href=\"santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voiceover</a> more times than I can count, but never for a firework\'s display! Needless to say, I love how this all came together. If you\'d like another couple of examples of my Santa voice, check out my <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZEwMyp2Z530\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GoJetters Santa\">GoJetters Santa voiceover</a> (the BBC used me as the voice of Santa on their kid\'s show!).\r\n<br>If you\'re hosting a bigger live event or awards night and need a powerful announcer voice, my \r\n<a href=\"/voice-of-god\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Voice of God Announcer\">Voice of God</a> delivery is used by ITV, The Masked Singer, Butlins and major UK brands.\r\n</p>', '<h2>A Little More About Pyro</h2>\r\n\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.matthewsbrospyro.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Matthews Bros Pyro\">Matthews Bros Pyro</a> are a brilliant professional fireworks company based in Shropshire. They produce stunning displays for weddings, parties, corporate events and major celebrations across the UK. Iâ€™ve worked with them for years and their attention to detail is superb.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'re planning a Christmas event, firework show or party, and you need Santa to introduce the big moment, you can also check out my \r\n<a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/the-official-voice-of-santa\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Official Voice of Santa\">Official Voice of Santa</a> page for more examples.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need help writing a script for Santa? Try my \r\n<a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/santa-script-generator\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Santa Script Generator\">Santa Script Generator</a>, it creates instant, personalised scripts you can use for any Christmas event.</p>', 'christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice.jpg', '1039401322', 'Santa Voice for Fireworks & Events â€“ Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in Touch</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you can\'t get hold of Santa to provide voiceover for your next big \r\n<a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or project, I might be the next best thing. \r\nChristmas is a busy time, and Iâ€™m voicing Santa scripts daily â€” but I always make time for new projects.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIf you\'d like to work with me, <a href=\"/contact-guy\" class=\"isred\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch here</a>. \r\nIâ€™ve got plenty of Santa voice examples across my site, and if you need something tailored, \r\nIâ€™m happy to record a bespoke sample from your script.\r\n</p>', '2018-120-01', '0', 'christmas-party-fireworks-santa-voice', '3', 'santa voice\", \"live event santa\", \"Father christmas', 'Santa is very busy during Christmas!', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(850, 'faze-rug-chug-rug-g-fuel', 'G Fuel\'s Faze Rug\'s Sour Blue Chug Rug', '<p>Another voiceover fro G Fuel. This time a Christmas special!</p>', 'G Fuel', 'Gâ€‘Fuel campaign for Fazeâ€¯Rugâ€™s Sour Blue Chug Rug â€” explosive, youthful voiceover by Guyâ€¯Harris. Want a voice that hits hard? You found it.', '<h2>Voiceover for G Fuel\'s Faze Rug\'s Sour Blue Chug Rug</h2>\r\n<p>G Fuel has always had a wacky sense of humour and brand personality. So, when they told me they were working on a commercial for their new flavour called Faze Rug\'s Sour Blue Chug Rug, I didn\'t even bat an eyelid! There\'s something about Christmastime that draws out advertisers\' poetic sensibilities and many of the commercials I voice over the Christmas period all have rhyming couplets in them! However, I wouldn\'t have guessed on ever voicing a poem about Faze Rug\'s Sour Blue Chug Rug... I really like how the ad came out, though. If you\'d like to see my other work with G Fuel, check out my <a href=\"g-fuel-golden-apple-pear\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"G Fuel Golden Apple Pear\">G Fuel Golden Apple Pear ad</a>. </p>', '<h2>A Little More About G Fuel</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://gfuel.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"G Fuel\">G Fuel</a> is one of the biggest energy drink companies in the world and they\'ve achieved their success by selling the formula for the drink, instead of the selling the beverage in a can or bottle. Another thing that separates G Fuel from other energy drink companies is that it puts significantly less sugar into its products. This means that G Fuel can legitimately claim it is healthier than most of its competitors. G Fuel also has the impressive claim to fame of being the official drink of esports. These factors (and the company\'s wacky sense of humour) have helped it become successful very quickly! I have enjoyed working with G Fuel in the past and I look forward to working with them in the future!</p>', 'faze-rug-chug-rug-g-fuel.jpg', 'SxcdZudDKTY', 'FaZe Rug G-Fuel Promo Voice â€“ Chug Rug Energy', '<h2>Get in Touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or perhaps even a <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">computer game trailer</a> and you need a tried-and-tested voiceover artist, please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I am always keen to hear from new companies and I\'ll be happy to provide a free voiceover sample from your script.</p>', 'Dec 18', '1', 'faze-rug-chug-rug-g-fuel', '3', '', 'Some energy-drink-based poetry for you', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `messages2` (`id`, `url`, `page_title`, `info`, `search_terms`, `page_desc`, `text1`, `text2`, `image`, `video`, `meta_title`, `bottomtext`, `date`, `whatvideo`, `alt`, `rating`, `twitter`, `hometext`, `santa`, `ntext1`, `ntext2`, `ntext3`, `ntext4`, `nimage1`, `nimage2`, `nimage3`, `nimage4`) VALUES
(852, 'voiceover-vox-award-winner-2018', 'Voiceover Vox Award Winner 2018', '<p>Another year, another award at the Vox Awards!</p>', '', 'Guy Harris was named Best Male Voiceover at the VOX Awards 2018 â€” recognised for excellence, consistency and impact across TV, radio and online campaigns.', '<h2>3 Nominations and 1 Win at the Vox Awards 2018</h2>\r\n<p>2018 was a great year for me. If you take a look at my <a href=\"voiceover-news\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Voiceover Blog\">blog</a>, you\'ll see that I provided voiceover for more brands than ever, and that the range of industries I work with continues to diversify. I don\'t need awards or nominations to know I\'ve been doing a good job, as I get plenty of feedback and referrals from clients. However, awards certainly do make me happy. This year, I had three nominations and one win. I won Best Retail Service Message for my Halloween Voice on the til in Poundland and I was nominated for my <a href=\"seat-hidden-heroes-adrian\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Seat Explainer video\">Seat Hidden Heroes explainer video</a> and my <a href=\"renault-uk-service\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Renault Explainer video\">Renault explainer video</a>.  </p>', '<h2>Not My First Vox Awards</h2>\r\n<p>Needless to say, I\'m not as young as I used to be and I\'m one of the most experienced UK voiceover artists, so I\'ve been to several Vox awards in the past, and I\'ve been nominated for (and won) previous awards. However, getting an award for my passion, my vocation, never gets old and I was really happy to be recognised by Vox. The VOX Awards 2018 was an incredible event and it was my privilege to be part of the awards. The VOX Awards have been going since 1994 and they\'re getting more and more popular each year. I hope I\'ll get nominated next year as well! </p>', 'voiceover-vox-award-winner-2019.jpg', 'TqkdBK8mBW8', 'Guy Harris â€“ VOX Award-Winning British Voiceover Artist', '<h2>Get in Touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re dying to give me an award, or if you\'d like to work with me on your next project, please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I have been nominated for my voiceover work on <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a>, <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, and even <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">video game trailers</a>, so click on the links to hear more! However, if you need a little hand making up your mind, I am more than happy to provide a free sample of your script. </p>', 'Nov 2018', '1', 'voiceover-vox-award-winner-2019', '3', '', '3 nominations and 1 award - Vox Awards.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(855, 'welsh-accent-voiceover', 'Looking for a Welsh Accent?', '<p>A genuine Welsh accent available from a Welsh born and bred professional voiceover</p>', 'wales', 'Looking for a Welsh accent voiceover? Guy Harris discusses the charm, uses, and authenticity needed to capture the true sound of a genuine Welsh read.', '<h2>The Welsh Accent</h2>\r\n<p>Whilst I like to pride myself on my wide variety of styles and accents, I do know my limitations and am more than happy to recommend the right person for the job, rather than me provide a sub standard product. Welsh is one of them. My associate, PJ was born and grew up in Wales, so it\'s a no brainer when I have enquires, I recommend PJ. Have a listen to the demo and I\'m confident you will be more than happy.</p>', '<br>\r\n<h2>More about PJ</h2>\r\n<p>Paul Jones (PJ) is an established British voice-actor born and raised in the South Wales valleys.<br>\r\nAs well as a neutral RP he can call upon his native Welsh accent; the tone of which can be tailored to suit a wide range of projects.</p>', 'welsh-accent-voiceover.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/576264759&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe>', 'Welsh Accent Voiceover â€“ Authentic, Friendly, Versatile VO', '<h2>Get in Touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a commercial or unique product or project and you need a Welsh accent, then please feel free to get in touch. Both myself and PJ provide countless voiceovers for global projects, so browse through my site for more examples of my work or for Welsh, I\'ll happily pass you to PJ. To make even easier if you\'d prefer, we can provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script!</p>', 'Feb 2019', '2', 'welsh-accent-voiceover', '0', '', 'Welsh Accent Voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(856, 'famous-voiceover-artists', 'Famous voice actors and artists ', '<h2>Famous Voice Actors in Cartoons and Videogames: Who voices who?</h2>\r\n<h2>Voiceover Guyâ€™s run down of some of the worldâ€™s most famous voiceover artists and voice actors</h2>\r\n<br>\r\n<br>\r\n<p>If youâ€™ve found your way to this page, itâ€™s because you want to find out more about the best voiceover artists and voice actors in the world. As a voiceover artist myself, Iâ€™m always watching (and listening) to the best professionals in the industry; Iâ€™m never done learning and growing as a voiceover artist and the best way to improve is to keep a watchful eye (and ear) on my peers. Keep reading to find out more about the top voice actors and please check out my <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover</a> and my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video voiceover</a> pages if youâ€™d like to see a little more of my work!</p>\r\n', '', 'Read all about the best, most-famous voice actors and voiceover artists in the world. Find out who voiced your favourite cartoon or video game right here!', '<h2>In a worldâ€¦ Don LaFontaine was the movie trailer guy!</h2>\r\n<p>In a worldâ€¦ where movie trailers needed a deep, epic voice to introduce their film trailers, Don LaFontaine became one of the most iconic voiceover artists in history. The whole â€˜In a worldâ€¦â€™ intro, with the deep, gravelly voice, was LaFontaineâ€™s invention and itâ€™s something that has really stuck. In fact, even when a movie trailer doesnâ€™t start with â€˜In a worldâ€¦â€™ the voiceover artist has still probably been asked by the producers to imitate LaFontaineâ€™s deep, manly baritone. LaFontaine voiced over five thousand movie trailers and advertisements, making him a true icon of the voiceover industry. Check out my own versions of LaFontainâ€™s <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer voice</a> as well as other, more original movie trailer voiceovers. Iâ€™ve also voiced quite a few <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">game trailers</a> too, but weâ€™ll talk about games laterâ€¦</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Famous voice actors in cartoons</h2>\r\n<p>Cartoons are amazing and theyâ€™re one of the best outlets for any voiceover actorâ€™s skills and expertise. I have voiced Santa (a lot), and I even voiced him in the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZEwMyp2Z530\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GoJetterâ€™s Santa Voiceover\">GoJetters Christmas special</a>. Iâ€™d love to voice more cartoons in the future. Here are a few of the biggest names in the cartoon voiceover industry. Chances are youâ€™ve heard their voices many times and just not known it was them!</p>\r\n', '<h2>Walt Disney was a voice actor</h2>\r\n<p>On top of creating the biggest production company in the world and being directly responsible for many of the most beloved cartoon characters ever created, Walt Disney was also a voice actor! Disney provided the voice of Micky and Minnie Mouse from the charactersâ€™ inception in the 1928, up until 1958. Itâ€™s difficult to think of a character with a more iconic voice than Micky Mouse, and we have Disney to thank for this. A good voice actor really can bring a cartoon character to life!</p>\r\n<h2>Mark Hamillâ€™s career as a voice actor</h2>\r\n<p>While Mark Hamill is most famous for playing Star Warâ€™s hero, Luke Skywalker, he has spent much more of his career as a voice actor! Hamill is famous for voicing DCâ€™s Joker, along with a huge roster of DC and Marvel comic characters, such as Red Skull, Swamp Thing, Gargoyle, Hobgoblin, and so many more. He has also provided a few voiceovers for Studio Ghibli â€“ voicing Muska in Castle in the Sky and the Mayor of Pejite in NausicaÃ¤ of the Valley of the Wind.</p>\r\n<h2>Rob Paulsen: one of the biggest cartoon voice actors of the 80s and 90s</h2>\r\n<p>Rob Paulsen will be a familiar name to anyone who works in the cartoon or voice acting industry. He was perhaps the biggest name in voice acting in the 80s and 90s and heâ€™s responsible for many of the eraâ€™s most iconic characters, such as Raphael & Donatello (the ninja turtles), Pinky (the sidekick of the Brain), and Stanley Ipkiss in the cartoon iteration of The Mask. Itâ€™s impossible to imagine cartoons in the 80s and 90s without Rob Paulsen.</p>\r\n', '1st-disney-voiceover.jpg', '7QPMvj_xejg', 'The most famous voice actors  | Voiceover Guy', '<br>\r\n<p>There are so many other voiceover actors and actresses that I havenâ€™t time to mention. I wanted to talk about some of the bigger names and to highlight a few people you perhaps didnâ€™t know had worked as voiceover artists. Perhaps Iâ€™ll come back at a later date and add in a list of voice actors, IMDB-style. If you need a voiceover artist for your next project and youâ€™d like to work with me, please donâ€™t hesitate to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>!</p>', 'March 2019', '1', 'famous-voiceover-artists', '3', '', 'Some famous voiceover artists.', '', '<h2>Hank Azaria has voiced so many great Simpsons characters</h2>\r\n<p>Hank Azaria is a famous actor in his own right, known for his performances in The Birdcage, Run Fatboy Run, Night at the Museum, Godzilla, and so many more films. However, lots of people donâ€™t know that the backbone of Azariaâ€™s career has been the voice acting work heâ€™s done on The Simpsons, Americaâ€™s most-loved cartoon family show. Azaria has an incredible talent for voicing different characters; in fact, Azaria has voiced 32 Simpsons characters so far. Here are just a few of Hank Azariaâ€™s more famous Simpsonâ€™s characters: Moe Syzlak, Apu, Carl (and Lou), Chief Wiggum, Comic Book Guy, Professor Frink, Snake, Superintendent Chalmers, and Duffmanâ€¦ </p>\r\n<h2>Tara Strong: the voice of so many great cartoon characters</h2>\r\n<p>Tara Strong is as successful and prolific as any voice actress! Youâ€™ve probably met several of her characters over the years. She was the voice of Dil in Rugrats, Bubbles (Powerpuff Girls), Hello Kitty, Twilight Sparkle in Hello Kitty, and several comic book characters, such as Batgirl, Poison Ivy, and Harley Quinn. Strong has also voiced some beloved videogame characters, which leads us on neatly to the next part of this articleâ€¦</p>\r\n', '<h2>Famous voice actors in video games</h2>\r\n<p>Video games are becoming one of the best ways to tell stories and have fun. And, in a way, they arenâ€™t any different to cartoons when it comes to voice acting. There are some incredible stories to be told/played, and good video games are starting to be appreciated for their cinematics and the acting abilities of their voice actors. I have voiced countless computer game trailers over the years, but my favourite video game claim to fame is that I provided the <a href=\" worms-wmd-character-voices\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Worms WMD Voiceover\"> voice of all of the worms in Worms W.M.D.</a>! I know so many people who love the Worms games and who quote my own voiceovers back at me. Here are a few of the biggest, most surprising actors who have worked as voice actors in the videogame industryâ€¦</p>\r\n<h2>Gary Oldman provided voiceover for the Spyro games and Call of Duty!</h2>\r\n<p>Itâ€™s a sign of how legitimate video games have become that oscar-winner Gary Oldman has voiced a few computer games characters over the years. Oldman voiced Ignitus in the Spyro Trilogy, and he voiced Daniel Clarke and Sergeant Viktor Reznov in the Call of Duty games!</p>\r\n<h2>Samuel L. Jackson voiced Officer Tenpenny in San Andreas</h2>\r\n<p>San Andreas was a huge game and Officer Tenpenny is often cited as one of the best villains in videogame history. It should be no surprise, then, that a great actor helped bring the character to life. Samuel L. Jacksonâ€™s voice is a perfect fit for this wicked villain and itâ€™s great to see one of Americaâ€™s biggest actors trying his hand as voice acting in video games.</p>\r\n<h2>Liam Neesonâ€™s voiceover work in Bethesdaâ€™s Fallout 3</h2>\r\n<p>The Fallout games are set in post-apocalyptic America, all with a kind of 50s cold-war aesthetic. The stories in all the games are good, but most gamers consider Fallout 3 to be the seriesâ€™ best game, and most agree that a good part of this is due to the gameâ€™s story. Neeson had the main voiceover role in Fallout 3 and he brought a certain drama and gravitas that you only get from the truly great actors and actresses!</p>\r\n', '<h2>Patrick Stewart and Sean Bean in Elder Scrolls: Oblivion</h2>\r\n<p>Before Skyrim, there was Oblivion, and it was an incredible game for its time. The storytelling was epic and the voice acting was ground-breaking. Patrick Stewart (X-Men, Star Trek The Next Generation) played Emperor Uriel Septim VII and his son was played by Sean Bean (Game of Thrones, Lord of the Rings). Itâ€™s testament to the respect Bethesda commands in the industry that it could attract two such huge actors.</p>\r\n<h2> Christopher Judge: the voice of God of Warâ€™s Kratos</h2>\r\n<p>2018â€™s God of War took the world by storm, winning countless awards and 10/10s from critics and gamers alike. One of the best things about the game is the quality voice acting by the whole cast. While all voice actors who worked on God of War did a great job, Christopher Judgeâ€™s performance as the lead character is easily the best. Fans of the TV Show Stargate SG1 will already know that Judge was the showâ€™s resident strong and silent Goa\'uld, Tealâ€™c. Judge is such a perfect choice for Kratos and players of the game have been doing impressions of him ever since the game came out. No one shouts â€œBOY!â€ as well as Christopher Judge!</p>\r\n', '', '2nd-hank-azaria-voiceover.jpg', '3rd-gary-oldman-voiceover.jpg', '4th-patrick-stewart-voiceover.jpg', ''),
(857, 'turkcell-red-riding-hood-film-voiceover', 'Depo Turkcell\'s Red Riding Hood Ad', '<p>A pretty standard voiceover for a very surprising ad...</p>', '', 'Guy Harris provided the voiceover for the Depo Turkcell - Red Riding Hood commercial. This was a great ad, with a brilliant sense of humour. Find out more!', '<h2>My natural voiceover for Turkcell</h2>\r\n<p>Turkcell got in touch with me with a really interesting script. Even though I only had a small part (the voiceover at the end of the commercial), I really liked the direction of the script and I never turn down good work from high-quality companies. They asked me for a natural style, and even though I\'m often asked for my <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voice</a> or my <a href=\"santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voice</a>, it\'s my natural style that most companies still ask for. If you\'d like to hear some more examples of similar voiceover work I\'ve done, check out my <a href=\"micropolitics-suzys-beauty-salon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Mada Masr Salon Voiceover\">Mada Masr</a> videos.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Turkcell</h2>\r\n<p>Turkcell is a specialist initiative to tackle the issue that face children growing up in an increasingly digital, smart-device-driven world, such as virtual bullying, privacy issues, and figuring which websites (and which information) can be trusted. Turkcell is dedicated to understanding the children of Turkey\'s virtual risks, whether they\'re in danger of cyberbullying or simply in danger of spending too much time on social media when they should be studying (or playing outside). I think this is a great initiative and I\'m sure any progress Turkcell makes will be shared (or at least sold) to other companies around the world.</p>', 'turkcell-red-riding-hood-film-voiceover.jpg', 'lrEIqRF9n7o', 'Turkcell - Red Riding Hood Advertisement | Voiceover Guy', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a project and you need a voiceover style similar to this one I provided for Turkcell, please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. Perhaps you\'re working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> or an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> and you need a voiceover artist to give it a genuine, professional finish. Whatever your project is, I\'m always happy to hear from new companies eager to work with me. And, if you need a little extra help figuring out if my voice is right for your brand, I\'m more than happy to provide a free sample voiceover from your script.</p>', 'March 2019', '1', 'turkcell-red-riding-hood-film-voiceover', '3', '', 'DQ Turkcell - Red Riding Hood Voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(858, 'bmoji-app-voiceover', 'Natural Voiceover for Bmoji App', '<p>I really like this relaxed, conversational style. It was a pleasure to voice.</p>', '', 'Guy Harris is the voice of the new Bmoji commercial. With Bmoji, you can create emojies that are specifically designed for you. Check out Guy\'s voiceover today!', '<h2>Voicing Bmoji\'s great new advertisement</h2>\r\n<p>Recently, Bmoji contacted me and asked me to provide the voiceover for their new ad. They sent over the script and I knew it was going to turn out great. They asked me for a relaxed, conversational read, and I think that\'s exactly what I gave them. Really pleased with the result, if I\'m honest. I also do all of the male voices on the video! Check out the video if you\'d like to hear my handiwork. And if you\'re wondering whether my voiceover work is the right fit for your next project, you might also like to check out my  <a href=\"le-becks-natual-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Le Becks Voiceover\">Le Becks</a> and <a href=\"hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hotels.com Voiceover\">Hotels.com</a> videos. Even though I provide lots of different voices (check out my <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character voiceover showreel</a>), I\'m still asked for my natural style most of all.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Bmoji</h2>\r\n<p>Bmoji is a great little app that allows you to completely customise your emojis, creating amazingly rendered cartoon versions of yourself that you can use on most messenger apps (such as iMessage, WhatsApp, and any other app where third-party emojis are supported. We live in the age of messaging apps and the way we communicate on them is constantly evolving. The best part of Bmoji, for me, is that you upload your three best photos and the Bmoji design team personally create your emoji avatars for you. This is much better than the automatically generated system on competitor apps. You can find the app download on Google Play. It was great working with these guys and I really like how the ad turned out!</p>\r\n', 'bmoji-app-voiceover.jpg', 'WDj_ZdbYIdY', 'Bmoji App Campaign â€“ British App Voiceover by Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> and you\'d like a voice similar to this natural style I delivered for Bmoji, then please don\'t hesitate to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. If it makes it easier for you to figure out if I\'m right for your next project, I\'m more than happy to provide a free sample from your script.</p>', 'March 19', '1', 'bmoji-app-voiceover', '5', '', 'A soft, natural male VoiceOver style', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(860, 'nakd-bars-mind-blown-professor-voice', 'Nakd Bars - Professor Voice', '<p>The smallest part ever in this great little ad</p>', 'nak\'d naked professor', 'Guy Harris provided the voiceover at the end of this Nakd Bars commercial. They asked him for his best professor voice and that\'s exactly what he gave them! ', '<h2>A professor-style voice</h2>\r\n<p>Nakd got in touch with me and asked me to provide a very small voiceover part for the end of their commercial. They asked me for a professor voice and I think the result is something in between my <a href=\"minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover\" title=\"Patrick Stewart Impression\">Patrick Stewart voice</a> and my <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voice</a>, which makes sense, really, when you remeber that patrick Stewart played Professor X in X-men and Attenborough is a scientist. I know I only had a small part, but I\'m really happy with how this ad turned out. Especially when it was re-licened for a 2nd year.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Nakd</h2>\r\n<p>Nakd has been making 100% natural snacks for over 12 years now. They\'re based in Buckinghamshire and they are huge proponents of natural snacks that taste amazing. Their Nakd bars are made only of fruit and nuts, so they\'re a great healthy snack for kids and adults alike.  I think Nakd has a really fun, quirky brand and the writing for this commercial is great. I always appreciate a company that doesn\'t take itself too seriously. These guys were great to work with and I\'d happily work with them again!</p>', 'naked-bars-mind-blown-professor-voice.jpg', 'BMdTuAJwdSg', 'Nakd Bars Professor Voice â€“ Mind Blown VO by Guy', '<h2>Want to work with me? Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a project and you need a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover</a> or perhaps a <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video voiceover</a> with the professor style a did for Nakd, then please don\'t hesitate to get in touch. I\'m always happy to work with new companies, and I\'ll even provide a free voiceover sample from your script to help you work out whether I\'m right for your brand</p> ', 'Jan 19', '1', 'naked-bars-mind-blown-professor-voice', '3', '', 'Nak\'d Bars needed me to voice 2 words...', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(861, 'logo-board-game-hovis-and-sailor-voice', 'Voicing the Logo Board Game', '<p>A Hovis-style voiceover for this Logo Board Game commercial</p>', '', 'Guy Harris was the voice of the Logo Board game, in association with Smyths Toy Stores. This was a Hovis-style voiceover, and a sailor voice too! Find out more!', '<h2>The Logo Board Game TV Ad</h2>\r\n<p>I provided the voiceover for this Logo Board Game commercial quite a while ago, but I only just realised that I didn\'t write it up. When they asked me to provide the voiceover, I said yes right away. Games and toys are one of my main kinds of work now. I\'ve voiced so many boardgames and toy ads now, such as my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/bugs-in-kitchen-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Bugs in the Kitchen\">Bugs in the Kitchen</a>, <a href=\"/girafun-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Girafun\">Girafun</a> and <a href=\"pop-up-pirate-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pop up Pirate\">Pop Up Pirate</a> videos. They asked me to do my best Hovis-style voice and I think it came out well. They also asked for my sailor voice <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lNaXi0TqWXA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Logo Board Game Ad\">in this Logo commercial</a> and it was lots of fun to do. </p>', '<h2>A little more about the Logo Board Game</h2>\r\n<p>This board game is great fun as it makes a game out of recognising logos from all the favourite brands we buy every day. The best thing about the <a href=\"https://www.drumondpark.com/logo\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"The Logo Board Game\">Logo Board Game</a> is that most of us are already very good at it, even when we\'re only playing it for the first time! This is because we can\'t help bt remember all of the brands. It\'s the advertising industry\'s fault! The game is made my Drummond Park and it has proven very successful, so I\'m very pleased to have my voiceover associated with the brand. The Logo Board Game was made by the same people who made Articulate.</p>', 'logo-board-game-hovis-and-sailor-voice.jpg', 'a31u0AftQO8', 'Hovis & Sailor Voice â€“ Logo Board Game Promo', '<h2>Get in Touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on something and you need a Hovis-style voiceover, or perhaps a <a href=\"pirate-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Pirate Voiceover\">pirate?</a> Please don\'t hesitate to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. If you need my voiceover for your next <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or perhaps even an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, then I\'m more than happy to hear from you. And, if you need a little help working out if my voice is right for your brand, I\'m very happy to provide free sample voiceovers from your script.</p>', 'Feb 2011', '1', 'logo-board-game-hovis-and-sailor-voice', '3', '', 'The Hovis voice and a sailor voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(868, 'traxart-explainer-voiceover', 'Traxart Explainer Video Voiceover ', '<p>Another natural voiceover on a high-quality explainer video</p>', '', 'Guy Harris provided a clean, natural voiceover for Traxart\'s new explainer video. Click on the link to watch the ad and listen to Guy\'s voiceover.', '<h2>A Clean, Natural Voiceover Style for Traxart</h2>\r\n<p>Even with my <a href=\"santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voiceover</a>, <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voice</a>, and my range of <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character voiceovers</a>, it\'s this natural style that I\'m asked to do most of all â€” especially for <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> where clarity is even more important. If you\'re not sure exactly what an explainer video is, I\'d say that it is just a longer advertisement that tries to explain an idea or a complex product. For more information, check out my <a href=\"what-is-explainer-video-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is an Explainer Video Blog\">What is an Explainer Video Blog</a> Given that Traxart is all about giving feedback on presentations, clarity was even more important in this case! I\'m really pleased with the result and I think they are too!</p>', '<h2>A Little More About Traxart</h2>\r\n<p>Traxart, as you can tell from the explainer video, is quite a unique company as it has created an app that allows a presentation\'s audience to offer feedback and comments on every aspect of a presentation. There\'s so much more to it than that, but the explainer video captures the essence of this innovative brand\'s product. Traxart\'s tagline is \"Weâ€™re here to remove the guesswork out of understanding presentation performance.\" and I\'m sure this is an invaluable tool for individuals and companies who regularly give presentations. This is a brand-new company, so I hope the explainer video helps them connect with their customers.</p>', 'traxart-explainer-voiceover.jpg', '355425940', 'Traxart Explainer Video Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you have product that needs a little more explanation, then perhaps you\'d benefit from an explainer video like this one I voiced for Traxart. Check out my <a href=\"michelin-cross-climate-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Michellin Cross-Climate Tyres\">Michellin Cross-Climate Tyres</a> explainer videos to get a better idea of what I can do. Or perhaps you\'re not looking for an explainer video and you\'d like to check out my <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceovers</a> instead. Whatever your voiceover needs, do get in touch</a> and tell me what you\'re looking for. I\'m always happy to take on new work and I can usually record voiceovers on the same say they\'re requested!</p>', '', '0', 'traxart-explainer-voiceover', '3', '', 'A smooth, natural-sounding voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(869, 'minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover', 'Minecraft Backpack Patrick Stewart', '<p>Another chance to bring out my trusted Patrick Stewart-style voice. Minecraft + backpack + mock seriousness = a perfect recipe for parody narration.</p>', 'british game impression impersonation', 'Guy Harris voices the Minecraft backpack promo with his trademark Patrick Stewart-style delivery. Witty, quirky, and perfect for parody narration.', '<h2>Voicing Another Minecraft Promo</h2>\r\n<p>I was asked once again to lend my voice to a Minecraft campaign â€” this time, for a quirky backpack promo. As one of the biggest brands in gaming, Minecraft always brings big expectations, but the creative on this one hit all the right notes.</p>\r\n<p>With a mock scientist angle and dry humour, it felt like the perfect moment to dust off the <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\" title=\"Patrick Stewart MoneySuperMarket Voice\">Patrick Stewart-style voice</a>. The team at Mojang were chuffed â€” and so was I.</p>\r\n<p>ðŸ§± You might also like these other Minecraft projects Iâ€™ve voiced:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-handbook-voiceover\" title=\"Minecraft Handbook Voice\">Minecraft Handbook â€“ the first of the series</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-combat-voiceover\" title=\"Minecraft Combat Handbook Voice\">Combat Edition â€“ an epic twist</a></li>\r\n</ul>', '<h2>Why Minecraft Still Matters</h2>\r\n<p>Launched in 2009, Minecraft continues to dominate the sandbox gaming world â€” because if you can imagine it, you can build it. This promo was tied to a new merch drop, giving me a chance to mix fun with formality in the narration.</p>\r\n<p>If you\'re exploring Minecraft for the first time (or the fiftieth), check out the Minecraft official merch shop â€” or browse Mojangâ€™s channels for more surprises.</p>\r\n<p>As long as they keep making scripts this good, Iâ€™ll happily keep voicing Minecraft videos!</p>', 'minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover.jpg', 'GYR8m1aYAYs', 'Minecraft Backpack Voice â€“ Patrick Stewart Style | Guy', '<h2>ðŸŽ¤ Ready to Add Gravitas to Your Campaign?</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>, explainer, or in-game promo and want a trusted voice with character, Iâ€™d love to help.</p>\r\n<p>Want more in this style? Try:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\" title=\"Lending Crowd Voice\">Lending Crowd</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover\" title=\"European Summit Voice\">European Collaboration Summit</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Iâ€™m happy to provide a quick sample from your script if you\'d like to check the fit â€” <a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Minecraft%20Promo%20Voiceover%20Enquiry\">drop me an email</a> and letâ€™s bring your idea to life.</p>', 'August 2019', '1', 'Minecraft Backpack Promo Voice â€“ Patrick Stewart Style', '5', '', 'Patrick Stewart voice - Minecraft Backpack', '', '<h2>More in This Voice Style</h2>\r\n<p>If you enjoyed this, donâ€™t miss some of my other parodic or epic takes using the same delivery style:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover\">Hide the Corpse â€“ deadpan meets absurd</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart\">CBS NFL King Henry â€“ big drama, bigger voice</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\">Lending Crowd â€“ formal meets friendly</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover\">European Summit â€“ polished and professional</a></li>\r\n</ul>', '', '', '', 'character-voiceovers.jpg', '', '', ''),
(870, 'european-collaboration-summit-tickets-voiceover', 'European Collaboration Summit', '<p>A clear, conversational style of voiceover for this European Collaboration Summit promo.</p>', 'conversational', 'guy Harris provided a clean, professional, conversational voiceover for the European Collaboration Summit\'s big 2020 conference. Find out more!', '<h2>Professional Voiceover for the 2020 European Collaboration Summit</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve actually provided voiceover for the European Collaboration Summit once before, with my classic <a href=\"european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"European Collaboration Summit Patrick Stewart Voice\">Patrick Stewart Voice</a>. So, given how well the last video worked out, I was more than happy to work with them again. They wanted a very different style for this video, but there was still plenty of humour throughout the script, so I had a great time with it. This is my softer, natural voiceover style, and it\'s a great for this kind of advertisement, but it\'s especially good for <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> where you need the information to be as clear as possible.</p>', '<h2>A little more about the European Collab Summit 2020</h2>\r\n<p>The European Collaboration Summit is a major European modern workplace event about everything related to office work, incluing things like Office 365, Teams, SharePoint, Power Platform, and a huge range of business apps. It\'s essentially the best place in the world to attend if you\'re looking for new tools to increase your office\'s productivity. They put on a new summit each year and it\'s always well attended. I like the effort they put into their ads and I\'m always happy to work with these guys. Check out their website in the link above and find out if the summit is what you\'ve been looking for to take your business to the next level. And, if you need to know how to book a ticket, just watch this video again!</p>\r\n', 'european-collaboration-summit-tickets-voiceover.jpg', 'Avsn2i7m8oY', 'European Collaboration Summit 2020 Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a new <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or something else altogether, and you need a high-quality professional voiceover artist, then please feel free to get in touch. I am always happy to consider new work and I\'m more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script to help you hear whether my voice is right for your particular project. It might also interest you to know that I can usually return my recorded voiceover to you on the same day it\'s requested â€” which is perfect for anyone on a tight schedule.</p>', 'Sept 2020', '1', 'european-collaboration-summit-tickets-voiceover', '3', '', 'A soft, conversational voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(871, 'vadda-mera-govind-patrick-stewart-narrator-voiceover', 'Epic Patrick Stewart-Style Voice', '<p>An epic, storytelling voiceover performance.</p>', 'storyteller', 'Check out the voiceover from Guy Harris on this Dharam Seva Records\' \'My Govind is Great\' video. While any epic voice might do, nothing beats Patrick Stewart!', '<h2>A voiceover gig like no other</h2>\r\n<p>From <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceovers</a>, <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\"  title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">game trailers</a>, and <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV commercials</a>, there are some projects and products I am very used to providing voiceover for. But every now and then I get some work that is entitely different, and this \'Govind is Great\' video from Dharam Seva Records is exactly that! Despite my unfamiliarity with the subject matter, I know an expertly crafted video when I see one. The visuals were epic, so I decided to use my equally epic <a href=\"minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover\" title=\"Patrick Stewart Voiceover\">patrick Stewart voiceover</a>! I\'m really pleased with the result and so were the team over at Dharam Seva Records</p>', '<h2>A little more about Dharam Seva Records</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://dharam-seva.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Dharam Seva Records\">DharamSeva Records</a> is a non-profit organisation dedicated to promoting extra-ordinary dharamic music releases for audiences who love Punjabi music. The company\'s sevadaars used their skills and connections to set up a fully integrated musical and production network, which consists of singers, songwriters, music producers, video producers, social media managers, a PR team and, most importantly, a not-for-profit record label. All DharamSeva Records profits are reinvested into creating bigger and better â€˜dharamicâ€™ projects. It was great to work with the team over at DharamSeva Records; the video they created is nothing short of breathtaking and I enjoyed working on a completely different kind of voiceover performance!</p>\r\n', 'vada-mera-govind-patrick-stewart-narrator-voiceover.jpg', 'WRbvbrHN-Tw', 'Vadda Mera Govind - Epic Patrick Stewart Voice | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a project like this one by DharamSeva Records, or if you\'re working on something else altogether, then perhaps we can work together to ensure the final product is just as high-quality. If you\'d like to work with me, please don\'t hesitate to get in touch. I try to be as helpful as possible, so I\'m happy to read out and send over a free voiceover sample from your script to help you figure out whether or not my voice is a good fit for your project. I do much more than just an epic Patrick Stewart voice, however, so make sure to browse through the rest of my site!</p>', 'April 18', '1', 'vada-mera-govind-patrick-stewart-narrator-voiceover', '0', '', 'A truly unique voiceover job for Mada Mera', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(873, 'turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover', 'Football Commentator - Turkish Air', '<p>My football commentator voiceover strikes again, this time for Turkish Airlines.</p>', '', 'Guy Harris voiced the football commentator-style narration for Turkish Airlines\' advert. Hear the full read and explore more football commentator voiceovers.', '<h2>Another football commentator voiceover job</h2>\r\n<p>Anyone who knows me knows I\'m not really into football, so it always makes me laugh that I keep getting booked for football commentator voiceover gigs. This Turkish Airlines spot was one of many recent projects, sitting alongside jobs like <a href=\"/iboy-football-commentator\" title=\"iBoy Voiceover\">iBoy</a> and <a href=\"/champion-eleven-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Champion Eleven Voice\">Champion Eleven</a>. If you\'re looking for more examples of this style, you can also check out my main <a href=\"/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">football commentator voice page</a>. Despite not being a football fanatic, Iâ€™ve somehow become the go-to for this sound, and I always enjoy getting stuck into new commentary-led scripts.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Turkish Airlines</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.turkishairlines.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Turkish Airlines\">Turkish Airlines</a> is Turkey\'s largest airline and has been flying since 1933 when it started out with just five aircraft. Today they operate hundreds of planes and are consistently ranked among the best airlines in the world. Their cooking-on-an-airplane concept for this advert was a fun twist on the usual football-style commentary, and it was great to bring that energy to the project. If you\'d like to hear more examples of my commentary reads, you can head over to my main <a href=\"/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">football commentator voice page</a>.</p>', 'turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover.jpg', 'ZIjKH-upYBI', 'Turkish Airlines Football Commentator Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re working on an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> or <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> and want something similar to the Turkish Airlines spot, feel free to get in touch. Iâ€™m always happy to provide a custom sample from your script so you can hear whether I\'m the right fit. You can also browse more commentary-style projects on my <a href=\"/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">football commentator voice showcase</a>.</p>\r\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\r\n    <audio controls style=\"width:100%; max-width:420px;\">\r\n        <source src=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\r\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n    </audio>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;\">\r\n        Football Commentator Showreel â€“ Guy Harris\r\n    </p>\r\n</div>', 'Sept 2019', '1', 'turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover', '3', 'Turkish Airlines voiceover\",\"football commentator voice\",\"sports commercial voice', 'Turkish Airline football commentator voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(874, 'storro-secure-cloud-explainer-video-voiceover', 'Storro, Cloud Storage Explainer', '<p>A clean, natural voiceover style Storro\'s well-written and well-produced explainer video</p>', '', 'Check out Storro\'s new explainer video with voiceover provided by Guy Harris. Explainer videos are an incredibly powerful way to do justice to complex products.', '<h2>Another great explainer video!</h2>\r\n<p>Anyone who knows me well or has spent more than a few minutes on my website will know that I provide voiceover for A LOT of explainer videos. Explainer videos are longer videos that go into more detail about the product or service they\'re trying to sell. They are mini-tutorials and they are perfect for any company trying to sell something complex, as you don\'t want to undersell your product by failing to adequately describe exactly what\'s so great about it! If you\'d like to hear a few more examples of my explainer videos, check out my <a href=\"michelin-cross-climate-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Michelin Cross Climate Tyres\">\"Michelin Cross Climate Tyres</a> and <a href=\"bbk-travel-insurance-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"BBK\">BBK</a> videos.</p>', '<h2> A little more about Storro</h2>\r\n<p>Storro has gone to great lengths to provide genuinely safe cloud storage for businesses who need to share data with various stakeholders but don\'t want to risk data breaches and the other kinds of security issues that can come with cloud storage. Given the added complexity of Storro\'s excellent product, they needed a more in-depth video to do their secure cloud storage justice â€” this is exactly why an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> is the perfect fit for them. I really like how this video turned out â€” which is particualrly due to the skill of <a href=\"https://elisethe.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Elise\">Elise</a>, a brilliant Motion Graphic Designer based in the Netherlands.</p>', 'storro-secure-cloud-explainer-video-voiceover.jpg', '361011399', ' Storro Explainer Video Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a new <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> and you think you might need a soft, natural voiceover to really sell it, then please get in touch. And if you need to know more about explainer videos, check out my  <a href=\"what-is-explainer-video-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"What is an Explainer Video\">What is an Explainer Video</a> blog. If you need it, I am also happy to supply a free voiceover sample from your script to allow you to hear whether or not my voice is a good fit for your project.</p>', 'Oct 2019', '0', 'storro-secure-cloud-explainer-video-voiceover', '0', '', 'Another explainer voice video', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(876, 'tente-explainer-voiceover', 'Happy Voiceover Style for TENTE', '<p>Another great explainer video under my belt</p>', 'happy', 'Guy Harris provided the bright, natural voiceover for TENTE\'s great new explainer video. This video explains exactly what makes TENTE at the top of its industry', '<h2>TENTE\'s explainer video</h2>\r\n<p>If you spend more than a few minutes on my website â€” perhaps you\'re checking out my work to see whether you\'d like to work with me â€” then you\'ll notice that I do more <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> than any other style of video. This is because explainer videos are rising in popularity as brands with niche or complex products search for a better way to sell themselves. And that\'s exactly that TENTE has done with this well made explainer video. Not every prduct or service I help sell is flashy, but that doesn\'t meant that your explainer videos or commercials can\'t be flashy! If you\'d like to hear a few more of my explainer video voiceovers, check out my <a href=\"traxart-explainer-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Traxart\">Traxart</a> and <a href=\"home-composting-explainer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Home Composting\">Home Composting</a> videos.</p>', '<h2>A little more about TENTE</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.tente.com/en-gb\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"TENTE\">TENTE</a> is a castors and wheels company that provides extremely high-quality products to a huge range of industries, including institutional, medical, and manufacturing industries. TENTE is all about offering more than just practical products; it\'s about combining high-quality movement solutions with the flexibility to suit different companies\' needs â€” even branding their products to suit your brand guidelines. It was great to work with the people over at TENTE. I think they\'ve made a really great explainer video and I\'d be happy to work with them again in the future.</p>', 'tente-explainer-voiceover.jpg', 't_DDfKFjoRk', 'TENTE Explainer â€“ Product Video Voiceover by Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on an explainer video or a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> and you need a happy voiceover style like the one I provided for TENTE, then please use the form to contact me. I like working with new companies, on products and services I\'ve never worked with before. It\'s the best part of my job, really. If you\'d like a little help working out if my voice is right for your next project, I\'ll be happy to read a free sample of your script.</p>', 'July 19', '1', 'tente-explainer-voiceover', '0', '', 'Happy voiceover for explainer video', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `messages2` (`id`, `url`, `page_title`, `info`, `search_terms`, `page_desc`, `text1`, `text2`, `image`, `video`, `meta_title`, `bottomtext`, `date`, `whatvideo`, `alt`, `rating`, `twitter`, `hometext`, `santa`, `ntext1`, `ntext2`, `ntext3`, `ntext4`, `nimage1`, `nimage2`, `nimage3`, `nimage4`) VALUES
(877, 'my-dpd-explainer-voice-over', 'Explainer Video Voiceover for myDPD', '<p>Another day, another great explainer video</p>', 'softer', 'The new myDPD explainer video was voiced by Guy Harris, the Voiceover Guy. This was a soft voiceover style and it worked out really well. Find out more!', '<h2>An explainer video with a softer style</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve done so many <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> that I\'ve lost count. They\'re a great way to take a little more time and care to describe your product to your target audience. As a voiceover artist, explainer videos are distilled communication, as their main purpose is to offer as much information as possible in a short timeframe. That\'s exactly what the myDPD script achieved and I decided that a softer voiceover style would be a good fit here. If you\'d like a few more explainer video examples, check out my <a href=\"wirecard-male-voice-over\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wirecard\">Wirecard</a>, and <a href=\"batelco-wifi-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Batelco\">Batelco</a> videos.</p>', '<h2>A little more about DPD</h2>\r\n<p>You probably don\'t need me to tell you much about <a href=\"https://www.dpd.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"DPD\">DPD</a>, as it\'s one of the largest shipping, currier, and delivery companies in the world. However, I like to write a little bit about all of the companies I work with, so indulge me â€” you might even learn something new! Based in Germany, DPD ships all over the world and it has a reputation for efficiency and reliability. <a href=\"https://www.dpd.co.uk/content/my_dpd/index.jsp\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"MyDPD\">myDPD</a> was the topic of the explainer video and it is a specific, personal service for account holders that brings alll of your shipping needs and proceedures together into one neat and convenient platform.</p>', 'my-dpd-explainer-voice-over.jpg', 'amc6e6-6YzA', 'MyDPD Explainer Video â€“ Voiceover by Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch with me</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on an explainer video like this one for DPD, or if you\'re working on a shorter <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> and you\'re looking for a similar voiceover style, please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I am always happy to work with new companies and I\'m sure I\'ll have the right voiceover style for you in my repertoire of voices and <a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">characters</a>. If you need a little more convincing, I am more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script. This way, you can hear whether or not I\'m right for your project.</p>', 'July 2019', '1', 'my-dpd-explainer-voice-over', '3', '', 'Who is the voice of myDPD?', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(878, 'breda-university-of-applied-sciences-voice', 'Breda University Commercials', '<p>A series of commercials and explainers for Breda University</p>', 'friendly', 'The Breda University of Applied Sciences ad series was voiced by Guy Harris, the Voiceover Guy. This functions as a short explainer video. Find out more!', '<h2>Friendly and approachable voiceover for Breda University</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve done so many different <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercials</a> and <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> over the years, but I can\'t remember working with a university before, so this was a great new experience for me. Breda University got in touch and told me they were working on a series of new videos designed to encourage people to take their courses. So, with the sales element there, and the audience in mind, I opted for a friendly, approachable voiceover style to encourage students to sign up. I\'m really pleased with the final result.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Breda University</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.buas.nl/en\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Breda University\">Breda University of Applied Sciences</a> is a government-funded university in Breda, in North Brabant, the Netherlands. It is comprised on 7K+ students â€” both a mix of domestic and international students â€” and its focus is on applied sciences, such as Games, Media, Logistics, Built Environment, Hotel, Facility, Tourism and Leisure, and Events. Breda University has a great reputation and the practical focus of its courses is perfect for students who are looking for a particularly practical qualification. The university used to be called NHTV Breda, and it has recently changed its name. It was great working with Breda and with the animation people: Cooler Media Netherlands.</p>', 'breda-university-of-applied-sciences-voice.jpg', '74cnJtqKyrw', 'Breda University of Applied Sciences Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a product a little similar to this video or the others I worked on for Breda University, then please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. Whether it\'s a commercial or an explainer video, I have worked with hundreds of other companies and institutions and I\'m sure I can find the right voice to suit your project. However, if you need a little more convincing, I\'d be happy to provide a free sample, read from your script â€” that way you can hear directly whether or not my voice is a good fit for your brand.</p>', 'July 19', '1', 'breda-university-of-applied-sciences-voice', '3', '', 'A natural voiceover - Breda University', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(879, 'ariel-pods-voiceover', 'Short How-to Video for Ariel Pods', '<p>A \'clean\' voice for this product â€” pun absolutely intended.</p>', '', 'Check out the new Ariel Pods \'How to\' video with Guy Harris as the voiceover artist. This is a succinct explianer video telling you how to use Ariel Pods. ', '<h2>Ariel Pods Explainer Video</h2>\r\n<p>If your product is better than the competition and you want to explain why, or if it is a little complicated to use your product, then you may benefit from an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>. Explainer videos are essentially just longer commercials that try to convey lots of information in a very short period of time. And that\'s exactly what Ariel has achieved here. They asked for a clear voiceover style to suit their brand and the tone of the video. I\'m really pleased with the end result, and so were they. If you\'d like to hear a few more of my other explainer videos, check out my <a href=\"storro-secure-cloud-explainer-video-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Storro\">Storro</a>, <a href=\"home-composting-explainer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Home Composting\">Home Composting</a>, and <a href=\"crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Crowd Hub X\">Crowd Hub X</a> videos</p>', '<h2>A little more about Ariel</h2>\r\n<p>You probably already have one or two Ariel products in your house â€” especially if you live in the UK. Ariel has been keeping our clothes clean for decades â€” for almost 50 years, in fact. Their pods are really easy to use as you just insert them into the washing machine, straight in with the clothes. However, as the pods can be potentially eaten by babies and toddlers, Ariel needed to design a new kind of bag that would hold them securely out of children\'s curious hands (and mouths). This is the purpose of the explainer video: to ensure that customers fully understand and take advantage of the safety measures Ariel has taken with its pods.</p>', 'ariel-pods-voiceover.jpg', 'KWYxXpx9KEY', 'Ariel Pods Explainer Video Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a new <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">advertisement</a> or <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> and you need a voiceover style similar to the one I performed for Ariel Pods, then please don\'t hesitate to get in touch. I like working with new companies and on a wide variety of voiceover projects. If you like, I can provide a sample from your script; this should help you decide whether I\'m right for your next project.</p>', 'Oct 19', '1', 'ariel-pods-voiceover', '0', '', 'A short and succint explainer video', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(883, 'the-official-voice-of-santa', 'Guy Harris is the Official Voice of Santa', '<p>My Santa voiceover has become one of my most requested jobs! As heard on the Telly, Radio and Events globally.</p>', '', 'Guy is considered the ORIGINAL official voice of Santa, delivering his classic Santa voiceover on CBBC, BBC R2, ITV, This Morning, & more! Accept no substitute!', '<h2>Claiming the Position as the \"Official\" Voice of Santa</h2>\r\n<p>With the sad lack of an official body to designate the undisputed voice of Santa, I think us voiceover artists need to act with our initiative. I have performed more Santa voiceovers than perhaps any other voice, and I love every minute of it. As such, this Christmas I\'ve decided to give myself the crown and declare myself the official voice of Santa. Think this is a bit much? I might be inclined to agree with you, only I\'ve performed the voice of Santa so many times I\'m almost turning into the big man in red! Here is just a snippet of how my Santa voiceover is used. Yes, Santa for Zoe Ball\'s breakfast show on BBC Radio 2. <br>Click if you would you like a <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk/personalised-santa-message/all\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"FREE Personal message from Santa\">FREE Personal message from Santa</a>.</p>', '<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yi-4Fm40nmE\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"CBBC Santa Voice\">CBBC</a>, This Morning, Loose Women, HEART Radio, Bauer Radio Stations â€” hundreds of radio stations, in fact â€” <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Radio\">Santa Radio</a>, Santa\'s voice a the Poundland tils (that\'s really me!), Not forgetting <a href=\"bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"BBC Radio 2 Santa Voice\">BBC Radio 2</a>. Honestly, that\'s not even all of them; I\'m just exhausted trying to find everything! I love being the voice of Santa and it\'s my hope that my move to crown myself the official voice of Santa will encourage more brands and production companies to get in touch. Nothing gets me in the Chrismtas spirit quite like doing an impression of old Father Christmas himself!</p>', 'official-voice-of-santa-guy-harris.jpg', 'Qqu-HDA2KJE', 'The Official Voice of Santa â€“ Father Christmas Voiceover', '<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>Do you need the voice of Christmas for your next <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or production project? If so, do please feel free to get in touch. You can listen to all of my different previous Santa voiceover jobs if that helps, but I\'m also happy to provide a free sample from your script so that you can hear first hand whether my Santa voice is right for your project!<br>You can even listen in and direct the session too and hear Santa in action.</p>', 'Nov 2019', '1', 'the-official-voice-of-santa', '3', '', 'The UK\'s Voice of Santa?', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(886, 'voiceover-services-uk', 'Voice Overs UK', '<p>Looking for a voiceover artist in the UK?</p>', '', 'Are you looking for voice over services in the UK? Guy Harris (AKA VoiceoverGuy) has almost 20 yearsâ€™ experience in the industry. Find out more!', '<h2> Hire a Professional Male Voiceover Artist</h2>\r\n<p>As a VoiceoverGuy, I try to ensure that my website fully represents the voiceover services I offer. This is, essentially, my shopfront, and I want anyone visiting my site to be able to shop around for the voiceover style that suits their specific project. I pride myself in replying quickly to new job requests â€” usually even getting my voice overs back to people on the same day they request them. While I work with companies all over the world (the benefit of having my own top-of-the-range recording studio), I wanted to create a page about voiceover work in the UK as this is still where the majority of my work comes from. If youâ€™d like to hire me and my voiceover talents for your next project, please <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. And keep reading below to find out more about my skills and experience.</p>', '<h2>UK Explainer Video Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>I perhaps do more explainer videos than any other kind of voiceover work. I think this is because more and more companies are discovering this medium and they are impressed with how effective it can be. Explainer videos are effectively longer commercials that spend more time and care explaining a companyâ€™s product or some other more complex idea. This style of video is perfect for finance and hi-tech companies who need to spend a little longer explaining to their audience exactly whatâ€™s so good about their products. Check out my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video voiceover page</a> if youâ€™d like to learn more and to hear a few examples of my work. If you operate in the UK or you just want a tried-and-tested British voiceover for your next explainer video, Iâ€™d love to hear from you.</p>', 'voiceover-services-uk-explainer.jpg', 'TqkdBK8mBW8', 'British Voiceover Services â€“ Hire Guy Harris', '<h2>Do get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>(And if something youâ€™re looking for isnâ€™t here, just search for it in the search bar above, just <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">contact me</a> to ask for it directly!)</p>', 'Nov 2019', '1', 'voiceover-services-uk', '3', '', 'A look at my different voiceover services', '', '<h2>UK Commercial Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>Commercial voiceover is a different side of the same coin as explainer video voiceover, and itâ€™ is perhaps what people think of when I tell them Iâ€™m a voiceover artist. Almost every TV advertisement makes use of commercial voiceover, and absolutely all radio ads use voiceover to sell products and services to their listeners. The right voice can cause viewers/listeners to stop and take notice. From funny, quirky voiceover styles to solid, natural voiceovers that inspire confidence, Iâ€™ve done almost every kind of commercial possible, so check out my <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover page</a> to hear a few examples of my work and to see (hear) whether my various voices are right for your next TV, radio, or online commercial. One thing that has served me well throughout my career is my natural English accent; while I can do a wide range of different accents, many people actively seek out natural English accents as they often have the broadest appeal, both in the UK and around the world. If youâ€™d like to work with me but youâ€™re not completely sure that my voice is the perfect fit for your next project, Iâ€™ll be more than happy to send over a free sample from your script.</p>', '<h2>Other British Voiceover Styles</h2>\r\n<p>There are too many variations of voiceover styles to do justice to here, so Iâ€™ve combined some more of my UK voiceover styles into one section. While most things fit into the category of explainer or commercial voiceover, there are still plenty of other projects that require a professional British voiceover artist. Here is a concise list of some of my other voiceover styles:\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">Movie trailer voiceover</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">Game trailer voiceover</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voiceover</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voiceover</a>\r\n<br>\r\n<a href=\"character-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">My range of character voiceovers</a>\r\n</p>', '', '', 'voiceover-services-uk-commercial-voice.jpg', 'voiceover-services-uk-british-voice.jpg', '', ''),
(887, 'psycho-circus-scary-evil-voice', 'Scary Evil Halloween Voiceover', '<p>A frighteningly good promo with evil voiceover from yours truly</p>', '', 'Guy Harris is the scary evil voice behind the excellent video promo from Dutch company, Alda. This event looks great and so does the video! Check it out!', '<h2>A rare scary voiceover gig</h2>\r\n<p>I\'m so used to being asked to voice children\'s toy commercials and to do <a href=\"santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">the voice of Santa</a> that I sometimes forget that I have a pretty accomplished <a href=\"halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voiceover\">halloween voice</a>. I don\'t get asked for my scary voice that often, but it\'s one of my favourites. There are various kinds of scary voiceover, but this one is especially deep and gravelly. If you like it and you\'d like to hear more, check out my <a href=\"dracula-voiceover-for-halloween\" title=\"Poundland Dracula Voice\">Poundland Dracula Voice</a> and my <a href=\"halloween-voiceover\" title=\"Halloween Voiceover Showreel\">Halloween Voiceover Showreel</a>.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Alda and Escape: Psycho Circus</h2>\r\n<p>A lot of credit for this excellent video has to go to Alda, the production company that produced it. With a motto like \'Music is what feelings sound like\', it\'s no surprise that the audio was so well produced. The video is advertising <a href=\"https://escapehalloween.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Escape: Psycho Circus\">Escape: Psycho Circus</a>, a huge festival packed with circus acts, music performances, and other macabre spectacles. If the event is half as good as the video, then it\'s sure to be amazing!</p>', 'psycho-circus-scary-voice.jpg', 'E9YxOpjqeq8', 'Escape: Psycho Circus Scary Evil Voice | Guy Harris', '<h2>Let\'s work together!</h2>\r\n<p>Are you working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> a little like this one I did for Escape: Psycho Circus? Need a scary voice? Need something else altogether? Well, I have a huge range of voiceovers to choose from and I\'m always happy to hear from new companies, so don\'t hesitate to get in touch. I\'m also happy to give you a free sample from your script so that you can hear whether my voice is a good fit for you project.</p>', 'Feb 2019', '1', 'psycho-circus-evil-scary-voice', '5', '', 'A deep scary evil voice - fantastic promo', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(889, 'nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart', 'Patrick Stewart Voice for CBS & NFL', '<p>A bright, Patrick Stewart-style voice for CBS\'s NFL promo</p>', '', 'Guy Harris is is the bright, Patrick-Stewart-style voice of the king in CBS\'s quaint NFL promo. Click the link to watch the video and find out more!', '<h2>A Shakespearian-style voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>Needless to say, I was excited when CBS, one of the United States\' biggest stations, got in touch. I had worked with them before, using my <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voiceover</a> and they came back for more. In fact, quite a lot of my work is repeat business; which I think is because I do a great job but also because I get my voiceover back to people very quickly (usually the same day). They asked for a Shakespearian voice, and I gave them the voice of one of Britain\'s best-loved Shakespearian actors: Sir Patrick Stewart. My <a href=\"patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Patrick Stewart Voiceover\">Patrick Stewart Voice</a> is tried and tested and it turned out to be a great fit!</p>', '<h2>A little more about CBS and the NFL</h2>\r\n<p>Even in the UK, on the other side of the Atlantic, most of us know about <a href=\"https://www.cbs.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"CBS\">CBS</a> and the <a href=\"https://www.nfl.com/international\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"NFL\">NFL</a>. CBS is one of of the biggest TV stations an they were making a promo for a big NFL (American football) team called the Titans as they\'d had a \'fairytale\' run through the playoffs. This was why the promo was delivered as an old fairytale. This was a pretty huge deal as the video was shown to millions of viewers prior to the game!</p>', 'nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart.jpg', 'QpMHwEoFJR0', 'Patrick Stewart Voice for CBS & NFL | Guy Harris', '<h2>Would you like to work with me?</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'ve read right to the end then there\'s a good chance you\'re interested in working with me on a project of your own. If you\'re working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, or perhaps a longer <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, and you\'d like something similar to this voiceover I provided for CBS, then please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I\'m always happy to hear from new companies, and I\'ll be happy to provide a free voiceover sample from your scrip so that you can hear whether or not my voice is right for your specific project!</p>', 'Jan 2020', '1', 'nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart', '3', '', 'Awesome Patrick Stewart voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(890, 'this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice', 'This Morning Spin 2 Win Gameshow', '<p>A great opportunity to try out my game show voiceover on This Morning.</p>', 'itv, competition', 'The voice of ITVâ€™s Spin to Win! Guy Harris brings energy and excitement to This Morningâ€™s popular live gameshow with classic gameshow host style VO.', '<h2>My game show voice on This Morning</h2>\r\n<p>I provide voiceover to shows and companies all over the world, but it\'s always nice to work with TV shows closer to home. ITV\'s This Morning got in touch because they had a great new game show portion of their show and they needed a bright, upbeat <a href=\"gameshow-host\" title=\"Game Show Host Voiceover\">gameshow host voice</a> and they got in touch with me. I really like how the voiceovers turned out. If you\'d like to hear a few more examples of this style of voice, check out my <a href=\"change-challenge-gameshow-voice\" title=\"Change Challenge Gameshow Voice\">Change Challenge Game Show</a> and <a href=\"northern-gas-advert\" title=\"Northern Gas Gameshow Voice\">Northern Gas Game Show</a> videos!</p>', '<h2>A little more about This Morning</h2>\r\n<p>When I write up the work I do with radio stations, brands, and TV shows, I like to say a little more about them, but <a href=\"https://www.itv.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"This Morning\">This Morning</a> is one of the most famous, best-loved shows in the UK, so I\'m not sure what to say... The show is hosted by TV legends Phillip Schofield and Holly Willoughby and they have a huge range of guests and interest stories each week. <br>In 2022 I became the <a href=\"voice-of-santa-guy-harris\" title=\"ITV Voice of Santa\">Voice of Santa</a> for ITV Daytimes too.</p>', 'this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice.jpg', 'lMgRXetDlKU', 'This Morning Spin to Win Game Show Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>You\'ve read this far, so I reckon there\'s a good chance you\'re working on your own project and you\'re in need of a professional voiceover artist! If you\'re working on a TV show, <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>, <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or something else altogether, then do get in touch. I love hearing from new companies and I\'m more than happy to provide a bespoke voice sample from your script.</p>', 'Jan 2020', '1', 'this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice', '5', '', 'Gameshow voice on THIS Morning', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(894, 'poundland-yoda-voice', 'Yoda Voiceover for Poundland', '<p>I\'m the voice of Yoda at Poundland\'s tills and I\'m pretty proud of this!</p>', '', 'The tills in Poundland speak to customers in the voice of yoda, and Guy Harris is the voiceover artist behind it. Read more about this, you must!', '<h2>The voice of Yoda, I am</h2>\r\n<p>My job doesn\'t get much sillier or much more fun than providing the voice of Yoda for Poundland\'s self-checkouts. Yoda\'s voice and his strange sentence structure (something called anastrophe) make him one of the most iconic and memorable characters in cinema history. While lots of people I know can do a decent impression of Yoda, I\'m especially pleased with my impression â€” years and years as a voiceover artist have proven useful for some things... This isn\'t the first self-checkout voiceover I\'ve done: I also provided a sort of <a href=\"dracula-voiceover-for-halloween\" title=\"scary Dracula voice for Poundland\">scary Dracula voice for Poundland</a> (which won an award) and my <a href=\"santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voiceover</a> has been used in dozens of stores. It\'s nice to add Yoda to my range of <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character voiceovers</a>', '<h2>A little more about Poundland</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve worked with <a href=\"https://www.poundland.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Poundland\">Poundland</a> before, on the Halloween voiceover I mentioned above, and they\'re a great company to work with. I love the idea of adding a bit of entertainment at self-checkouts and I also think that the writing on the scripts they\'ve sent me is really good. Poundland is a bit of a British institution now, for people who want to save a bit of money on toys, household items, some groceries, and a pretty wide range of other products. I wonder what checkout voice Poundland will ask me to do next...</p>', 'poundland-yoda-voice.jpg', 'sep_ayoxoGw', 'Poundland Yoda Voiceover â€“ Character Voice by Guy Harris', '<h2>Would you like to work with me?</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'ve read all the way to the end, then I thank you. If you\'re this interested in my voiceover work, then there\'s a good chance you might be looking for someone like me to help with your next project. Whether it\'s a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV or radio ad</a>, a longer <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or even a novelty self-checkout voiceover, I\'m always happy to hear from new companies. Get in touch and tell me all about your project and I\'ll be more than happy to provide a free voiceover sample from your script â€” this way you\'ll know for sure whether one of my many voiceover styles is a good fit for you.</p>', 'Oct 2019', '1', 'poundland-yoda-voice', '3', '', 'Provide the voice of Yoda, I did!', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(896, 'urbaser-recycling-explainer-video', 'Urbaser Recycling Explaier Video', '<p>Pleased to add my voiceover skills to this well-animated explainer video.</p>', '', 'Guy Harris is the voiceover artist for Urbaser\'s great explainer video about how non-recyclable waste is being used to create power for our homes. Find out more', '<h2>Another great explainer video!</h2>\r\n<p>If you spend a little time looking through my blog, you\'ll find a huge range of different voiceover jobs. However, you may notice that perhaps my most common voiceover job is for <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a>. This kind of video is perfect for getting across complex processes, often for companies with intricate products or services that really need to spend a little while explaining their products for customers to understand why they\'re so good. If you\'d like to hear a few more of my explainer videos, check out my <a href=\"my-dpd-explainer-voice-over\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"DPD Brexit\">DPD Brexit</a>, <a href=\"michelin-cross-climate-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Michelin Cross Climate\">Michelin Cross Climate</a>, or <a href=\"wirecard-male-voice-over\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Wirecard\">Wirecard</a> videos.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Urbaser</h2>\r\n<p>I provided voiceover for this excellent explainer video through <a href=\"https://bexmedia.net\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"BexMedia\">BexMedia</a>, who do some amazing animation and motion graphics. Urbaser is a leading provider of recycling and eeaste disposal services in the UK, but they also operate in Madrid, Paris, Porto, and parts of South America. Urbaser is a huge company and it seems to have a fantastic reputation. In this explainer video, they demonstrate enthusiasm for waste management and a clear respect for the environment. I\'d be very happy to work with them on future explainer videos. ', 'urbaser-recycling-explainer-video.jpg', '392249715', 'Urbaser Recycling Explainer Video | Voiceover Guy', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'ve read right to the end of this blog, then I think there might be a good chance you\'re interested in my voiceover talents. If you\'d like me to provide voiceover for your next explainer video,  <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>,  <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer</a>, or something else altogether, then I\'m more than happy to hear from you. If looking through various links on this blog doesn\'t give you a strong enough idea of what I\'m capable of, I\'d be more than happy to send you a free voiceover sample from your script. That way you can hear whether I\'m right for your brand or project. So, what are you waiting for? Get in touch</a>', 'April 2020', '0', 'urbaser-recycling-explainer-video', '3', '', 'A clever explainer video for a clever idea', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(897, 'ford-trucks-international-a-million-thanks', 'Ford Trucks International Voiceover', '<p>A soft-spoken voiceover for one of the biggest logistics manufacturers in the world</p>', '', 'Guy Harris is the voiceover artist behind Ford Trucks International\'s great new ad thanking everyone helping to carry the load during the COVID-19 Crisis. ', '<h2>It\'s amazing how much good music elevates voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>Ford Trucks International got in touch and asked me to provide a soft, calm, reassuring voiceover for their new video. This video thanks all of the people around the world who are working through this crisis, providing necessary medical care, food, and support to keep the world moving. The video has a sweet message and I\'m very pleased with my performance, but what struck me particularly with this commercial was that the music completely elevated my voiceover. And, I also think my voiceover elevated the music. When an ad like this works best, its audience feels something. I helped make this video and even I felt something when I watched the final cut. If you\'d like to hear more like this, with a similar soft voiceover style, check out my Waitrose and <a href=\"micropolitics-suzys-beauty-salon\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Micropolitics\">Micropolitics</a> videos</p>', '<h2>A little more about Ford Trucks International</h2>\r\n<p>This isn\'t actually the first time I\'ve worked with Ford Trucks, so I was very glad that they wanted to work with me again. I\'d previously provided voiceover for their F Max Campaign and I think it turned out pretty well. It\'s tricky to say a little more about one of the biggest automotive manufacturers in the world. Obviously, Ford make all kinds of vehicles, but this particular subsidiary of the company specialises in trucks used in the international logistics industry.  Chances are you\'ve seen thousands of Ford Trucks over the years and that much of your weekly shop and other essentials you need get to your local shops because of them!</p>', 'ford-trucks-international-a-million-thanks.jpg', 'bqgXV1x_WN4', 'Ford Trucks International Voiceover | Voiceover Guy', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for professional voiceover for your next <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, please <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I\'m always happy to hear from new companies and I\'m more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample, read from your script. This option is perfect for people who need to be sure my voice is the perfect fit for their brand or project</p>', 'April 2020', '1', 'ford-trucks-international-a-million-thanks', '3', '', 'A powerful video from a great brand', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(898, 'barclaycard-fraud-fighter-tool-voiceover', 'Barclaycard Fraud Fighter Tool ', '<p>A nice, understated voiceover for a no-so-understated commercial</p>', 'understated natural soft calm', 'Calm, trustworthy and preciseâ€”Guy Harris narrates Barclaycardâ€™s Fraud Fighter Tool ad, promoting clarity and security for customers with confidence.', '<h2>It\'s always great to work on funny commercials</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve done so many <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceovers</a> I\'ve lost count, and I love my job. But I love my job just a little bit more when I\'m asked to provide voiceover for a genuinely hilarious TV advertisement.  If you\'ve haven\'t watched the video on this page yet, please do! Barclaycard asked me to provide a soft, reassuring voiceover for this ad as, despite the humour, the message is serious. I\'m asked for a soft, understated voiceover quite a lot and I think it\'s one of my best voiceover styles. If you\'d like to hear a few more examples, check out my <a href=\"seat-hidden-heroes-adrian\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Seat Hidden Heroes\">Seat Hidden Heroes</a>, <a href=\"vegetarian-society\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Vegetarian Society\">Vegetarian Society</a>, and <a href=\"save-water\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Save Water\">Save Water</a> videos.</p>', '<h2>A little more about Barclaycard</h2>\r\n<p>Barclaycard is a brand of credit cards owned by Barclays PLC and it will require no introduction at all in the UK as it\'s one of the most popular credit cards, used by approximately 10 million people. It\'s great to work with such a big brand and I\'m very glad to see them working hard to help customers understand the dangers and difficulties associated with online credit card fraud. It\'s great to see companies putting effort into helping people keep their finances safe from fraudsters!</p>', 'barclaycard-fraud-fighter-tool-voiceover.jpg', 'UMGNcnwf0eg', 'Voiceover for Barclaycard Fraud Fighter Tool | Vocieover Guy', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>You\'ve read all the way to the bottom, and I\'m guessing that means you\'re interested in my voiceover services. If you\'re looking for a calm, natural voiceover style like this one I did for Barclaycard, then please feel free to get in touch. If it helps you make a decision, I\'m happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script. It\'s also worth noting that because I have my own recording studio in my house, I can react to new enquiries very quickly and I can usually get a client\'s voiceover back to them on the same day they\'ve asked for it!</p>', 'April 2020', '1', 'barclaycard-fraud-fighter-tool-voiceover', '5', '', 'Understated no nonsense voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(901, 'natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice', 'Natural Instincts â€” Attenborough', '<p>A pretty perfect use for my tried-and-tested David Attenborough voice.</p>', 'gaming parodyâ€œnature', 'Find out more about the Natural Instincts game trailer and Guy Harris, the voiceover artist responsible for the David Attenborough voice featured in the trailer', '<h2>My Attenborough Voice Gets Back to Nature</h2>\r\n<p>Anyone whoâ€™s spent more than 30 seconds on my site knows Iâ€™ve a rather popular <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough impression</a>. From <a href=\"/horizon-zero-dawn-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Voice Horizon Game\">epic game trailers like Horizon Zero Dawn</a> to viral <a href=\"/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Turkish Airlines Attenborough Voice\">airline parodies</a>, I get asked to voice all sorts of wild and wonderful scripts in the style of Sir David.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So, when the opportunity came up to lend that voice to a nature simulation game, <strong>Natural Instincts</strong>, it felt like a match made in gaming heaven. The concept was spot on â€“ a nature documentary simulation, teaching players how to protect animals and ecosystems.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If youâ€™d like to experiment with your own scripts, you can try out the free <a href=\"/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice Generator\">Attenborough Voice Generator</a> and see how your idea might sound!</p>', '<h2>About Natural Instincts</h2>\r\n<p><strong>Natural Instincts</strong> is an interactive nature sim game that began life on Kickstarter. The premise: protect the environment, guide animal behaviour, and learn how ecosystems thrive â€“ all delivered in a relaxing gameplay loop.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Itâ€™s educational, itâ€™s beautifully animated, and it was an ideal excuse to go full-Attenborough. Whether narrating a baby badgerâ€™s struggle or a squirrelâ€™s foraging frenzy, the project made full use of my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice Style\">signature documentary tone</a>.</p>', 'natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice.jpg', 'yshYPy13QUQ', 'Natural Instincts Trailer Attenborough Voice | Guy Harris', '<h2>Looking for a Natural Narrator?</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re working on a nature-based commercial, explainer, documentary, or game â€“ and fancy giving it the Attenborough-style treatment â€“ Iâ€™d be happy to help. Whether youâ€™ve got a script ready or just a rough idea, drop me a line via the <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">contact form</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Need more examples? Explore my other Attenborough projects:  \r\n<ul>\r\n<li><a href=\"/horizon-zero-dawn-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Game Trailer\">Horizon Zero Dawn Trailer</a></li>  \r\n<li><a href=\"/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Turkish Airlines Attenborough Voice\">Turkish Airlines â€˜Birdâ€™ Spoof</a></li>  \r\n<li><a href=\"/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"David Attenborough Script Generator\">Attenborough Voice Generator</a></li>  \r\n</ul></p>', '2021-07-10', '1', 'natural-instincts-trailer-attenborough-voice', '5', 'david impressionâ€, â€œgaming parodyâ€, â€œnature voiceover', 'Nature and narration combined â€“ perfect pairing', '', '<h2>Would you like to work with me?</h2>\r\n<p>Thanks for reading all the way down here â€“ thereâ€™s a good chance you\'re looking for an experienced British male voiceover artist. Whether you\'re working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, an <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Explainer Video Voice\">explainer</a>, or a <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">game trailer</a>, I\'d be happy to take a look at your script.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>And if itâ€™s the style of <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Sound-Alike\">Sir David Attenborough</a> you\'re after, rest assured: itâ€™ll be delivered with polish, respect, and just the right touch of wildlife wonder.</p>', '', '', '', 'attenborough-voice-og.jpg', '', '', ''),
(902, 'scary-movie-ghost-face-voice', 'Scream Ghost Face Voiceover', '<p>My chilling Ghost Face <strong>male voiceover</strong>, inspired by horror icon Rodger Jackson, is ideal for <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voice\">Halloween</a> ads, promos, and theme park events...</p>', 'halloween horror scary movie', 'My Rodger Jackson-inspired Ghost Face scary voice â€“ perfect for Halloween promos, trailers, and horror content. Fast turnaround & broadcast quality.', '<h2>Classic horror. Killer delivery.</h2>\r\n<p>The iconic \'Ghost Face\' scream from the Scream films is unforgettable â€” and itâ€™s all thanks to Rodger Jackson, the voice actor behind the mask. Iâ€™ve crafted a chilling tribute to his tone, ideal for horror movie trailers, theme park promos, or anything needing a blood-curdling scream. Itâ€™s just one of many <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Character Voice\">evil voiceovers</a> in my Halloween collection.</p>', '<h2>A haunted collection of scary voices</h2>\r\n<p>Alongside this Ghost Face scream, I offer an entire crypt of creepy characters. Try my <a href=\"/dracula-voiceover-for-halloween\" title=\"Count Dracula Voice\">Count Dracula</a>, <a href=\"/joker-voice\" title=\"Joker Voice\">Joker-style</a>, or <a href=\"/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Halloween Laughs\">spooky Halloween laughs</a>. These eerie voiceovers are perfect for everything from game trailers and haunted attractions to theme park events like <a href=\"/alton-towers-scarefest-spooky-voice\" title=\"Alton Towers Scarefest Voice\">Alton Towers Scarefest</a>.</p>', 'scary-movie-ghost-face-voice.jpg', 'veUdsSVFn6A', 'Scream Ghost Face Voice | Scary Halloween Voice | Guy Harris', '<h2>Want this scary voice for your project?</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">Halloween commercial</a>, a <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voice\">spooky narration</a>, or just want to give your content a scary edge, let\'s chat. I usually turn work around same-day, even during fright season.<br>\r\nVisit my <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">contact page</a>\r\n</p>', 'June 2020', '1', 'ghost-face-male-halloween-voiceover', '5', '', 'Ghost Face from Scream and Scary Movie', '', '<h2>Want this voice in your next horror project?</h2>\r\n<p>Whether youâ€™re working on a <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV commercial</a>, <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">game trailer</a>, or Halloween park announcement â€“ I can record your scream-style voiceover fast. My studio delivers <strong>broadcast-quality audio</strong> with <strong>same-day turnaround</strong> in most cases. Need it urgently? Get in touch.</p>', '', '', '', 'halloween-voice-og.jpg', '', '', ''),
(906, 'voice-coaching-by-richard-di-britannia', 'Richard Di Britannia - voice coach.', '<p>Looking for technique tips?</p>', '', 'Voice Coaching by Richard Di Britannia - Having been vocal coached by Richard I can honestly say he is the dogs balls when it comes to voice techniques.', '<h2>Voice Coaching by Richard</h2>\r\n<p>Have you ever wished people would say â€œyouâ€™ve got a nice voiceâ€? Well, all voices work on air â€“ you just need to know how to use yours a little better!\r\n\r\nRichard Di Britanniaâ€™s method of helping people cultivate a great voice is unique. Most coaches work on turning vibrant, natural accents into an old hierarchical relic of the past called â€˜received pronunciationâ€™ by repeating boring tongue twisters â€“ leaving students spending their days worried about slipping back into their native tongue when they get tired or excited.\r\n\r\nIs all that stress really necessary? Richard doesn\'t think so, thatâ€™s why his method polishes your natural voice rather than forces you to fake an accent for the rest of your life.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Who is Richard Di Britannia?</h2>\r\n<p>After becoming mute and teaching himself how to talk again, author Richard Di Britannia became a voice actor, audiobook narrator and voice coach who is now heard by thousands around the world.\r\n\r\nHeâ€™s offered bespoke coaching on vocal confidence, communication skills and public speaking techniques to beginner voice actors, non-native speakers, business leaders and people who just need pointing in the right direction.\r\n\r\nHeâ€™s also a best-selling, international author with his work â€˜Speak and Be Heard: 101 Vocal Exercises for Voice Actors, Public Speakers and Professionalsâ€™.\r\n</p>', 'voice-coaching-by-richard-di-britannia.jpg', '7WreUXBIyi4', 'Voice Coaching with Richard Di Britannia â€“ VO Tips', '<h2>Coaching or Voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>Do get in touch with Richard if you are looking for improvements in how you talk, communicate or voice.  You are in fantastic hands.<br>\r\nIf you have heard some audio on this site a feel Guy is the right fit for your brand,  <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch here</a>. I work every day to cater for different countries and timezones. Drop me a line.</p>\r\n', 'July 2020', '1', 'voice-coaching-by-richard-di-britannia', '3', '', 'Learn from the best vocal coach in the UK.', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(908, 'on-the-tools-attenborough', 'David Attenborough - On The Tools', '<p>Observe the majestic construction workers in their natural habitat...</p>', '', 'Check out Guy Harris\'s tried and tested David Attenborough impression on this hilarious On The Tools compilation video. Click to find out more!', '<h2>Sir David Attenborough Observes Workmen in the Wild<h2>\r\n<p>I do hope David Attenborough sees at least one of my <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover\">David Attenborough voiceovers</a> sometime... It has come on really far over the years and it is undoubtedly one of my best impressions. It\'s also surprising just how much work my David Attenborough voice gets me each year. The mockumentary style may be a well-worn comedic road, but it still seems to make everyone laugh. I get asked to do this voice a little too often, so I don\'t always say yes when a company approaches me. However, this script from On The Tools was so funny and written with such clear affection that it was a no-brainer. If you\'d like to hear a couple more examples of my Attenborough voice, so hit the search bar on the homepage.</p>', '<h2>A Little More About On The Tools</h2>\r\n<p>On The Tools is a social group made by and for construction workers in the UK and across the world. Its purpose is to share funny images, stories, and videos about life working in construction. Existing purely on social media, the best places to find it are on, On The Tools Website. The sense of humour on these pages is top-notch and I found the script they sent over very funny, even before I added my Attenborough impression into the mix. I\'ve had a lot of compliments about my voiceover on this video and it was great fun to do. I\'d love to work with these guys again in the future.</p> ', 'on-the-tools-attenborough.jpg', 'xyalNNmIr_4', 'David Attenborough Voiceover for On The Tools | Guy Harris', '<h2>Work With the VoiceoverGuy</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'d like to wind up your co-workers with a satirical mockumentary in the style of Sir David Attenborough\'s award-winning nature documentaries, then you are more than welcome to get in touch with me. But perhaps that\'s a little too specific... In fact, if you need my voiceover for an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>, or even a <a href=\"movie-trailer-voice\" title=\"Movie Trailer Voiceover\">movie trailer</a>, I\'ll be more than happy to work with you. If you need a little help working out whether I\'m a good fit with your brand or your project, I\'ll be happy to provide a short voiceover sample from your script. Looking forward to working with you!</p>', 'Aug 2020', '1', 'on-the-tools-attenborough', '3', '', 'A favoruite David Attenborough job', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `messages2` (`id`, `url`, `page_title`, `info`, `search_terms`, `page_desc`, `text1`, `text2`, `image`, `video`, `meta_title`, `bottomtext`, `date`, `whatvideo`, `alt`, `rating`, `twitter`, `hometext`, `santa`, `ntext1`, `ntext2`, `ntext3`, `ntext4`, `nimage1`, `nimage2`, `nimage3`, `nimage4`) VALUES
(910, 'poundland-self-service-till-santa-voice', 'Self Service Till Santa for Poundland', '<p>Poundland and Everyone\'s Voice of Santa</p>\r\n<p>From Heart Radio, Santa Radio and BBC Radio 2, my Santa is heard across the globe in almost as many places as Santa delivers too. <br>However in 2020 Santa got into trouble at Poundland. Read on...</p>', 'father Christmas', 'Poundland Self Service Till Santa Voice - The UK\'s favourite and busiest voice of Santa and part of the Poundland till controversy. Need a Santa? Get in touch.', '<h2>The UK\'s favourite voice of Santa</h2>\r\n<p>It seems these days I\'m the voice of Santa for everyone. Including Heart Radio, <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Radio Website\">Santa Radio</a> and of course BBC Radio 2 and the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5o9Va4YsI3g\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Zoe Ball breakfast show Santa\">Zoe Ball breakfast show</a> Santa. So, I can safely say, if you need the voice of Santa, you are in safe gloves and you\'ll have that authentic ho ho ho and deep warm Santa everyone knows and loves. From national radio stations to small events, drop me the script and details and let me get to the workshop and voice it.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Santa in trouble at Poundland</h2>\r\n<p>Oh no. December 2020 saw an influx of national publications reporting on a story of a lady offended because Santa announced her credit card was not accepted on the Poundland self service tills. To be honest a bit of a non story as clearly a sense of humour breakdown. I was happy to say, listening to the film, it was my voice. Besides making it into aarious papers and websites globally it was also picked up on Have I got New for you on the BBC. Thank you! I\'ll take the Paul Merton quote \"Thats Father Christmas\". Brilliant PR.\r\n</p>', 'poundland-self-service-till-santa-voice.jpg', 'gJ_hT3RLhfw', 'Poundland Santa Till Voiceover â€“ Christmas Campaign', '<h2>Do you fancy a Santa voice?</h2>\r\n<p>Maybe with less controversy, if my voice of Santa can help then please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. If you need a little reassurance that my Santa is right for your festive project, I am happy to provide a short sample from your script. Either way, lets make it sound Epic!</p>', 'Dec 2020', '1', 'poundland-self-service-till-santa-voice', '3', '', 'Poundland Self Service Till Santa Voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(912, 'ideal-heating-soft-male-voice', 'Ideal Heating\'s Male Voiceover', '<p>Only a small part for me at the end of a really funny little commercial!</p>', '', 'A warm, natural male voiceover for Ideal Heating. Guy provides a soft, conversational tone ideal for friendly, relatable brand messaging for this great brand.', '<h2>Working With Ideal Heating</h2>\r\n<p>Advertisements for boilers don\'t have to be hilarious, but it certainly does help! I must admit to chuckling away to myself when I first saw this parody of the famous final scene from \'An Officer and a Gentleman\'. What if instead of going into the factory to whisk away his great love, he instead whisked away an incredibly high-quality gas boiler with an impressive 10-year warranty... Ideal Heating asked for a clean, clear voiceover style for this and I offered this softer, natural style. They were happy, I was happy, and let\'s hope that officer and his boiler were happy! If you\'d like to hear a few more examples of this voiceover style from my back-catalog, check out my <a href=\"barclaycard-fraud-fighter-tool-voiceover\" title=\"Barclaycard Voiceover\">Barclaycard</a>, and <a href=\"dpd-predict-voice\" title=\"DPD Voiceover\">DPD</a> voiceovers.</p>', '<h2>A Little More About Ideal Heating</h2>\r\n<p>Ideal Heating was founded in Britain in 1906 as a \'Ideal Boilers\' and they have been at the forefront of boiler technology throughout the last century. On their website, they boast \'100 years of providing the best quality boilers to our customers, continually working to meet ever-changing domestic heating needs\'. They go on to emphasise their dedication to their mission: providing reliable, competitively priced boilers to consumers. Judging from the 10-year warranty, they have taken \'reliability very seriously indeed. You can see the brilliant commercial they made on their homepage with the main message from the campaign: \'Let warmth lift you up\'.</p>', 'ideal-boilers-soft-male-voice.jpg', '7rafcqLrwNo', 'Ideal Heating Soft Male Voiceover â€“ Guy Harris', '<h2>Work With Me</h2>\r\n<p>Are you working on a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">promo video</a> or <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> in need of a natural voiceover style like the one I used for Ideal Heating\'s latest campaign? Well, you should know that I\'m always happy to work with new brands, so please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">reach out</a> whenever you like. I can follow any needs or directions you have or I can offer a few suggestions of my own from my many years\' experience working as a voiceover artist for some of the biggest brands in the world.  That said, I\'ve also worked for some smaller companies too, so please don\'t be intimidated. Just send me a message and we can get the ball rolling on your next big project!</p>', 'Jan 21', '1', 'ideal-boilers-soft-male-voice', '3', '', 'A soft male voiceover style', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(913, 'cracking-ice-david-attenborough-impression', 'David Attenborough Impression', '<p>Searching this site, you\'ll notice my David Attenborough impression is requested a lot. It\'s a style I like to work with you to get it just right.</p>', 'planet earth cracking ice', 'Cracking Ice - This is my David Attenborough Impression. If you are looking for the best David Attenborough impersonator on Planet Earth, drop in and listen.', '<h2>Attenborough Impersonator</h2>\r\n<p>Iâ€™m asked several times a week to perform in this style â€“ itâ€™s popular, but I only take on projects that treat the tone and delivery with the respect it deserves.<br>\r\nThis particular piece was voiced in Attenborough style over some stunning drone footage in The Netherlands. The direction, music, and mix came together beautifully â€“ a joy to be part of.<br>\r\nIf youâ€™re working on something similar, or youâ€™re exploring different personalities for your project, you might also enjoy my <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceovers\">character voiceovers</a> â€“ a whole world of unique voices, from gameshow hosts to pirates.</p>', '<h2>Working Together on Your Script</h2>\r\n<p>For Attenborough-style work, I kindly ask that you\'re present for the session. It ensures we nail the tone and pacing just right. We\'ll connect via Cleanfeed â€“ a studio-grade audio platform that lets you listen in live through Google Chrome. Youâ€™ll be able to give real-time feedback as if you were in the room with me.<br>\r\nOnce we\'re happy, Iâ€™ll clean up the audio and send over a polished WAV file with clearly marked takes or sections.<br>\r\nItâ€™s a smooth, collaborative process â€“ and Iâ€™ll make it easy. ðŸ‘<br>\r\nIf you havenâ€™t already, take a look at my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough voice impression\">main David Attenborough voice impression page</a> for more samples and info.</p>', 'cracking-ice-david-attenborough-impression.jpg', 'tODqlSVh6hc', 'Cracking Ice - Attenborough Impression by Guy Harris', '<h2>Looking for the Best Attenborough Impersonator?</h2>\r\n<p>I only accept scripts that are respectful to the Attenborough style â€“ so no profanity, endorsements, or parody that misrepresents the legend himself. But if itâ€™s a tasteful internal video, nature-style content, or a fun project for socials, letâ€™s chat!<br>\r\nYou can <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">get in touch</a> for a bespoke quote.<br>\r\nWant to explore more? Visit my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough voice over work\">main David Attenborough voice over page</a> for additional examples and background.<br>\r\nPlease note: I don\'t record anything that directly claims to be Sir David or promotes products in his name. This is an â€˜in the style ofâ€™ voice, handled with respect and care.</p>', 'Feb 21', '1', 'attenborough impression cracking ice david', '5', '', 'Cracking Ice - Attenborough Impression', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(914, 'clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover', 'Goblin Voice for Clash of Clans', '<p>Supercell are a brilliant client, and over the years I\'ve voiced a variety of characters for themâ€”this Goblin promo was another fun one to add to the mix.</p>\r\n', 'character', 'Voicing the Goblin for Clash of Clans was a blast! Character voice by Guy Harris for Supercell\'s promo. Watch the video and hear the voice in action.', '<h2>How do you make a Goblin sound?</h2>\r\n<p>That was my first question when I was booked! Finnish was a decent starting point. Some of what I recorded included lines like â€œTahpakkee miut,â€ â€œKetÃ¤s tie tyyppi o?â€ and â€œPuren mieluummin kÃ¤teni irti ku oon tÃ¤ssÃ¤.â€ Translating Goblin-speak while adding character took some creative wrangling!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>It was a great session learning to speak Goblin (and Finnish) for the promo. <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceovers by Guy Harris\">Take a listen to my other characters</a> â€“ from spooky Halloween types to pirates and football commentators.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>The promo had over 4 million views when I last checked. Not bad for a dayâ€™s goblining!</p>\r\n', '<h2>What is Clash of Clans?</h2>\r\n<p>If you havenâ€™t heard of Clash of Clansâ€¦ where have you been? Itâ€™s a mobile strategy game created by Supercell in Finland. Players build villages, join clans, battle it out in Clan Wars, and yesâ€”occasionally hire voice actors to bring characters to life!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Iâ€™ve worked with Supercell on <a href=\"boom-beach-hammerman-voice\" title=\"Hammerman Voice for Boom Beach\">Boom Beach</a> too, voicing Hammerman. Iâ€™ve not played the games as much as Iâ€™d likeâ€”waiting for my daughter to reach that age so Iâ€™ve got an excuse to jump in.</p>\r\n', 'clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover.jpg', '_CPrYB6Q-HM', 'Goblin Voice for Clash of Clans | Guy Harris Character Voice', '<h2>Where do I find a character voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>As a character voiceover myself, I\'d love to help. Iâ€™m happy to test read or audition lines for your project. With <a href=\"voiceover-studio\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy Studio\">my studio</a> being broadcast quality and as good as any in London, I can voice everything remotelyâ€”or you can direct me live, just like Supercell did.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Get in touch and letâ€™s see how I can help. I look forward to bringing your characters to life.</p>\r\n', 'Feb 21', '1', 'Guy Harris voicing the Goblin character in Clash of Clans promo', '5', '', 'Clash of Clans Goblin Voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(916, 'hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover', 'Natural Voiceover for Hotels.com', '<p>Who is the voice of Hotels.com? Turns out it\'s me for this year. You know it. \"Because Just in case\"</p>', '', 'Guy Harris is the voiceover artist behind Hotels.com\'s flexible booking advertisement.  A friendly, natural style was a great fit for this project.  Read more!', '<h2>Working with Hotels.com</h2>\r\n<p>It was genuinely my pleasure to work with the people over at Hotels.com. They sent me over the script and asked for a clear and friendly voiceover style; I showed them a few of my <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" blank\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceovers</a> and we settled on a style that we all felt was a good fit for the advertisement. The result is pretty great, in my opinion. In times when people are justifiably cautious about travelling, short ads and explainer videos that convey flexible booking will always help travel companies reassure customers. If you\'d like to hear a couple more voiceovers similar to this, check out my <a href=\"barclaycard-fraud-fighter-tool-voiceover\" title=\"Barclaycard Voiceover\">Barclaycard</a> voiceover.</p>', '<h2>A Little More About Hotels.com</h2>\r\n<p>With a brand name that is very much to the point, Hotels.com sells hotel rooms in countries all around the world. They have an app that makes it easy for users to find the right product for them. Hotels.com is actually part of the much larger Expedia Group of travel companies, which is based in Texas, in the US. I love working with travel companies and it\'s great to see a tourism company making an effort to offer genuinely helpful flexible booking features. This is reassuring and it\'s a fair way to treat customers.</p>', 'hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover.jpg', 'LBS53IB2M3s', 'Hotels.com Natural Voiceover â€“ Guy Harris Explains', '<h2>Want to Work with the VoiceoverGuy?</h2>\r\n<p>Are you working on a project that needs a voiceover style similar to this voiceover I provided for Hotels.com\'s commercial? Whether it\'s a new <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\"  title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover</a>, an <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or something altogether unique, please don\'t hesitate to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">get in touch</a>. I have my own home studio, I can usually provide voiceover on the same day it\'s requested. I\'d be happy to provide a custom sample from your script to help you decide if right for your project.</p>', 'Feb 2021', '1', 'hotels-dot-com-what-else-could-go-wrong-voiceover', '5', '', 'A friendly, natural British voiceover ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(917, 'go-to-malta-explainer-voice', 'GoTo Malta Explainer Video', '<p>A clever angle on the classic short explainer video</p>\r\n', '', 'Guy Harris is the man behind the natural voiceover on GoTo Malta\'s new short explainer video. Need a voiceover style similar to this? Find out more!', '<h2>Working with GoTo Malta</h2>\r\n<p>This is a really fun idea for an explainer video! I knew it was a good project for me as soon as I read the script and it was easy to find the right tone of voice for the animation. With computer games more or less taking over the world, why not explain your bike, scooter, and car rental service in terms of video games? This video will obviously chime with younger audiences and the cute pixel art style will help GoTo Malta stand out from their competitors. Check out some of my other <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer videos</a> if you\'d like to hear more from me. Or if you\'re interested in the video game aspect, I\'ve made more than a few <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceover\">video game trailers</a>.</p>', '<h2>A Little More About GoTo Malta</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://gotoglobal.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"GoTo Malta\">GoTo Malta</a> is part of a larger company called GoTo Global. This is a vehicle rental subscription service that has been designed to make it as easy as possible for people to find and use rental vehicles in Malta. Whether you need the use of an electric scooter, a bike, a moped, or a car, GoTo Malta has you covered. You can simply use the GoTo app to find the nearest vehicle to your location. Everything is sorted on the app, giving you as much freedom and flexibility as possible. </p>', 'go-to-malta-explainer-voice.jpg', 'rsUbF9L5oA8', 'GoTo Malta Explainer Video | VoiceoverGuy', '<h2>Work With Me</h2>\r\n<p>Are you working on a project similar to this GoTo Malta explainer video? Do you need an experienced voiceover artist to help bring your <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a> or <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a> to the next level? Well I am always happy to hear from new companies, so don\'t hesitate to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">reach out</a>. I am more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script to help you feel certain I\'m perfect for your particular project. I can also usually provide my voiceover files on the same day it is requested, which is great for very sensitive deadlines!</p>', 'May 21', '1', 'go-to-malta-explainer-voice', '3', '', 'A playful little voiceover script ', '', '', '', '', 'you work', '', '', '', ''),
(919, 'manchester-city-football-commentry-voice', 'Manchester City Football Commentator', '<p>Another cracking football commentator voiceover in the bag, this time teaming up with Manchester City and Midea for a fast-paced, high-energy campaign.</p>', 'Manchester City', 'Hear Guy Harris deliver his signature football commentator voice for Manchester City, perfect for commercials, promos and sports campaigns.', '<h2>Working with Manchester City</h2>\r\n<p>This campaign with Manchester City needed a bold, energetic, match-day commentator tone, so the team behind the project got in touch and asked me to bring that classic big-game excitement to the script. Once you watch the final edit, youâ€™ll see why Iâ€™m booked so often for this style.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Iâ€™ve voiced similar football commentator campaigns for \r\n<a href=\"just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat UEFA Football Commentator\">Just Eat</a>,\r\n<a href=\"turkish-airlines-football-commentator-voiceover\" title=\"Turkish Airlines Football Commentator\">Turkish Airlines</a>,\r\n<a href=\"betfred-football-commentator\" title=\"Betfred Football Commentator\">Betfred</a>,\r\nand Netflix for <a href=\"iboy-football-commentator\" title=\"iBoy Football Commentator\">iBoy</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For a full collection of this style, visit my main \r\n<a href=\"football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">Football Commentator Voice</a> page.</p>\r\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\r\n    <audio controls style=\"width:100%; max-width:420px;\">\r\n        <source src=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\r\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n    </audio>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;\">\r\n        Football Commentator Showreel â€“ Guy Harris\r\n    </p>\r\n</div>', '<h2>A Little More About Midea</h2>\r\n<p>Midea partnered with Manchester City for this project and needed a punchy, fast-paced commentator delivery. Although Iâ€™m not exactly a football expert in real life, this up-tempo broadcast style is something I voice every week for major brands.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>If you want to hear more examples of this style beyond football, have a listen to my \r\n<a href=\"apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Style Voice\">Apple-style voice</a> work or some of my character pieces across the site.</p>', 'manchester-city-football-commentry-voice.jpg', '1wYjSxN9mJI', 'Manchester City Football Commentator Voice | Guy Harris', '<h2>Work With VoiceoverGuy</h2>\r\n<p>If your project needs a proven football commentator voice, or even something in a different style, Iâ€™d be happy to help. I voice everything from high-energy sports promos to softer narration styles.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>You can explore more of my work here:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice\">David Attenborough-style narration</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voice\">Santa voice</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Style Voice\">Apple-style clean commercial voice</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>If you\'d like a short sample for your pitch or brief, just send me a message via my \r\n<a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy Harris\">contact page</a> and Iâ€™ll get one recorded for you.</p>', 'May 2021', '1', 'Manchester City Football Commentator Voice', '5', 'manchester city voiceover\",\"football commentator voice\",\"sports commercial voice', 'Manchester City football commentator', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(920, 'just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice', 'Just Eat UEFA Football Commentator', '<p>Another big match moment with my football commentator voice for Just Eatâ€™s UEFA campaign!</p>', 'football commentator Just Eat, UEFA voiceover, sport promo voice', 'Guy Harris delivers the energetic football commentator voice for Just Eatâ€™s UEFA campaign. High-impact, humorous and perfect for sports promos and ads.', '<h2>Voicing the Just Eat UEFA Campaign</h2>\r\n<p>Just Eat needed a bold, high-energy football commentator voice for their UEFA promo â€” and this style is one Iâ€™m asked for a lot. If you enjoy it, you can explore more of my football work including my main <a href=\"football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">Football Commentator page</a>, my <a href=\"manchester-city-football-commentry-voice\" title=\"Manchester City Football Commentator Voice\">Manchester City project</a>, the <a href=\"etisalat-celebrating-victory-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Etisalat Football Commentator Voice\">Etisalat campaign</a>, and my <a href=\"betfred-football-commentator\" title=\"Betfred Football Commentator\">Betfred commentator job</a>. These styles continue to be some of my most requested for sport, promo and online campaigns.</p>', '<h2>Why This Style Works So Well</h2>\r\n<p>This fast-paced commentator delivery is perfect for sports-themed commercials, promos and humorous brand spots. It instantly adds excitement and energy â€” which is why companies keep coming back for this tone. If you\'re looking for something with a different edge, my <a href=\"qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover\" title=\"PSG Drone Race Commentary\">PSG Drone Race commentary</a> shows how this style can be adapted for non-football creative too.</p>\r\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\r\n    <audio controls style=\"width:100%; max-width:420px;\">\r\n        <source src=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\r\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n    </audio>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;\">\r\n        Football Commentator Showreel â€“ Guy Harris\r\n    </p>\r\n</div>', 'just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice.jpg', 'T9opwMc46Ms', 'Football Commentator Voice for Just Eat UEFA | Guy Harris', '<h2>Work with the VoiceoverGuy</h2>\r\n<p>If you need a football commentator voice like this Just Eat UEFA campaign â€” or something entirely different â€” Iâ€™m always happy to help. Send me your script and Iâ€™ll record a short free sample so you can check the tone.</p>\r\n<p>You can also explore more of my styles including my <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">Commercial Voiceover</a>, <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">Explainer Video Voice</a>, <a href=\"apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Voice Style\">Apple Voice style</a>, <a href=\"david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice\">Attenborough narration</a>, and my <a href=\"santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voice\">Santa voice</a>. For bookings, feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>.</p>', 'June 2021', '1', 'just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voiceover', '5', 'just eat commentator voiceâ€,â€œUEFA football voiceâ€,â€œsports promo voice', 'Football commentator voiceover â€“ Just Eat UEFA', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(921, 'pizza-hut-delivery-football-commentator-voiceover', 'Pizza Hut Delivery Football Commentator', '<p>Back of the net for Pizza Hut! This national campaign was a brilliant chance to bring my football commentator voice style to one of the UKâ€™s most recognisable takeaway brands.</p>', 'football commentator voice pizza hut', 'Need a football commentator-style voice? Hear Guy Harris in Pizza Hutâ€™s national campaign. Trusted by Manchester City, Just Eat, and major UK brands.', '<h2>Pizza Hut Delivery Football Voice</h2>\r\n<p>2021 was packed with football campaigns, and Pizza Hut was one of the big ones. They wanted fast-paced, energetic commentary to match the excitement of their national delivery push. Alongside this gig, I also voiced the <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat UEFA Football Commentator Voice\">Just Eat UEFA</a> campaign and another fun football-style spot for <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice\" title=\"Manchester City Football Commentary\">Manchester City FC</a>.</p>\r\n<p>I used my trusty MK416 mic for this one, delivering that big match feel Pizza Hut were after. If youâ€™re looking for a football commentator voice for your own project, youâ€™re in the right place.</p>', '<h2>Pizza Hut Delivery</h2>\r\n<p>We all know Pizza Hut, one of the worldâ€™s biggest and most recognisable takeaway brands. Founded in 1958, it has grown into a global favourite thanks to its classic pizzas, sides and family-friendly menus. With delivery now more convenient than ever, the brand continues to innovate its advertising, including using my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voiceover\">football commentator voice</a> style for high-energy promos.</p>\r\n<p>If you liked this campaign, you might also enjoy my work for <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat UEFA Football Commentator Voice\">Just Eat UEFA</a> or <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice\" title=\"Manchester City Football Commentary\">Manchester City</a>, where the same energetic commentary style brings the brand message to life.</p>', 'pizza-hut-delivery-football-commentator-voiceover.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"300\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/1068007105&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true&visual=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/its-in-the-delivery-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Pizza Hut - It&#x27;s In The Delivery - Football commentator voice\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Pizza Hut - It&#x27;s In The Delivery - Football commentator voice</a></div>', 'Pizza Hut delivery Football Commentator Voice', '<h2>How do I get a football commentator voice?</h2>\r\n<p>Booking a football commentator-style voiceover is quick and easy. Just tell me what you need, where it will be used, and Iâ€™ll send a quote. Sessions can be recorded live via Source-Nexus or Cleanfeed, or I can record and deliver straight to your inbox.</p>\r\n<p>If you\'re pitching to a client, Iâ€™m happy to record a short sample to help you win the job. Drop me a line through my <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">contact page</a> and Iâ€™ll get straight back to you.</p>\r\n<div style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\r\n    <audio controls style=\"width:100%; max-width:420px;\">\r\n        <source src=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/assets/audio/football-commentator-showreel-guy-harris.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\">\r\n        Your browser does not support the audio element.\r\n    </audio>\r\n    <p style=\"font-size:0.9em; opacity:0.8; margin-top:5px;\">\r\n        Football Commentator Showreel â€“ Guy Harris\r\n    </p>\r\n</div>', 'June 21', '2', 'pizza-hut-delivery-football-commentator-voiceover', '3', 'pizza hut voiceover\", \"football commentator voice\", \"sports commercial voice', 'Pizza Hut football commentator voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(922, 'boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice', 'Boom Beach Hammerman\'s hot tub', '<p>Supercell\'s evil character voiceover</p>', 'supercell character evil', 'Guy Harris returns as Hammerman in Boom Beachâ€™s Hot Tub eventâ€”bringing bubbles, bravado and mayhem. Hear the full voiceover and villainous charm here.', '<h2>The Voice of Hammerman</h2>\r\n<p>It\'s been a little quiet for a while but in 2021 Hammerman was back and this trailer is just part of several new outings on line for this awesome character.<br>Dare I tease I\'ve had to do some singing as Hammerman which should soon be heard. I\'ve heard the mix and even I\'m impressed.<br>So proud to be part of this legendary game.<br>It\'s a while since I voiced this first <a href=\"boom-beach-hammerman-voice\" title=\"Hammerman Trailer\">Hammerman promo</a> for Boom Beach.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Custom Hammerman Messages</h2>\r\n<p>I do get a lot of enquiries about Hammerman and should you be looking for a personal greeting from your favourite Boom Beach character, do get in touch below.<br>No profanity just fun messages can be purchased and returned within 24 hours. Fill in the form and let me know what you\'d like.<br>Share this page on social media for a FREE short Hammerman message.\r\n</p>', 'boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice.jpg', 'L6_oKwstsSU', 'Boom Beach Hammerman Hot Tub Voice by Guy harris', '<h2>Need to get in touch with Hammerman</h2>\r\n<p>For any enquiries about Hammerman, personal recordings or my involvement in the game do get in touch. Or if you\'d like to offer me a free Hot Tub? Happy to chat or maybe you need a voice similar to this? <br>Drop me a message using the form here or visit my <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">contact page </a> and tell me more. I look forward to hearing from you.</p>', 'June 21', '1', 'boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice', '5', '', 'Boom Beach\'s Hammerman\'s Hot Tub', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(923, 'evil-character-voiceover', 'A Deep, Dark, Evil Character Voiceover...', '<p>Fear not... well, maybe just a little. This voice comes straight from the underworld (or at least a very dark booth in Yorkshire).</p>', 'spooky halloween evil character voice', 'Need a creepy, dark, or downright evil voiceover? Iâ€™ve voiced award-winning sinister ads and game villains. Halloween? Youâ€™ve found the voice.', '<h2>Award-Winning Evil Voiceovers</h2>\r\n<p>Iâ€™ve voiced sinister villains, creepy narrators, and downright disturbing characters across TV, radio and game trailers. This particular ad even won Best Voiceover at the Vox Awards.<br>\r\nIâ€™m also the voice of <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/boom-beach-hammerman-hot-tub-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Hammerman voice in Boom Beach\">Hammerman</a> in Boom Beach, and he talks a lot about EVIL! If your brand needs a darker tone, youâ€™re in safe (but scary) hands.</p>', '<h2>Spooky Season Specialists</h2>\r\n<p>From the end of August to Halloween night, Iâ€™m in demand with brands like my Poundland Dracula, Wilko, Asda, and Alton Towers\' <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/alton-towers-scarefest-spooky-voice\" title=\"Alton Towers Scarefest\">Scarefest</a>.<br>\r\nIf you\'re producing something spooky and need a voice dripping with dread, check out my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voiceovers\">Halloween voiceover page</a>, or <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voice-of-god\" title=\"Voice of God\">summon the Voice of God</a> for something a little more ominous.</p>', 'evil-character-voiceover.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/24260541&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/mr-intoxico-guy-harris-award\" title=\"Mr Intoxico - Guy Harris - Award winning Ad\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Mr Intoxico - Guy Harris - Award winning Ad</a></div>', 'Evil Voiceover â€“ Spooky Halloween Character | Guy Harris', '<h2>Need an Evil Voice?</h2>\r\n<p>Whether itâ€™s for a Halloween campaign, a horror trailer, or a sinister villain in a game, I can bring the darkness. Let me know your brief, and Iâ€™ll conjure something wicked. I can direct via Cleanfeed or Source Connect, or send a sample first. Just <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>.</p>', 'Oct 21', '2', 'evil character voiceover', '3', '', 'A voice of pure Evil!', '', '<h2>Spine-Tingling Examples</h2>\r\n<p>You can hear me at my creepiest in the <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/dracula-voiceover-for-halloween\" title=\"Count Dracula Voiceover\">Dracula voice</a> or my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/joker-voice\" title=\"Joker Voiceover\">Joker voice</a>. Or if you need laughs with your scares, try the <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Halloween Laughs\">Halloween Laughs</a> page. Iâ€™ve voiced haunted house trailers, spooky radio spots, and full-on demonic growls. Whatever shade of evil you need, Iâ€™ve probably got it covered.</p>', '', '', '', 'character-voiceovers.jpg', '', '', ''),
(924, 'dracula-voiceover-for-halloween', 'Count Dracula Voiceover for Halloween', '<p>Bring your Halloween content to life with a chilling Dracula voiceover â€“ scary, spooky, and surprisingly easy to book.</p>', 'dracula voiceover, halloween voice actor, spooky voice, scary character', 'Book a Dracula Voiceover for your Halloween ad, trailer, or event. Creepy, fun, and affordable â€“ this voice brings chills to promos, videos, and spooky content.', '<h2>Count Dracula has risen!</h2>\r\n<p>Having voiced spooky characters for over 22 years, Dracula is one of the most requested. Halloween (and Christmas!) are my busiest times, and thereâ€™s a good reason why.<br>\r\nFrom TV commercials and radio promos to Halloween store campaigns and trailers, Dracula is one of my favourites to bring to (undead) life.<br>\r\nI canâ€™t wait to sink my teeth into your next spooky script.</p>', '<h2>Youâ€™ll be coffin up for the best!</h2>\r\n<p>You\'ve probably heard this Dracula voice on <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/alton-towers-scarefest-spooky-voice\" title=\"Alton Towers Scarefest Voice\">Alton Towers Scarefest</a>, <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voiceovers\">Halloween store promos</a>, or <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/frightnights\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Thorpe Park Fright Nights\">Thorpe Park Fright Nights</a>.<br>\r\nItâ€™s a popular pick for spooky events between September and October 31st â€“ and youâ€™re in safe hands.<br>\r\nLetâ€™s make your Halloween script un-boo-lievably good.</p>', 'dracula-voiceover-for-halloween.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/1119771547&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/dracula-voiceover\" title=\"Dracula Voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Dracula Voiceover</a></div>', 'Dracula Voiceover for Halloween | Creepy, Scary Character Voice', '<h2>Want to open the coffin to Dracula?</h2>\r\n<p>Despite how creepy Dracula is, he\'s actually a really nice person to work with. Let me know what you need and how itâ€™s going to be used, and Iâ€™ll give you a quote.<br>\r\nFill in the form below or visit my <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">contact page</a>.<br>Mwahahahahahaaa!\r\n</p>', 'Oct 21', '2', 'Dracula Halloween Voiceover â€“ Spooky & Scary Character Voice', '3', 'count Dracula voice\", \"voice of halloween\", \"spooky voices', 'Dracula voiceover for an evil Halloween?', '', '<h2>How to Book Dracula</h2>\r\n<p>Need a quick quote for this spooky voice? <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">Get in touch</a> and let me know how and where the voice will be used. Iâ€™ll get back with cost and turnaround time â€“ usually same day.<br>\r\nRemember: All recordings are done in my <a href=\"/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Broadcast-Quality Voiceover Studio\">broadcast-quality studio</a> with rapid delivery.</p>', '', '', '', 'character-voiceovers.jpg', '', '', ''),
(925, 'big-super-hero-voiceover', 'Big American Super Hero Voice', '<p>Is it a bird or a plane? No... it\'s Guy Harris</p>', 'american cheesy', 'A bird, a plane or that Big American Super Hero Voiceover by Guy Harris - As heard on television, web and radio around the world! Your new hero in a voice booth', '<h2>Are you looking for a Hero?</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve had many nice emails over the years and some have called me a hero for saving the day with how fast I turn audio around and get it back to clients. So let me put on my outfit and be ready to Kapow you with a great delivery and in a super quick time.<br>And thats exactly it, everyone needs things yesterday these days, so let me help. I\'ll send back a broadcast quality wav file the same day. \r\n</p>', '<h2>Let me save the day!</h2>\r\n<p>I have plenty of <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voices\">Character Voices</a> to choose from, but I must admit when a script arrives with \'Super Hero Voice\', I do smile. <br>Is it a radio ad? A web promo? Part of a tv commercial? Something fun for a friend? I\'m standing by ready to voice from my <a href=\"voiceover-studio\" title=\"Super Hero Headquarters\">Super Hero Headquarters</a>.<br>\r\nTrusted by the worlds biggest brands, let me be the guardian and be the protector of your epic project!\r\n</p>', 'big-super-hero-voiceover.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/1119825223&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/super-hero-voiceover\" title=\"Super Hero Voiceover\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Super Hero Voiceover</a></div>', 'That Big American Super Hero Voiceover - Guy Harris', '<h2>No Spandex! Just the Voice!</h2>\r\n<p>Let me work with you on your project. If it\'s the super hero voice that you need then either pickup the red phone or simply drop me an email. Do let me know what you are doing with it? How its being used and all that. That way I can better quote you. I\'m more than happy to send you a short sample to help you hear it in context or to send to your end client too. Fill in the form here or visit my <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\" >contact page </a> and tell me more. I hope I can save the day!</p>', 'Sept 21', '2', 'big-super-hero-voiceover', '3', '', 'That Big American Super Hero Voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(926, 'pantomime-dame-voice', 'Pantomime Dame Voice - Oh Saucy!', '<p>A very traditional British past-time is the Panto and a staple character is the Panto Dame</p>', 'innuendo panto', 'Pantomime Dame Voice - A very traditional British past-time is the Panto and a staple character is the Panto Dame. Need cheeky and saucy with innuendo? Hello!', '<h2>The Panto Dame Voice?</h2>\r\n<p>I\'ve only every performed in Pantomime and that was as King Crumble in Jack and the Beanstalk at the Reading Hexagon, many years ago with the late great Keith Chegwin. However the 6 week experience was enough to leave Pantomime firmly in my heart. <br>Although I never played the Dame in the show I\'m quite at home emulating the character for you and your advert or project.</p>\r\n', '<h2>What is the Pantomime Dame?</h2>\r\n<p>Traditionally, the pantomime dame is a role in a British pantomime. A staple part of British life. More so at Christmas. <br>The dame is the portrayal of female characters by male actors in drag. They are often played in an over the top camp style, or by men acting butch in women\'s clothing for example Cinderella\'s ugly sisters. The voice can be either be very camp or gruff. I do both! Oooo, saucy!</p>', 'pantomime-dame-voice.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/1139775637&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/panto-dame-voice-by-guy-harris\" title=\"Panto Dame Voice - by  Guy Harris\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Panto Dame Voice - by  Guy Harris</a></div>', 'Pantomime Dame Voice - Cheeky and Saucy Dame by Guy Harris', '<h2>How to get your Pantomime Dame</h2>\r\n<p>It\'s very easy to get me! Thats what she said!<br>Use the <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"contact page\">contact page</a> and drop me a line.<br>Let me know know how and where it\'s to be used to work out the best price for you. <br>The audio will be delivered the same day as a broadcast quality WAV file ready to work with. \r\n</p>', 'Oct 21', '2', 'pantomime-dame-voice', '3', '', 'Pantomime Dame Voice - Cheeky and Saucy', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(928, 'fifa-22-goat-foat-sheffield-fc-promo-voice', 'FIFA 22: <i>No GOAT Without the FOAT</i>', '<p>Celebrating the <i>First of All Time</i> with FIFA 22.</p>', '', 'Voiceover artist Guy Harris voice work for the FIFA 22 Sheffield FC \'No GOAT Without the FOAT\' advertising campaign. Click to find out more!', '<h2>Voice work for the recent <i>FIFA 22</i> â€˜No GOAT Without the FOATâ€™ promo.</h2>\r\n<p>I do love voicing promos and was especially delighted to recently do work for <i>Fifa 22</i>. Iâ€™ve no shortage of experience when it comes to doing <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voice\">voice work for games</a>, but collaborating with FIFA on a promo was a real treat given theyâ€™re the biggest sports game in the business. My previous football-related pieces have almost always seen me using my <a href=\"football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voiceover\">football commentator voice</a> but this FIFA promo, centred around Sheffield FCâ€™s trailblazing 1857 team, was really unique and a lot of fun to do. \r\n', '<h2>Whats new in FIFA 22?</h2>\r\n<p>Players of the PC game FIFA 22 can now unlock the original Sheffield FC jersey from 1857 in Ultimate Team (FUT) mode. In addition, the club and FIFA manufacturer EA Sports are calling on gamers to commit to the \"FOAT code\". These are new and unwritten FIFA rules. FIFA players can express their commitment to this by wearing the historic Sheffield shirt in-game. There\'s not much to say about <a href=\"https://www.ea.com/sports\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"EA Sports\">EA Sportsâ€™s</a> legendary FIFA game series that hasn\'t been said before. Having been one of the most anticipated releases on the gaming calendar every year since 1993, the FIFA games series has sold over 325 million copies across 51 countries, making it far and away the most successful sports video game franchise in the world. This promo inspired by the <i>FOAT</i> (First of All Time) combined all the humour and attitude you expect from an EA Sports ad campaign! </p>', 'fifa-22-goat-foat-sheffield-fc-promo-voice.jpg', '_Ej_UZ3So1c', 'FIFA 22 | Sheffield FC \'No GOAT Without the FOAT\' Promo', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for a voiceover artist with a wealth of experience and <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover\"> wide range of characters</a> to contribute to your next promo? Maybe you\'re even in need of a narrator for your latest <a href=\"game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer\">computer game trailer</a>? Well I\'d love to hear from you, so please feel free to get in touch. If you\'d like to ensure I\'m the right fit for your job, send me a few lines from your script and I can make a sample recording. I make the whole process as easy as possible with 99% of the jobs delivered the same day.</p>', 'Oct 22', '1', 'fifa-22-goat-foat-sheffield-fc-promo-voice', '3', '', 'British Promo Voice for FIFA', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(929, 'virtual-voiceover-studio-online', 'Virtual Voiceover Studio', '<p>A professional, industry standard, fully-connected and engineered studio. ONLINE!</p>', 'agency connections', 'Virtual Voiceover Studio - Chris Power\'s fully-connected online studio for voiceovers and agencies to connect and have VVS take care of all the audio for you.', '<h2>Why do I need a virtual studio?</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'ve looked at booking a studio and attending a session, you\'ll know it can get expensive with being away from the office and travelling costs. So, stay where you are and connect with your engineer and the voice remotely.\r\n<br>Why Virtual VO Studio? I\'ve been working with Chris for many years and found him one of the easiest and dedicated sound engineers to work with and have used the Virtual Studio option dozens of times. <br>IT JUST WORKS!\r\n</p>', '<h2>What is Virtual VO Studio?</h2>\r\n<p>You\'ve booked a voiceover for your project and you want to direct the session, but the VO artist can\'t facilitate this.<br>\r\nWith <a href=\"https://www.virtualvostudio.com/about-me\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Virtual VO Studio Official site\">Virtual VO Studio</a> you\'ll send scripts and videos prior to the session, VVS will send a link where you and your team can watch and listen to your recording session with your edited and named audio delivered to your inbox before the end of the session.\r\n<br>Whether it\'s a simple voiceover recording or a huge, multicast voice-to-picture edit, all you need is your laptop and a pair of headphones, wherever you are in the world.\r\n</p>', 'virtual-voiceover-studio-online.jpg', 'TqkdBK8mBW8', 'Virtual Voiceover Studio - fully-connected online studio', '<h2>Want to book a virtual voiceover session?</h2>\r\n<p>I highly recommend Chris at Virtual VO Studio. I can confidently say you\'ll find no other facility offering this level of service online. <br>No need to fill the form in here, simply visit the <a href=\"https://www.virtualvostudio.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Virtual Online Studio Official site\">VVS Website</a> to discover how to book. \r\n<br>Do say hello from me to Chris.\r\nâ€‹</p>', 'Oct 21', '1', 'virtual-voiceover-studio-online', '3', '', 'Virtual Voiceover Studio', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `messages2` (`id`, `url`, `page_title`, `info`, `search_terms`, `page_desc`, `text1`, `text2`, `image`, `video`, `meta_title`, `bottomtext`, `date`, `whatvideo`, `alt`, `rating`, `twitter`, `hometext`, `santa`, `ntext1`, `ntext2`, `ntext3`, `ntext4`, `nimage1`, `nimage2`, `nimage3`, `nimage4`) VALUES
(930, 'on-air-chat-with-santa', 'On-Air Chat with Santa Claus', '<p>How about a funny, on-air chat with Santa this Christmas? Speak to Santa on <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Radio\">santaradio.co.uk</a>.</p>', 'father Christmas radio presenter', 'Looking to chat with Santa Claus (aka Father Christmas) this winter? Book a slot with the UK\'s most in demand voice of Santa â€“ pure fun and silliness!', '<h2>On-Air Christmas Chat with Santa</h2>\r\n<p>Having been the BBC Radio 1 Santa for over 5 years and the <a href=\"bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"BBC Radio 2 Santa\">BBC Radio 2 Santa</a> over the past couple (along with appearances on CBBC, ITV, and elsewhere), I\'ve garnered a fair bit of experience in character as jolly old Saint Nick. It was not then a surprise when I ended up becoming the on-air voice of Father Christmas over on <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Radio\">Santa Radio</a>, the world\'s best Christmas radio channel. Being the host of Santa Radio is a great deal of fun and it\'s the perfect place to get into the Christmas spirit! And now YOU can join Santa for an on-air, festive chat!</p>', '<br><h2>Santa Radio ~ <span class=\"ident\">In the Air</span> ~ <span class=\"ident\">On the Air</span></h2>\r\n<p>Santa is also broadcasting 24/7, 365 days of the year from his workshop on the UK\'s No.1 Christmas radio station.  This is non-stop Christmas Radio as it SHOULD be. Featuring shows, celebrity guests and a <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk/mugshots/all\" class=\"isred\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Celebrity MUG SHOTS\">NEW MUG SHOTS</a> page,<br> you can tune in anytime and Santa will be on air. And now you can join him. Get in touch below to begin arranging your very own chat with the North Pole\'s main man!</p>\r\n<p>Download the app on iOS, Apple TV, Android, Amazon and join in. Just go by sleigh with an Elf to SantaRadio.co.uk.\r\n<br/>\r\n Follow <a href=\"https://tunein.com/radio/Santa-Radio-s252505/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Radio on TuneIn\">TuneIn</a> for updates.</p>', 'original-voice-of-santa-guy-harris.jpg', 'Qqu-HDA2KJE', 'On-Air Santa Voice â€“ Guy Harris in Radio Interviews & Features', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>So, if you fancy doing something truly unique and delightfully Christmassy this winter, <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">get in touch</a>. Guy and Santa will ensure your on-air chat will be suitably merry. You\'ll be the envy of any kids in your family when they find out that you know Santa Claus. But please remember: Santa insists on good boys and girls only!</p>', 'Dec 21', '1', 'on-air-chat-with-santa', '3', 'voice of santa\", \"Father Christmas voice\", \"santa voiceover', 'On-Air Chat with Santa Claus', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(931, 'european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover', 'Patrick Stewart Voiceover', '<p>Guy\'s Patrick Stewart voice was just right for the European Collaboration Summit\'s 2021 promo.</p>', 'Patrick Stewart Voice ', 'Guy Harris used his classic Patrick Stewart voice for this promo for the European Collaboration Summit\'s 2021  Dusseldorf conference. Find out more!', '<h2>Patrick Stewart Voiceover for the 2021 European Collaboration Summit</h2>\r\n<p>This is actually my third voiceover for the European Collaboration Summit. In 2018 I employed a soft version of my Patrick Stewart voice for the European Collaboration Summit\'s promo for their <a href=\"european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voice\" title=\"European Collaboration Summit Patrick Stewart Voice\">conference in Mainz</a>, while in 2020 they went with a completely different style and asked me to use my <a href=\"european-collaboration-summit-tickets-voiceover\" title=\"European Collaboration Summit 2020\">professional narrator voice</a>. In 2021, the marketing team at the European Collaboration Summit put together a wonderfully inspiring promo video celebrating community and my classic Patrick Stewart voice felt just right for relaying the message. Among my most popular voices, I\'ve used the Patrick Stewart voice for many promotions, such as my work for <a href=\"minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover\" title=\"Minecraft Patrick Stewart Voice\">Minecraft</a> and the <a href=\"nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Patrick Stewart Voice CBS & NFL\">NFL</a>.', '<h2>About the European Collaboration Summit 2021</h2>\r\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.collabsummit.eu\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"European Collaboration Summit\">European Collaboration Summit</a> is a major European modern workplace event about everything related to office work. 2021\'s conference was all about championing inclusion. The message was loud and clear: all are welcome at the European Collaboration Summit! In fact, it\'s the very diversity of the event that makes it such a success. This is my third piece of work for the summit and I\'m continually impressed by the content they put out across media platforms to tie in with their events. When I saw the theme of this year\'s meeting in Dusseldorf, I knew my classic Patrick Stewart voice would work in harmony with the script.</p>', 'european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover.jpg', 'DLih0NZHPJI', 'European Collaboration Summit 2021 Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>Get in touch!</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re working on a new <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a>, <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, or something else altogether, and you need a high-quality professional voiceover artist, then please feel free to <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">get in touch</a>. I always look forward to collaborating with new businesses and individuals in need of voice work! I\'m more than happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script for you to make sure I\'m the right fit for your project. I can usually return my recorded voiceover to you on the same day it\'s requested, making me the perfect choice if you\'re working to a tight schedule.</p>', 'Nov 21', '1', 'european-collaboration-summit-patrick-stewart-voiceover', '3', '', 'Patrick Stewart voice impersonation', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(932, 'british-aqua-feeds-christmas-advert-patrick-stewart-voice', 'Santa\'s Gone Fishin\' Brit Aqua Feeds ', '<p>My old Patrick Stewart voice was ideal for BAF\'s winter campaign</p>', '', 'Guy provided his Patrick Stewart voice for this fun, festive advert for British Aqua Feeds, one of the UK\'s major aquaculture market suppliers. Learn more. ', '<h2>A Rhyming, Playful, Santa-Themed Ad for Christmas</h2>\r\n<p>I first used my Patrick Stewart voice for a <a href=\"patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\" title=\"Money Supermarket Voiceover\">Money Supermarket voiceover</a> all the way back in 2013, and after that successful start, I\'ve returned to the voice countless times since. When British Aqua Feeds got in touch about working on their Santa-themed Christmas ad, my Patrick Stewart impression seemed like the ideal fit for their funny, festive script. I\'ve been the <a href=\"santa-voice\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">voice of Santa</a> many times, but this ad required a dramatic reading of a poem and we were really happy with the how the Patrick Stewart voice came out. If you\'d like to hear further examples of this voiceover style, check out my <a href=\"minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover\" title=\"Minecraft\">Minecraft</a> and <a href=\"lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\" title=\"Lending Crowd\">Lending Crowd</a> videos.</p>  ', '<h2>A little more about British Aqua Feeds</h2>\r\n<p>It was a real pleasure to work with British Aqua Feeds. As one of the major bulk feed suppliers to the UK, European & worldwide aquaculture markets, British Aqua Feeds Ltd (BAF) are a UK-based company with an international reach. I\'ve worked on many brilliant <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ads</a>, but Christmas-themed campaigns tend to be especially good-humoured and a lot of fun to do. The sight of Santa out on a fishing trip and the funny rhyming script made this a really enjoyable ad to record for and I\'m really pleased with how it came out.</p>', 'british-aqua-feeds-christmas-advert-patrick-stewart-voice.jpg', 'Pgt7yrRy3fA', 'Christmas Ad for Aqua Feeds â€“ Patrick Voiceover', '<h2>Get in touch</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'ve read this far then there\'s a good chance you\'re in need of a professional voiceover artist like me for your next <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial</a> or <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>. Well, the good news is that I love to hear from new companies and I\'m always looking for new voiceover work. Whatever kind of voice you need, I\'ll be happy to provide a free voiceover sample. Simply send me an extract from your script and I\'ll make you a sample to ensure I\'m just what you\'re looking for. I can usually return my recorded voiceover to you on the same day it\'s requested, making me the perfect choice if you\'re working to a tight schedule. So, what are you waiting for? <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">Get in touch</a>!</p>', 'Dec 21', '1', 'british-aqua-feeds-christmas-advert-patrick-stewart-voice', '3', '', 'Patrick Stewart impression for BAF', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(933, 'lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover', 'Lumote Mastermote Chronicles â€“ Attenborough Voice', '<p>Guy Harris brings the world of bioluminescent Motes to life with a warm, nature-style narration in this indie game adventure.</p>', 'impression, puzzle game voiceover, quirky narration', 'Guy Harris brings a quirky Attenborough-style voice to Lumote: The Mastermote Chronicles â€“ a glowing underwater puzzle game with personality and pulse.', '<h2>Lighting up the Bioverse with voice</h2>  \r\n<p>Lumote: The Mastermote Chronicles is a vibrant underwater puzzle platformer that needed a quirky yet grounded narration. The producers wanted a style that felt like a nature documentary with a hint of fun â€“ and who better to deliver that than a <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice\">David Attenborough voiceover</a>?</p>  \r\n<p>Using that iconic narration style, I guided players through Lumoteâ€™s surreal neon world with curiosity, wonder, and just a touch of cheeky charm. Think glowing squishy sea blobs meets Sir David in the deep.</p>\r\n', '<h2>What is Lumote all about?</h2>  \r\n<p>This indie gem, developed by Luminawesome Games and published by Wired Productions, takes you deep into the Great Depths â€“ a trippy world of squishy creatures called Motes. You play as Lumote, an inquisitive little blob who sets out to restore balance when his glowing habitat is overtaken by the mysterious Mastermote.</p>  \r\n<p>As Lumote, you possess other creatures, solve bio-electric puzzles, and bounce your way through beautifully immersive levels powered by an electronic soundtrack. Learn more on the <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/791240/Lumote_The_Mastermote_Chronicles/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Steam Page for Lumote\">Steam page for Lumote</a>.</p>\r\n', 'lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover.jpg', '_7o94Czmg8Q', 'Lumote Mastermote Chronicles â€“ Attenborough Voice | Guy Harris', '<h2>Letâ€™s bring your world to life</h2>  \r\n<p>Need a game narrator or voiceover with personality? I offer natural, warm, characterful reads â€” often with same-day turnaround from my pro-level studio. Drop me a line on the <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">Contact Guy</a> page with your script or idea, and Iâ€™ll happily send over a sample read. Letâ€™s make your project shine.</p>', 'Dec 21', '1', 'lumote-mastermote-chronicles-voiceover', '3', 'attenborough impressionâ€, â€œpuzzle game voiceoverâ€, â€œquirky narration', 'Lumote Mastermote Chronicles Voice', '', '<h2>Want more voiceovers like this?</h2>  \r\n<p>If you like this kind of thing, you might enjoy another <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/horizon-zero-dawn-voice\" title=\"Horizon Zero Dawn Voiceover\">Attenborough-style voiceover I did for Horizon Zero Dawn</a> â€“ also rich with drama and world-building.</p>  \r\n<p>Whether itâ€™s epic AAA trailers or quirky indie titles, I can deliver the right voice for your game. Iâ€™ve worked on many <a href=\"/game-trailer-voice\" title=\"Game Trailer Voiceovers\">game trailers</a> and know how to bring that cinematic weight or comedic tone to life.</p>\r\n', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(934, 'renton-trainspotting-choose-life-voiceover', 'Renton Trainspotting Choose Life', '<p>From the 1996 movie by Danny Boyle here is my impersonation of the Scottish voice by Ewan McGregor</p>', 'scottish ewan mcgregor', 'From the movie Trainspotting by Danny Boyle, here is my impersonation of Renton in the Choose Life sequence. A passionate Scottish voice with profanity a plenty', '<h2>Where can you get a Renton impersonation?</h2>\r\n<p>As a character voiceover Renton was one of the earliest voices I was able to mimic. I loved how Ewan McGregor delivered the words. Sort of cascading out his mouth in a flurry of anger and excitement. The film was fantastic and at eh time in 1996 I must have watched it a dzen times and I fell in love with this sequence.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Character Voices</h2>\r\n<p>When I set out on this journey 80% of my work was characters. Lots of radio commercials were written with a multitude of characters but these days it seems less about the creative and more about the brand and the message. I miss the days of multiple voices in commercials but times move on and budgets get squeezed. However my character work is still in demand now a lot on BBC Bitesize.\r\n</p>', 'renton-trainspotting-choose-life-voiceover.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/26316913&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/renton-trainspotting-voice-18\" title=\"Renton Trainspotting Voice (18) -  Guy Harris\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Renton Trainspotting Voice (18) -  Guy Harris</a></div>', 'Trainspotting Voiceover â€“ Renton â€œChoose Lifeâ€ Parody', '<h2>Are you looking for a Renton Choose Life Impression?</h2>\r\n<p>Lovely! Step right in my friend. Fill in the form and send me an enquiry. Giving me the usage info allows me to better quote you. Choose Life... <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">Choose Me!</a> \r\nâ€‹</p>', 'Dec 1996', '2', 'renton-trainspotting-choose-life-voiceover', '3', '', 'Renton Trainspotting Choose Life Voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(936, 'vegan-film-voiceover', 'Voice for Plant Based News Vegan Film ', '<p>Lets think differently about what we eat!</p>', 'radio news reader journalist', 'A fantastic film by Plant Based News. A short teaser to make us all think differently about what we eat and why we should re consider our actions.', '<h2>Plant Based News</h2>\r\n<p>Plant Based News is a UK-based website about veganism and plant-based living, founded by Klaus Mitchell and Robbie Lockie<br>\r\nI\'d been watching this channel for several years and had changed my food choices massively since discovering the channel.<br>Watching this would make more people think differently and that can only be good for our planet.\r\n</p>', '<br><h2>Professional Male Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>Plant Based News were looking for a great <a href=\"apple-voice-style\" title=\"Male VoiceOver\">Male VoiceOver</a> to play the part of a controversial radio host. I knew exactly who they were wanting to emulate. And whilst I\'m not capable of matching the voice completely, they were very happy with the voice and performance I gave.<br>The visuals are stunning and I was proud of the association.\r\n</p>', 'vegan-film-voiceover.jpg', 'h7c0tbf-iaY', 'Vegan Film Promo â€“ Voiceover for Plant-Based Brands', '<br><h2>Where can I get a professional British Male voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>Are you looking for a British Male Voiceover to be a part of your project? Do send some of the scripts I can give a custom audition and if I\'m right for the project I\'d love to chat further. <br><a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceverGuy\">Get in touch today</a> \r\nâ€‹</p>', 'Aug 22', '1', 'vegan-film-voiceover', '3', '', 'Voice of Plant Based News Vegan Film ', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(937, 'crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover', 'Crowd Hub X Explainer Voice', '<p>A great example of casual British male voiceover read for an Explainer Video. </p>', 'natural casual calm', 'A great example of casual British male voiceover read for an Explainer Video. Looking for a natural voice with authority then check out this page for details.', '<h2>Where can I get a professional Explainer Video Voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>Right here! Voicing since for over 22 years explainer videos make up a large part of my weekly voice sessions.<br>I actually really enjoy voicing them as it\'s a free education too.<br>\r\n99% of work is delivered the same day and you can let me know if you need it read quicker or slower.<br>Some more examples of my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer video voice samples\">explainer voice</a> can be found here.</p>', '<h2>Explainer Video Voice</h2>\r\n<p>Most of my work is in this style, a very natural and casual delivery whilst keeping the authority of what is it is we are explaining.<br>A lot of my briefs ask for work similar to my <a href=\"apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple iPhone ads voice\">Apple iPhone ads</a> voice style.<br>Do feel free to ask for me to step up or down the energy so we get it just right, or even join me via <a href=\"voiceover-studio\" title=\"What is Cleanfeed?\">Cleanfeed</a> to get it exactly how you here it.\r\n</p>', 'crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover.jpg', 'TGD6Btk4twk', 'Crowd Hub X Explainer â€“ Corporate Voiceover', '<h2>How can I help?</h2>\r\n<p>It\'s actually very easy. Simply fill in the form and send me an enquiry. If you can give me the details of how and where it\'s to be used, that will really help to give you the most accurate fee. I look forward to working with you and bring your script to life.\r\nâ€‹</p>', 'Aug 22', '1', 'crowd-hub-x-explainer-video-voiceover', '5', '', 'Crowd Hub X Explainer Video Voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(938, 'bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa', 'Voice of Santa for BBC Radio 2', '<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nAs heard across the UK on <a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/sounds\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0073e6;\">BBC Radio 2</a>, Ho Ho Ho, it\'s Father Christmasâ€”aka Santa!<br>\r\nIâ€™m Guy Harris, the official <strong>Voice of Santa</strong>, bringing festive cheer to the nationâ€™s favorite radio station each Christmas season.\r\n</p>', 'Father Christmas radio presenter zoe ball', 'BBC Radio 2 Voice of Santa. In the Air and On the Air for Zoe Ball and the team at Christmas. Father Christmas even chats with Zoe on Christmas Eve.', '<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #AD030C;\">The Voice of Santa for BBC Radio 2</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nEven Santa needs a little help now and then! When he canâ€™t be everywhere at once, he outsources his voice workâ€”and Iâ€™m delighted to step in.<br>\r\nSanta takes to the airwaves with Zoe Ball on <a href=\"https://www.bbc.co.uk/sounds\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0073e6;\">BBC Radio 2</a> each Christmas, spreading festive magic to listeners across the UK.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nItâ€™s always a pleasure working with the BBC, bringing the voice of Father Christmas to life and adding that extra sparkle to their December broadcasts.<br>\r\n</p>', '<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #AD030C;\">Father Christmas Voice</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nWhen you imagine Father Christmas, you think of a jolly old fella with a warm, deep, and welcoming voice. Thatâ€™s exactly what I deliverâ€”but with a little cheeky charm!<br>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nIâ€™d love the opportunity to bring Santa to life in more animated productions. If youâ€™re looking for an authentic and engaging <strong>Father Christmas voice</strong> for your next project, <a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk\" style=\"color: #0073e6;\">get in touch</a> today. Letâ€™s create something magical together!\r\n</p>\r\n', 'bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa.jpg', 'Qqu-HDA2KJE', 'BBC Radio 2â€™s Voice of Santa â€“ Guy Harris Festive VO Work', '<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #AD030C;\">Bring the Voice of Santa to Your Project</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nIf you have a script that needs a Father Christmas, let me bring it to life! Whether itâ€™s for radio, television, web, YouTube, or even a personalised Santa message, I can help.<br>\r\nHo Ho Ho! <a href=\"mailto:santa@voiceoverguy.co.uk\" style=\"color: #0073e6;\">Click here to get in touch</a> with your details, and Iâ€™ll provide an accurate quote tailored to your project.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nLooking for something more personal? Create a <a href=\"https://festivestudio.com/store/santa-radio\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0073e6;\">personalised audio message</a> or a magical <a href=\"https://festivestudio.com/i/santaradio/personalised-video\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #0073e6;\">video message from Santa</a> for your loved ones.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nSanta will respond as quickly as he delivers gifts around the worldâ€”usually in less than 2 hours!\r\n</p>\r\n', 'Christmas', '1', 'bbc-radio-2-voice-of-santa', '5', 'duncan\", \"fred', 'BBC Radio 2 Voice of Santa', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(939, 'spooky-halloween-laughs', 'A collection of Halloween Laughs', '<p>Scary, evil and maniacal Halloween laughs â€“ perfect for promos, events and eerie projects.</p>', 'evil scary maniacal', 'Maniacal, spooky, and evil Halloween laughs free for personal use. Commercial licensing available. Guy Harris is the UKâ€™s go-to voice for Halloween audio.', '<h2>Spooky Halloween Laughs</h2>\r\n<p>Over the years, Iâ€™ve voiced countless Halloween promos, radio ads and event trailers â€“ and one thing always remains true: clients want a *maniacal laugh*! From chilling chuckles to full-on psycho cackles, Iâ€™ve got a vault of terrifying options ready.</p>\r\n<p>If you need a laugh for your spooky script, you can also explore my <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voiceover\">Halloween Voiceover page</a> for a full range of styles. Or if youâ€™re after something a little darker, try the <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Character Voice\">Evil Character Voice</a> section. </p>', '<h2>Halloween Laughs for Personal or Commercial Use</h2>\r\n<p>Youâ€™re welcome to download and use these laughs for your personal projects â€“ just credit <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\">VoiceoverGuy.co.uk</a> in your descriptions or credits. </p>\r\n<p>If you\'re planning a broadcast, podcast, social ad, or commercial release, <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy Harris\">get in touch</a> to discuss licensing and fees. Iâ€™m happy to provide clean WAV files and variations to suit your tone.</p>', 'spooky-halloween-laughs.jpg', 'Ff6EB6Mrkys', 'Spooky Halloween Laughs â€“ Free & Licensable by Guy Harris', '<h2>Can I use the Halloween Laughs commercially?</h2>\r\n<p>Please <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Get in touch\">get in touch</a> to discuss the details of the project and we can work out the cost. If broadcast or used on social media in a paid for campaign, do include all details as to how and where they will be used.\r\nâ€‹</p>', 'Sept 22', '1', 'spooky halloween laughs scary maniacal voice', '5', '', 'Free Halloween Laughs', '', '<h2>Where Have These Laughs Been Used?</h2>\r\n<p>My spooky laugh tracks have featured in theme parks, escape room trailers, haunted house walkthroughs and even indie horror games. They\'re a small detail â€“ but they make a big impact when used well. </p>\r\n<p>Looking to level up your Halloween project? Letâ€™s chat â€“ or browse my <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceovers\">Character Voiceover</a> section for even more creepy creations.</p>', '', '', '', 'halloween-voice-og.jpg', '', '', ''),
(940, 'wooky-hole-caves-quirky-voice', 'Quirky Voice for Wooky Hole Caves', '<p>A fun voiceover for what seems like a fun family day out.</p>', 'Patrick stewart', 'Guy Harris is the voiceover artist behind the wonderfully wacky and quirky voiceover for Wookey Hole Whitsun Wonderland video. Find out more.', '<h2>Working with Wookey Hole Hotel</h2>\r\n<p>It\'s always fun when I\'m asked to put a little more character and silliness into my voiceovers. And this is exactly what Wookey Hole Hotel asked me to do for their new ad for their Whitsun Wonderland family holiday attractions. The people over at Wookey Hole Hotel got in touch asking for a short <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\"  title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voiceover</a> to help promote their family-friendly attractions this summer. I sent over a few options and the whole job was over nearly as soon as it started. Sometimes a voiceover job is just as quick and straightforward as this! If you like the quirky style and would like to hear a few more examples, check out my <a href=\"minecraft-combat-voiceover\"  title=\"Minecraft Voiceover\">Minecraft voiceover</a>.</p>', '<h2>A Little More About Wookey Hole Hotel</h2>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.wookeyhotel.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" title=\" Wookey Hole Hotel\">Wookey Hole Hotel</a> is part of the wider Wookey Hole Resort in Somerset. With Bucklegrove Holiday Park, Mendip View Luxury Lodges, and Wookey Hole Hotel, there is a lot on offer from the entire Wookey Hole Resort. This particular commercial was created to promote their Whitsun Wonderland â€” a family-friendly assortment of fun activities and whacky activities guaranteed to please the children (and big children). With Dinosaur Valley, Pirate Island Adventure Golf, and the Famous Caves â€” to name but a few of the attractions â€” this all sounds like a lot of fun for the whole family.</p>', 'wooky-hole-caves-quirky-voice.jpg', 'Y36TmzXNioU', 'Wooky Hole Caves â€“ Quirky Tourist Voiceover', '<h2>Work With the VoiceoverGuy</h2>\r\n<p>Are you working on something similar and you\'re in need a quirky voiceover style from an experienced voiceover artist? Whether it\'s a <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\"  title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">explainer video</a>, a <a href=\"commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">TV ad</a>, or something else altogether, I am always happy to hear from new companies, so please don\'t hesitate to get in touch. I\'m very happy to provide you with a free voiceover sample from your script to help you feel certain I\'m perfect for your particular project. I can also usually provide my voiceover files on the same day they\'re requested, which is great if you\'re working to a tight deadline!</p>', 'May 21', '1', 'wooky-hole-caves-quirky-voice', '3', '', 'A quirky voiceover style for this short ad', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(941, 'wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film', 'Shrieks, Shouts and Screams', '<p>That unmistakable Wilhelm Scream, plus new shouts, shrieks, and movie-style SFX â€“ all performed by British voiceover artist Guy Harris.</p>', 'halloween spooky movie wilhelm scream', 'Download free Wilhelm Scream SFX voiceovers â€“ screams, shouts and shrieks for Halloween, horror, or parody content. Free for personal use with credit.', '<h2>What is the Wilhelm Scream?</h2>\r\n<p>The Wilhelm Scream is Hollywoodâ€™s most iconic scream effect, used in over 400 films and TV shows. It originated from the 1951 film <em>Distant Drums</em>, where a character lets out the now-famous scream after being shot. Youâ€™ve heard it in <strong>Star Wars</strong>, <strong>Indiana Jones</strong>, and loads of others.<br>\r\nThese are my own takes â€” ideal for <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voiceovers\">Halloween projects</a>, <a href=\"/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Halloween Laughs\">spooky promos</a>, and <a href=\"/joker-voice\" title=\"Joker Voice\">villain voiceovers</a>. Credit VoiceoverGuy and youâ€™re good to go for personal use.</p>', '<h2>Free Wilhelm Scream Variations & Horror SFX</h2>\r\n<p>Download my custom scream recordings â€” a mix of blood-curdling shouts, shrieks, and horror SFX inspired by the classic Wilhelm Scream. Great for Halloween trailers, YouTube videos, or horror parodies.<br>\r\nLooking for something even darker? Try my <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Character Voiceover\">evil character voice</a> or <a href=\"/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice\" title=\"Ghost Face Voice\">Ghost Face impression</a> for that extra chill. <br>\r\nNeed a clean WAV or mp3 without effects? Get in touch and Iâ€™ll send a broadcast-ready version. Just remember to credit VoiceoverGuy.</p>', 'wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film.jpg', '0IhG9vy8G1Q', 'Wilhelm Scream & Shouts â€“ Free SFX Voiceovers by Guy Harris', '<h2>Can I use the Wilhelm Scream commercially?</h2>\r\n<p>If you want to use these screams in a commercial, ad, trailer or YouTube video with monetisation â€“ please <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Get in touch\">get in touch</a> to discuss usage and rates. <br>\r\nThese are free for personal or parody use with a credit to VoiceoverGuy. But for anything broadcast or brand-related, letâ€™s sort the licensing together. Simple!</p>', 'Sept 22', '1', 'Free Wilhelm Scream and Halloween SFX Voiceover', '3', '', 'Free Wilhelm Scream Sound Effects â€“ Shouts, Shrieks & More', '', '<h2>Looking for More Halloween Voiceovers?</h2>\r\n<p>Need more spooky sounds? Iâ€™ve got a full range of Halloween voices from <a href=\"/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice\" title=\"Ghost Face Scream Voice\">Ghost Face-style voices</a> to <a href=\"/joker-voice\" title=\"Joker Voice\">Joker-style villain laughs</a>, <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Character Voiceover\">deep evil characters</a> and <a href=\"/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Halloween Laughs\">spooky Halloween laughs</a>. <br>\r\nClick around the site or check out the <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voiceovers\">main Halloween voiceover page</a> for more terrifying treats!</p>', '', '', '', 'character-voiceovers.jpg', '', '', ''),
(942, 'ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers', 'Ninja Warrior Fitbit Sponsor Bumper', '<p>Proud to be working with ITV and Ninja Warrior UK in 2022</p>', 'ITV kammy commentator', 'The voice of the Ninja Warrior UK Fitbit Sponsor Bumpers on ITV. Mine and Gergia\'s commentator voices and a natural male voiceover for the Fitbit tag.', '<h2>The male voice of the Ninja Warrior Sponsor Bumbers</h2>\r\n<p>Kammy <a href=\"https://www.chriskamara.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Chris Kamara\">Chris Kamara</a> regularly uses my studio for voiceover work and he invited us to go see Ninja Warrior UK being recorded in Manchester. So much fun!<br>A week later an audition t voice the sponsor bumpers for ITV. Using my <a href=\"football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Commentator voice\">Commentator voice</a> I nailed the audition and got the gig. These turned out great and I love being part of the show.<br>My daughter loves the Ninja Warrior Activity Venues too.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Ninja Warrior UK 2022</h2>\r\n<p>Race for Glory! After three years off our telly, Ninja Warrior UK is back for a new season as the new line-up of contestants take on an ultimate physical challenge.\r\n\r\nReturning, Ben Shephard, Chris Kamara and Rochelle Humes host the ITV gameshow, which has undergone a complete make-over during its absence â€“ with the show looking for a male and female champion that can beat Mount Midoriyama.\r\nThe contestants have to beat the course, and this year take on Elite Ninjas in a one-on-one race in order to make it through to the next round.\r\n</p>', 'ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers.jpg', 'dM8Mcofi5nI', 'Ninja Warrior UK Fitbit Bumpers â€“ Voiceover Promo', '<h2>Where can I get a commentator voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>I voice so much with my Commentators voice. Football, Golf, Cricket, whatever your production I\'ll add that extra energy with a commentary voiceover to suit. Shoot over the details and usage and let crack on with it!\r\nâ€‹</p>', 'Aug 22', '1', 'ninja-warrior-uk-fitbit-sponsor-bumpers', '5', '', 'Ninja Warrior UK Fitbit Sponsor Bumper', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(943, 'alton-towers-scarefest-spooky-voice', 'Spooky Voice - Alton Towers Scarefest', '<p>Proud to voice Alton Towersâ€™ Scarefest once again â€” delivering spooky, spine-tingling voiceovers that echo across their award-winning Halloween mazes.</p>', 'halloween voiceover, scarefest voice, alton towers, spooky voice, evil laugh', 'Spooky, cinematic, and spine-tingling! Guy Harris is the chilling voice of Alton Towersâ€™ Scarefest, used across TV, radio, and online Halloween promos.', '<h2>The spooky scary voice of Scarefest at Alton Towers</h2>\r\n<p>This really is one of my favourite times of the year. All the <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voices\">Halloween Voices</a> come out to play â€” and then it rolls straight into <a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voice\">Christmas</a> season!</p>\r\n<p>I bet I voice 50+ Halloween projects in the run-up to 31st October. I love this Vincent Price-esque style voice. Itâ€™s even better when I hear what awesome producers can do with my <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Voice\">evil character voice</a> or <a href=\"/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Laughs Voice\">spooky laughs</a>!</p>\r\n<p>If you\'re after something darker still, have a listen to my <a href=\"/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice\" title=\"Ghost Face Scream Voice\">Ghost Face Scream voice</a> or even the classic <a href=\"/wilhelm-scream-shreek-shout-sfx-voiceover-film\" title=\"Wilhelm Screams and SFX\">Wilhelm Screams</a>.</p>', '<h2>What is Scarefest?</h2>\r\n<p>Scarefest at Alton Towers is one of the UKâ€™s biggest Halloween events. With creepy mazes, award-winning attractions, and new frights every year â€” itâ€™s a proper scream!</p>\r\n<p>From the eerie Wicker Man to the immersive Alton Towers Dungeon, visitors brave three multi-award-winning scare mazes and twisted rides in pitch darkness. Perfect for spine-tingling October nights. Itâ€™s a dream gig for a Halloween voiceover artist like me!</p>', 'alton-towers-scarefest-spooky-voice.jpg', 'UYjoqn645Ow', 'Scarefest â€“ Spooky Halloween Voice - Alton Towers ', '<h2>Want a Spooky Halloween Voice?</h2>\r\n<p>Need a voice that drips with menace, mystery, or madness? Whether itâ€™s a spooky laugh, evil whisper, or bloodcurdling scream â€” Iâ€™ve got you covered. Just listen to the <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voice Demo\">Halloween demo</a> or my <a href=\"/spooky-halloween-laughs\" title=\"Spooky Halloween Laughs\">spooky Halloween laughs</a> for inspiration.</p>\r\n<p>Let me know where itâ€™s being used and Iâ€™ll provide a quick quote (and even a sample if you like). Just drop a line via the <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">contact page</a> â€” if you dare.</p>', 'Oct 22', '1', 'Spooky Voiceover for Alton Towers Scarefest â€“ Guy Harris', '5', '', 'Alton Towers Scarefest Spooky Voice', '', '<h2>Trusted Voice for Theme Parks & Haunted Attractions</h2>\r\n<p>From the terrifying screams of <a href=\"/scary-movie-ghost-face-voice\" title=\"Ghost Face Scream Voice\">Ghost Face</a> to the eerie calm of <a href=\"/evil-character-voiceover\" title=\"Evil Character Voice\">evil narrators</a>, Iâ€™ve voiced Halloween campaigns for the UKâ€™s biggest theme parks â€” including <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voice\">Alton Towers</a> and <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Thorpe Park Halloween Voice\">Thorpe Park</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Itâ€™s not just about being scary â€” itâ€™s about creating the right mood. Whether you need unsettling whispers, creepy characters, or full-on screams, I can deliver broadcast-quality audio in any style.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">Get in touch</a> today for your own bespoke Halloween voiceover.</p>', '', '', '', 'halloween-voice-og.jpg', '', '', ''),
(948, 'voice-of-santa-guy-harris', 'Voice of Santa - Guy Harris', '<p>As heard on BBC Radio 2 and Zoe Ball\'s Breakfast Show. Heart Radio, CBeebies, Santa Radio, ITV, Boom Radio, Capital X-tra and <a href=\"santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Claus for Hire\">many more</a>!</p>\r\n', 'father christmas', 'Voice of Santa - As heard on BBC Radio 2 and Zoe Ball\'s Breakfast Show. Heart Radio, CBeebies, Santa Radio and ITV - Guy Harris - Official Father Christmas', '<br><h2><b>The UK\'s Official Father Christmas Voice</b></h2>\r\n<p>December can\'t come soon enough. This really is my favourite voice!<br>From September onwards the demand for Santa comes in and from Radio Commercials to Radio Station imaging, Event Voice of God, Personal Santa messages, the Voice of Santa for ITV, BBC Radio 2, HEART, even Santa on <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yi-4Fm40nmE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Santa on CBeebies Go Jetters\">CBeebies Go Jetters</a> and not forgetting Santa\'s very own Radio station Santa Radio.<br>\r\nRamming Christmas down your chimney!\r\n</p>', '<br><h2><b>The Voice of Santa for ITV BBC Radio 2 and Heart</b></h2>\r\n<p>Along with countless other brands across the UK, I\'m extremely proud to be the Voice of Santa. <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qqu-HDA2KJE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Santa Chatting with Zoe Ball on BBC Radio 2\">Chatting with Zoe Ball</a> just days before Christmas on air and talking with the kids is a personal highlight. Advertising Daytimes on ITV as Santa and adding to the fun on Heart Xmas really is as exciting as Christmas itself.<br>\r\nFor me the No.1 Voice of Santa is Richard Attenborough from Miracle on 34th Street but I\'m happy to take 2nd place to him. ðŸŽ…</p>', 'voice-of-santa-guy-harris.jpg', 'P44bGiUI0vE', 'Voice of Santa - Guy Harris - Official Father Christmas', '<h2 style=\"font-size: 24px; color: #AD030C;\">Where Can I Get a Genuine Voice of Santa?</h2>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nOthers may imitate, but if you want a fun, cheeky, and lovable Santa voice, youâ€™ve come to the right place!<br>\r\nSimply <a href=\"mailto:santa@voiceoverguy.co.uk\" style=\"color: #0073e6;\">email Santa</a> with your project details, including the script length and how it will be used, and the Head Elf will work out a price for you.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 18px;\">\r\nI look forward to working with youâ€”or should I say, Santa looks forward to it. Accept no substitutes!\r\n</p>', 'Dec 22', '1', 'voice-of-santa', '5', '', 'The UK\'s Official Voice of Santa', '', '<br><h2><b>Have you heard Santa Radio?</b></h2>\r\n<p>To keep the Elves motivated, Santa set up his very own radio station. In the Air and On the Air, <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Official site of Santa Radio\">Santa Radio</a> broadcasts from the North Pole 365 days a year. The Host? Well, thats Santa himself.<br>\r\nAlongside a sackful of Christmas music, listen out for Santa\'s Little Helpers! Download the <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/santa-radio/id1021183593\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Christmas Radio and Santa Radio App\">Christmas Radio App</a>, send Santa a message and may hear yourself on air. On the <a href=\"https://www.santaradio.co.uk/mugshots/all\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Santa Radio MugShots\">MugShots</a> page, Ecurb the Elf thrust the Santa Radio Mug into the hands of over 450 Celebrities!<Do have a listen to the Best Christmas Radio Station online. Santa Radio!\r\n</p>', '<br><h2><b>Free Personalised Santa Messages</b></h2>\r\n<p>Fancy a message from Santa?<br>\r\nGrab a free one over on the Santa Radio Website. <br>Father Christmas has kindly offered to record a short <a href=\"https://festivestudio.com/store/santa-radio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"FREE personal message from Santa\">FREE personal Santa message</a> for your little one.<br>\r\nSimply type in your name and hit Generate. Name not listed? <br>Top Tip. Does it sound like another name? Type a similar sounding name instead. Then simply hit download!\r\n</p>', '', '', 'voice-of-santa-guy-harris-santa_radio.jpg', 'free-personalised-santa-messages.jpg', '', ''),
(949, '13-dead-end-drive-voiceover', '13 Dead End Drive Voiceover', '<p>The voice of the murder mystery board game from IDEAL, as heard on the telly!</p>', 'quirky older ', 'A refined quirky older voice required for 13 Dead End Drive the game. As heard on television and socials across the UK. The murder mystery board game from IDEAL', '<h2><b>What is 13 Dead End Drive?</b></h2>\r\n<p>The murder mystery mansion game with 12 suspects, 5 traps and only 1 survivor!<br>\r\nAunt Agatha, a famous billionaire, has passed away. Leaving behind no direct descendants, her close friends and employees are all in with a chance to inherit her vast fortune. But money makes people greedy and only one will make it out of the mansion alive with the richesâ€¦ will you be the lucky one?\r\n</p>', '<br><h2><b>An older professional British male voice</b></h2>\r\n<p>What ever style you are looking for, do have a listen to some of the demos here on the website. Maybe for some inspiration as to what you could achieve.<br>\r\nThere is a voice for all occasions. Try the <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"characters page\">characters</a> page for a plethora of styles all performed by one man.<br>\r\nHey, don\'t forget, this is the voice of Santa ofr everyone, so you are in good hands.\r\n</p>', '13-dead-end-drive-voiceover.jpg', '2mqiqOcM7t0', '13 Dead End Drive Voice â€“ Creepy Board Game Voiceover Style', '<br><h2><b>Where can you get a quirky older sounding voice?</b></h2>\r\n<p>Trusted by global brands including IDEAL, fill in the form and let us know what you need, how many words and how it\'s to be used. <br>Usually responding within an hour and voiced the same day.<br>\r\nI look forward to working with you.\r\nâ€‹</p>', 'Nov 22', '1', '13-dead-end-drive-voiceover', '3', '', '13 Dead End Drive Voiceover', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(951, 'human-voice-over-vs-ai', 'Human Voice vs AI Voice: The Difference?', '<p>Exploring the advancements in artificial intelligence and the impact of AI on the voice over industry.</p>', 'Artificial Intelligence', 'Discover the difference between human voice overs and AI voice overs. Our blog explores the pros and cons of each, helping you choose the perfect fit!', '<h2><b>Concerns of using AI voiceovers</b></h2>\r\n<p>One major concern of using AI voiceovers is the potential lack of emotional nuance and inflection in the delivery, which can result in a flat or monotonous tone. Additionally, AI-generated voices may lack the flexibility to adjust to changes in the script or to make improvisations on the fly. There are also ethical concerns surrounding the use of AI voices for purposes such as deep-fake technology and impersonation to deceive. Finally, the use of AI voiceovers may contribute to the displacement of human voice-over artists, potentially leading to job loss and decreased opportunities in the industry.\r\n</p>', '<br><h2><b>Real voice-over artist or AI?</b></h2>\r\n<p>A real voice-over artist would be better than AI in the following situations:\r\n<br>\r\n<strong>1. Emotionally-driven content: </strong>Voice-over artists are trained to deliver the right emotion in their voice, which is often necessary for content like movie trailers, commercials, audiobooks, and video games. AI may not be able to replicate the nuanced tone and inflection required to convey the intended emotions.<br>\r\n</p>\r\n', 'human-voice-over-vs-ai-robot.jpg', 'TqkdBK8mBW8', 'Human Voice Overs vs AI Voice Overs: What\'s the Difference?', '<br><h2><b>Human VO vs AI summary</b></h2>\r\n<p>Overall, while AI-generated voices have come a long way, there are still some situations where a real voice-over artist would be better suited for the job.<br>\r\nIf looking for a genuine British Male Voiceover with years of experience available to be directed and delivery broadcast quality audio files, get in touch.\r\n<br>\r\nâ€‹</p>', 'Feb 23', '1', 'human-voice-over-vs-ai', '3', '', 'Human Voice Over vs AI', '', '<p><br><br>\r\n<strong>2. Unusual or niche accents:</strong> AI may not be able to deliver on a wide variety of accents, especially ones that are rare or very specific. A real voice-over artist who specializes in a particular accent or dialect would be better suited for such content.<br>\r\n<strong>3. Unique voice qualities:</strong> A voice-over artist who has a unique voice quality or style that is sought after for a specific project would be preferred over an AI-generated voice that sounds generic.<br>\r\n<strong>4. Improvisation and spontaneity:</strong> Voice-over artists can be directed to improvise or make changes on the fly, which is important in situations where a script may need to be modified or when ad-libbing is necessary. AI-generated voices may not have the flexibility to change the script or deliver a spontaneous response.<br>\r\n</p>', '<p><br>\r\n<strong>5. Personalization and customization: </strong>A real voice-over artist can personalize and customize their delivery to match the specific needs of a project or client. This is especially important for content that requires a personalized touch, such as e-learning modules or training videos.<br>\r\n<strong>6. Client preferences:</strong> Sometimes, clients may prefer the sound of a specific voice-over artist due to their previous work or personal preference. In such cases, it would be better to use a real voice-over artist rather than an AI-generated voice.\r\n</p>', '', 'Overall, while AI-generated voices have come a long way, there are still some situations where a real voice-over artist would be better suited for the job.', 'human-voice-over-vs-ai-robot-battle.jpg', 'professional-voice-over-vs-cheaper-alternative-voiceover.jpg', '', '');
