(952, 'thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty', 'Salty - \'Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go\'', '<p>I grew up watching Thomas the Tank Engine, so voicing Salty in <em>All Engines Go</em> on Channel 5 has been a full-circle moment. He\'s got sea legs, a salty laugh, andâ€¦ surprise sea shanties.</p>\r\n', 'Salty voice actor, Thomas & Friends All Engines Go, UK voiceover artist', 'Guy Harris voices Salty in \'Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go\'. Explore his character voiceover work, including roles of Winston and Troublesome Tanker 2.', '<h2><strong>Bringing Salty to Life in \'All Engines Go\'</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>In the reimagined series, <em><a href=\"https://ttte.fandom.com/wiki/Thomas_%26_Friends:_All_Engines_Go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go Wiki\">Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go</a></em>, I have the pleasure of voicing <strong>Salty</strong> â€“ the seasoned dockside diesel with a love for tall tales and the sound of the sea. A fan-favourite character, Salty is known for his wisdom, warmth, and occasional bursts of nautical nonsense. I was brought in to voice the UK version of the show, giving Salty a classic British flavour and plenty of personality.</p>  \r\n<p>This version of <em>Thomas & Friends</em> is bright, fast-paced, and packed with energy â€“ and it was a joy to bring Saltyâ€™s trademark sea-dog charm to a whole new generation of viewers. Working on such a beloved global brand was an honour, and Iâ€™m thrilled to be part of the engine crew.</p>\r\n', '<h2><strong>Expanding My Roles in the Thomas Universe</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Beyond voicing Salty, I also lend my voice to <strong>Winston</strong> and <strong>Troublesome Tanker 2</strong> in the UK adaptation of <em>All Engines Go</em>. Originally produced in the US, the series has been thoughtfully re-voiced for UK audiences to ensure cultural relevance and authenticity. You can explore my portrayal of Winston <a href=\"thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-winston\" title=\"Voice of Winston in Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go\">here</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Voicing these diverse characters showcases my versatility in bringing animated personalities to life. From animated series to video games, my experience spans a wide range of character types. Discover more about my character voiceover work <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover Portfolio\">here</a>.</p>\r\n', 'thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty.jpg', 'FhW74iogKg0', 'Voice of Salty â€“ Thomas & Friends All Engines Go | Guy', '<h2><strong>Letâ€™s Set Sail</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Need a voice full of charm, grit and that salty sea air? Drop me a message and letâ€™s bring your project to life â€“ no shovel and coal required.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Voiceover%20Enquiry%20â€“%20Salty%20Style\">ðŸ“© Contact Me Here</a></p>', 'Feb 23', '1', 'thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty', '5', '', 'Ahoy! I voice Salty in Thomas & Friends!', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(953, 'voice-over-word-count-calculator', 'Voice-Over - Time Word Count Calculator', '<p>Estimate your voice-over speaking time with our fast and accurate calculator.</p>', 'voiceover', 'Estimate your voice-over speaking time with our word count calculator. Get fast and accurate results for slow, normal, and fast speaking rates. Try it now! ', '<html>\r\n<head>\r\n	<title>Word Count to Speaking Time Calculator</title>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n	<h1><center>Word Count to Speaking Time Calculator</center></h1>\r\n	<p><h2><center><b>Enter the number of words in your script:</b></center></h2></p>\r\n	<center><input type=\"number\" id=\"wordCount\">\r\n	<button onclick=\"calculate()\">Calculate</button></center>\r\n	<p><h3><center><b>Estimated speaking time:</b></center></h3></p><br>\r\n	<ul>\r\n		<li><strong>Slow:</strong> <span id=\"slowTime\"></span></li>\r\n		<li><strong>Normal:</strong> <span id=\"normalTime\"></span></li>\r\n		<li><strong>Fast:</strong> <span id=\"fastTime\"></span></li>\r\n	</ul>\r\n\r\n	<script>\r\n		function calculate() {\r\n			const wordCount = document.getElementById(\"wordCount\").value;\r\n			const slowTime = (wordCount / 100);\r\n			const normalTime = (wordCount / 150);\r\n			const fastTime = (wordCount / 200);\r\n			document.getElementById(\"slowTime\").innerHTML = formatTime(slowTime);\r\n			document.getElementById(\"normalTime\").innerHTML = formatTime(normalTime);\r\n			document.getElementById(\"fastTime\").innerHTML = formatTime(fastTime);\r\n		}\r\n		\r\n		function formatTime(time) {\r\n			const minutes = Math.floor(time);\r\n			const seconds = Math.round((time - minutes) * 60);\r\n			return minutes + \" minute\" + (minutes == 1 ? \"\" : \"s\") + \", \" + seconds + \" second\" + (seconds == 1 ? \"\" : \"s\");\r\n		}\r\n	</script>\r\n<br>(coming soon, enter your cost per word)\r\n</body>\r\n</html>', '<h2><b>Voice-Over Speaking Time Calculator</b></h2>\r\n<p>Estimate your voice-over speaking time with our fast and accurate calculator. Our tool allows you to calculate the length of your script in minutes and seconds, based on the number of words and your preferred speaking rate - whether that\'s slow (100 words per minute), normal (150 words per minute), or fast (200 words per minute). With our calculator, you can easily plan your recording schedule and ensure that you have enough time to complete your project. \r\n</p>', 'voice-over-word-count-calculator.jpg', '9bs4CJ4RixI', 'Estimate Your Voice-Over Time with Our Word Count Calculator', '<h2><b>Improve Your Public Speaking Skills</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nThis text-to-speaking time calculator can help you improve your public speaking skills by enabling you to refine your delivery and pacing. With a better understanding of how long your speech will take, you can adjust your delivery and make sure you are delivering your message effectively.\r\n<br>\r\nOverall, a text-to-speaking time calculator is valuable for anyone needing to deliver a speech or read through a piece of text, and can improve the efficiency and effectiveness of your communication.\r\n</p>', 'March 2023', '1', 'voice-over-word-count-calculator', '3', '', 'Time or Word Count Calculator', '', '<h2><b>Essential Speaking Time Calculator</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nA text-to-speaking time calculator is an essential tool that can be useful for a wide range of individuals and professionals. This calculator can help you determine the exact time it takes to deliver a speech or read through a piece of text, making it an invaluable resource for public speakers, podcasters, and content creators.\r\n<br>\r\nInstead of having to manually calculate the time it takes to deliver a speech or read through a script, simply enter the text into the calculator and receive an accurate estimate of the time it will take.\r\n</p>', '<h2><b>Free To Use from <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\">VoiceoverGuy!</a></b></h2>\r\n<p>Help yourself. \r\n<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"if (window.sidebar && window.sidebar.addPanel) { /* Mozilla Firefox Bookmark */ window.sidebar.addPanel(document.title,window.location.href,\'\'); } else if( window.external && (\'AddFavorite\' in window.external)) { /* Internet Explorer Favorite */ window.external.AddFavorite(location.href,document.title); } else if(window.opera && window.print) { /* Opera Hotlist */ this.title=document.title; return true; } else { /* Other Browsers */ alert(\'Press \' + (navigator.userAgent.toLowerCase().indexOf(\'mac\') != -1 ? \'Command/Cmd\' : \'CTRL\') + \' + D to bookmark this page.\'); } return false;\">Bookmark this page!</a>\r\n\r\n</p>', '', '', 'essential-speaking-time-calculator.jpg', '', '', ''),
(954, 'professional-voice-over-vs-cheaper-alternative-voiceover', 'Pro Voice Over vs Cheaper Alternative', '<p1>Discover why a professional voiceover is worth the investment in our comparison of a pro vs a cheaper alternative.\r\n</p>', '', 'Get insights on the pros and cons of hiring a pro voiceover artist vs a cheaper alternative. Make informed decisions for your projects. Read our blog now.', '<h2><b>A Pro Voice Over vs Cheaper Alternative</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\n<strong>Experience and Expertise:</strong> A professional voiceover artist has years of experience and training, as well as a deep understanding of the nuances of voice work and can be available at short notice with it being a full time job for them.<br>\r\n<strong>High-Quality Audio:</strong> A professional voiceover artist has access to state-of-the-art equipment and recording studios, which ensures that your audio will be of the highest quality possible. This is crucial for ensuring that your message is clear and easy to understand.<br>\r\n<strong>Quick Turnaround Time:</strong> Professional voiceover artists are used to working under tight deadlines and can often deliver your project within a matter of hours. This quick turnaround time ensures that your project stays on schedule and meets your deadline.<br>\r\n</p>', '<p>\r\n<strong>Customization:</strong> A professional voiceover artist can work with you to create a voice that matches your specific needs and goals. This level of customization ensures that your voiceover will be unique and tailored to your project.<br>\r\n<strong>Reliability:</strong> Professional voiceover artists take their work seriously and are committed to delivering high-quality results every time. This level of reliability ensures that you can trust your voiceover artist to deliver the results you need, when you need them.<br>\r\n<strong>Attention to Detail:</strong> A professional voiceover artist pays attention to every detail of your project, from the tone and inflection of the voice to the pacing and timing of the delivery. This level of attention to detail ensures that your message is delivered with the perfect balance of clarity and emotion.<br>\r\n\r\n</p>', 'professional-voice-over-vs-cheaper-alternative-voiceover.jpg', 'TqkdBK8mBW8', 'Professional Voice Over vs Cheaper Alternative Voiceover', '<h2><b>Why choose a professional voice over over a cheaper alternative?</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIn this blog, we explore the benefits of choosing a professional voiceover artist over a cheaper alternative. With years of experience, access to state-of-the-art equipment, and a commitment to delivering high-quality results, a professional voiceover artist can provide you with a customized, reliable, and cost-effective solution.\r\n</p>', 'March 23', '1', 'professional-voice-over-vs-cheaper-alternative-voiceover', '5', '', 'A Pro Voice Over vs Cheaper Alternative', '', '<p>\r\n<strong>Versatility:</strong> Professional voiceover artists have the ability to deliver a wide range of voices and styles, from character voices to corporate narration. This level of versatility ensures that your project can be tailored to your specific needs and goals.<br>\r\n<strong>Professionalism:</strong> A professional voiceover artist understands the importance of professionalism and will conduct themselves in a way that reflects positively on your brand. This level of professionalism ensures that your project will be delivered with the utmost care and attention to detail.<br>\r\n</p>', '<p><br>\r\n<strong>Cost-Effective:</strong> While a professional voiceover artist may cost more upfront, they often provide a cost-effective solution in the long run. A high-quality voiceover can last for years, while a low-quality voiceover may need to be redone, costing you time and money in the long run.<br>\r\n<strong>Brand Consistency:</strong> A professional voiceover artist can help you establish a consistent brand voice across all of your projects. This level of consistency ensures that your brand is easily recognizable and helps build trust and credibility with your audience.<br>\r\n</p>', '', '', 'professional-voice-over-vs-cheaper-alternative-voiceover-studio.jpg', 'professional-voice-over-vs-cheaper-alternative-voiceover-pro.jpg', '', ''),
(955, 'tips-for-becoming-a-voiceover-actor-navigating-ai-challenges', 'Tips For Becoming a Voiceover Actor: ', '<p>This article offers tips on how to become a voiceover actor and discusses the impact of AI technology on the industry.\r\n</p>', 'human artificial intelligence ', 'This article offers tips on how to become a successful voiceover actor, while also discussing the challenges posed by AI technology in the industry.', '<h2><b>Becoming a Voiceover Actor: Navigating AI Challenges</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nBecoming a voiceover actor is a dream for many people who want to use their voice to convey emotions and stories. Voiceover acting can be a lucrative career for those who are passionate about it and have the talent and dedication to succeed. However, with the advent of AI technology, the voiceover industry is undergoing a transformation, and it\'s becoming more competitive than ever. In this article, we will discuss how to become a voiceover actor and the difficulties faced with AI technology coming in.\r\n</p>', '<h2><b>Tips to consider</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\n<strong>Develop Your Voice:</strong>\r\nTo become a voiceover actor, you need to have a unique and expressive voice that can bring characters and stories to life. The first step in becoming a voiceover actor is to develop your voice. You can do this by practicing speaking exercises such as tongue twisters and breathing exercises. You can also take vocal lessons from a professional voice coach to improve your diction, intonation, and clarity.<br>\r\n<strong>Build Your Portfolio:</strong>\r\nTo showcase your voiceover skills, you need to build a portfolio that demonstrates your range and versatility. You can start by creating a demo reel that highlights your voiceover skills. A demo reel should showcase a variety of genres such as commercials, animation, and narration. It should also demonstrate your ability to convey emotions and bring characters to life.\r\n</p>', 'professional-voice-over-vs-cheaper-alternative-voiceover.jpg', 'TqkdBK8mBW8', 'Tips 4 Becoming a Voiceover Actor: Navigating AI Challenges', '<h2><b>In summary?</b></h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIn conclusion, becoming a voiceover actor requires hard work, dedication, and perseverance. The voiceover industry is undergoing a transformation with the advent of AI technology, and voiceover actors need to adapt to stay relevant. By developing your voice, building your portfolio, joining a voiceover agency, attending auditions, staying up-to-date with the latest trends, and being persistent and resilient, you can increase your chances of success in this competitive field. While AI technology may pose challenges, it also presents opportunities for innovation and growth. By embracing new technologies and continuing to develop your skills, you can thrive as a voiceover actor in the ever-evolving landscape of the industry.\r\n</p>', 'March 2023', '1', 'tips-for-becoming-a-voiceover-actor-navigating-ai-challenges', '3', '', 'Navigating AI Challenges', '', '<br><p>\r\n<strong>Join a Voiceover Agency:</strong>\r\nTo get started in the voiceover industry, you need to get noticed by industry professionals. One way to do this is to join a voiceover agency. Voiceover agencies represent voiceover actors and connect them with clients who need voiceover services. Voiceover agencies can help you get more exposure and access to high-profile projects. However, getting accepted into an agency can be challenging, and you need to have a strong portfolio and skills to stand out.<br>\r\n<strong>Attend Auditions:</strong>\r\nAs a voiceover actor, attending auditions is a critical part of your job. Auditions allow you to showcase your skills and land new projects. To prepare for an audition, you should practice the script, research the client, and understand the character you\'re portraying. It\'s also important to be confident and enthusiastic about your performance.\r\n</p>', '<br><p>\r\n<strong>Stay Up-to-Date with the Latest Trends:</strong>\r\nThe voiceover industry is constantly evolving, and it\'s essential to stay up-to-date with the latest trends and technology. With the advent of AI technology, voiceover actors need to be adaptable and flexible. It\'s important to understand how AI technology works and how it\'s changing the voiceover industry. Voiceover actors need to be open to new technology and willing to embrace it as part of their career.<br>\r\n<strong>Challenges Faced with AI Technology:</strong>\r\nAs mentioned, AI technology is transforming the voiceover industry. AI technology can generate realistic-sounding voiceovers that mimic human voices. This technology can also create custom voices, which can be used for personalized voice experiences for consumers. However, this also means that voiceover actors face competition from AI-generated voiceovers. Voiceover actors need to adapt and find ways to stand out in a competitive industry. See our post on <a href=\"human-voice-over-vs-ai\" title=\"humans vs AI technology\">Humans vs AI technology</a>.<br>\r\n<strong>Be Persistent and Patient:</strong>\r\nBecoming a voiceover actor is not an overnight success story. It takes time, dedication, and patience. Voiceover actors need to be persistent and keep working on their skills and portfolio. It\'s also essential to be open to feedback and take criticism constructively. Remember that rejection is part of the job, and it\'s important not to take it personally.\r\n</p>', '', '', 'human-voice-over-vs-ai-robot.jpg', 'professional-voice-over-vs-cheaper-alternative-voiceover.jpg', '', ''),
(956, 'turkish-bird-attenborough-voice', 'Turkish Bird - David Attenborough', '<p>Voice of Sir David Attenborough... well, almost. Here\'s a parody for Turkish Airlines.</p>', 'parody voice', 'Turkish Airlines used a David Attenborough style voiceover for their fun video. A parody narrated by the UKâ€™s most in-demand Attenborough voice. ', '<h2>How do you get a David Attenborough-style voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>As a <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Style Voice\">British Male Voiceover</a> artist, this has been one of my most popular character impressions. Turkish Airlines approached me to bring their \"Turkish Bird\" video to life in the iconic style of <strong>Sir David Attenborough</strong>.</p>\r\n<p>This wasnâ€™t my first time voicing in that iconic tone â€” Iâ€™ve also done it for the <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/horizon-zero-dawn-voice\" title=\"Horizon Zero Dawn Attenborough Voice\">Horizon Zero Dawn video game trailer</a> and the viral <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Cracking Ice â€“ Attenborough Spoof\">Cracking Ice spoof</a>.</p>\r\n<p>And now, you can even generate your own mini-narration with my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"Attenborough Style AI Script Tool\">Attenborough Script Generator</a>!</p>', '<h2>Why choose parody over the real thing?</h2>\r\n<p>Letâ€™s be honest â€“ Sir Davidâ€™s not likely to narrate your TikTok or corporate explainer any time soon. Thatâ€™s where I come in. My job is to recreate the sound, rhythm, and gravitas of his styleâ€¦ without ever claiming to be the man himself.</p>\r\n<p>Itâ€™s respectful, comedic, and highly effective. My clients come back time and again when they want <strong>nature doc-style narration</strong> with a wink to the audience.</p>', 'turkish-bird-attenborough-voice.jpg', 'TC8zbjTOuJE', 'Turkish Airlines â€“ David Attenborough Style Voice', '<h2>How to get David Attenboroughâ€™s voice (sort of)</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re after the <strong>style</strong> of David Attenborough for a video, game, or narration, Iâ€™d be happy to help â€“ as long as itâ€™s all above board. Please keep it fun, light, and respectful. No profanity. No deepfakes. And definitely no claiming to be him.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Attenborough%20Voice%20Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy now\">ðŸ“§ Get in touch</a> and letâ€™s see what we can create together.</p>', '2023-06-01', '1', 'david attenborough style voice for turkish airlines', '5', 'attenboroughâ€, â€œparody voiceâ€, â€œturkish airlines', 'David Attenborough Voice - Turkish Airlines', '', '<br><h2>Have a listen to the Turkish Bird campaign</h2>\r\n<p>Watch the video to hear how we made an aeroplane feel like a BBC documentary subject. Itâ€™s fun, itâ€™s cheeky, and it worked beautifully.</p>\r\n<p>Need something similar? You can <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Style Voice Booking\">hire the same voice here</a>.</p>', '', '', '', 'attenborough-voice-og.jpg', '', '', ''),
(957, 'yorkshire-podcast-studio', 'Yorkshire Podcast Studio ', '<p>Yorkshire Podcast Studio â€“ a professional recording space for podcasts, voiceovers, interviews and content creators. Fully treated, broadcast-quality sound with Neumann microphones and a relaxed, private environment.</p>', 'podcast studio, recording studio Yorkshire, U87 mic', 'Book a professional podcast studio in Yorkshire. Ideal for creators, voiceovers and interviews â€” available with Source Connect and broadcast-quality mics.', '<h2><strong>Professional Podcast Studio in West Yorkshire</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re looking for a high-quality podcast studio in Yorkshire, this space is built for creators who need crystal-clear audio without the hassle of setting up their own kit. Itâ€™s hosted TV presenter <strong>Chris Kamara</strong> (who also recorded with me for Santa Radio using my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voice\">Santa Voice</a>), Emmerdale actors, game developers, agency producers, and medical voiceover clients.</p>\r\n<p>Located in a quiet, discreet neighbourhood with off-street parking, this studio is ideal for recording podcasts, interviews, narration, or video content voiceovers in a comfortable, professional environment.</p>', '<h2><strong>Whatâ€™s Inside the Studio?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The studio is fitted with <strong>Neumann U87 microphones</strong>, professional preamps, acoustic treatment, and broadcast-quality monitoring. Whether youâ€™re recording a podcast, a commercial, interviews or long-form content, youâ€™ll get clean, consistent, professional sound.</p>\r\n<p>If you want to see more of the technical setup or room layout, take a look at the <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Voiceover Studio\">main Voiceover Studio page</a>.</p>', 'west-yorkshire-studio-march25.jpg', '9bs4CJ4RixI', 'Yorkshire Podcast Studio â€“ Professional Recording Space', '<h2><strong>Book Your Podcast Studio Today</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you need a podcast studio in Yorkshire that delivers clean, broadcast-quality audio, this space is available to hire by the hour or the day. Ideal for creators, businesses and broadcasters.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Podcast Studio Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy about podcast studio hire\">Email Guy</a> or <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy about studio hire\">get in touch</a> to check availability and book your session.</p>', '2025-10-08', '1', 'yorkshire-podcast-studio', '0', 'yorkshire podcast studio\", \"U87 voiceover\", \"west yorkshire recording', 'Yorkshire Podcast Studio â€“ Book a pro recording space!', '', '<h2><strong>Used by Professionals</strong></h2>\r\n<p>This West Yorkshire studio has been trusted by producers from TV, radio and gaming, including <strong>Chris Kamara</strong>, agency teams working on national brands, Emmerdale actors, medical organisations, and content creators who need reliable, polished audio. Whether youâ€™re a <strong>podcaster</strong>, <strong>broadcaster</strong>, <strong>voice artist</strong>, or <strong>business owner</strong>, this space is perfect for achieving premium sound.</p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(959, 'arabella-harris-girl-child-voiceover-kid', 'Arabella Harris â€“ Child Girl Voiceover Artist', '<p>Arabella Harris â€“ Professional UK Girl Child Voiceover Artist</p>\r\n', 'Arabella Harris â€“ Award-Winning Girl Child Voiceover Artist', 'British girl child voiceover artist Arabella Harris brings energy, clarity, and charm to commercials, explainer videos, radio, and national campaigns.', '<h1>Arabella Harris â€“ British Girl Child Voiceover</h1>\r\n<p>Arabella Harris is a professional British child voiceover artist based in the UK. At just 9 years old, sheâ€™s already voiced national radio ads for Tesco, Sainsburyâ€™s, KISS, Asda, Morrisons, Nickelodeon and more. With her natural, confident tone and clear British young girl voice, Arabella brings warmth, charm, and credibility to every script â€“ whether it\'s for TV, radio, eLearning, or animation.</p>\r\n<p>Looking to cast a talented child voice for your next campaign?<br><a href=\"https://www.arabellaharris.com\" target=\"_blank\">Visit her official website</a> or listen to her demos below.</p>\r\n', '<h2><strong>Projects & Experience:</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Arabellaâ€™s voice has featured on UK radio, animated characters, and educational content aimed at children.\r\n<br>\r\nSheâ€™s also the voice of a Penguin attraction in Oman, proving her talent travels well beyond the UK. With clear diction, natural charm, and loves direction, sheâ€™s a favourite for fun, youthful reads.\r\n<br>\r\nWhether itâ€™s playful, sincere, or full of excitement, her voice is perfect for capturing the imagination of young audiences â€” and often makes grown-ups smile too.</p>\r\n', 'arabella-harris-voiceover-kid.jpg', 'XUJm7iRZ8FI', 'Arabella Harris â€“ British Girl Child Voiceover Artist', '<h2><strong>Want Arabella for Your Next Project?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re looking for a talented British girl child voiceover, Arabella is available for bookings through me. For rates and availability, <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a> today!</p>\r\n', '2025-06-04', '1', 'Arabella Harris British Girl Child Voiceover Kid', '5', 'girl child voiceover\", \"British kid voice over\", \"young girl voiceover', 'Award-winning Child Voice', '', '<h2><strong>Related Voice Styles You Might Like</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re casting a campaign that features children or families, you might also enjoy some of my most popular character voices:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice Style\">David Attenborough-style Narration</a> â€“ Great for nature-themed or spoof educational content.</li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Claus Voiceover\">Santa Claus Voice</a> â€“ My festive voice work used by BBC, ITV and Tesco, perfect for Christmas campaigns alongside a child VO.</li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"/pathe-news-voice\" title=\"PathÃ© News Voiceover\">PathÃ© News Voice Style</a> â€“ Ideal for nostalgic, comedic, or historical reads.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>These signature voices have featured in national campaigns, viral videos, and social media stunts â€” they pair brilliantly with a youthful or family-led tone.</p>', '', '', '', 'guy-harris-characters.jpg', '', '', ''),
(960, 'qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover', 'PSG Qatar Drone Race Football Commentator', '<p>A high-energy football commentator voiceover for PSGâ€™s Qatar Drone Race event.</p>\r\n', 'psg drone race, football commentator, mbappÃ©', 'High-energy football commentary for PSGâ€™s Qatar Drone Race featuring MbappÃ©. See more of Guyâ€™s football commentator voice work for top global brands.', '<h2>Bringing Football Commentary to PSGâ€™s Qatar Drone Race</h2>\r\n<p>PSG wanted a commentator who could bring football-style excitement to something completely different: a high-speed drone race featuring MbappÃ© and the team. Blending match-day energy with fast-paced action was a brilliant challenge and great fun to record.</p>\r\n<p>If youâ€™d like to hear more of this style, my full <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">football commentator voice</a> page features work for Betfred, Turkish Airlines, Just Eat, and Manchester City.</p>\r\n', '<h2>PSGâ€™s Qatar Drone Race â€“ Footballers Take Flight</h2>\r\n<p>The Qatar Drone Race showcased PSG players tackling an innovative aerial challenge across dramatic desert landscapes. With drones reaching huge speeds, the commentary needed the same energy you\'d expect from a live match broadcast.</p>\r\n<p>You can also explore similar projects such as my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat UEFA Football Commentator\">UEFA Just Eat commentator work</a> or my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/manchester-city-football-commentry-voice\" title=\"Manchester City Football Commentary Voice\">Manchester City commentary</a>.</p>\r\n', 'qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover.jpg', 'iVN3FOhbXJo', 'PSG Drone Race Football Commentary Voice | Guy Harris', '<h2>Need a Versatile Commentator?</h2>\r\n<p>If you need a commentator who can deliver excitement to any project â€“ sport, gaming, tech, promos, or branded content â€“ Iâ€™d be happy to help. With years of experience and a broadcast-quality booth, everything is recorded remotely from my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Voiceover Studio\">professional voiceover studio</a> with fast turnaround.</p>\r\n<p>Send over a short sample of your script and Iâ€™ll record a free audition. <a href=\"contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">Get in touch</a> and letâ€™s chat about your project.</p>', 'Aug 23', '1', 'psg drone race football commentator voice', '3', 'psg voiceoverâ€,â€œfootball commentator voiceâ€,â€œsports promo voice', 'PSG football commentator voice â€“ Qatar Drone Race', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(961, 'craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover', 'Craig Cash Impression - Gurubox Fishing', '<p>Spot-On Craig Cash Impression for Gurubox\'s Fishing Parody</p>', 'Mancunian, Gurubox, parody, impression, Gogglebox', 'A hilarious parody with a fishing twistâ€”Guy Harris nails a Craig Cash-style voiceover for Gurubox, delivering warmth, wit and spot-on northern narration.', '<h2>Mastering the Art of Craig Cash\'s Voice</h2>\r\n<p>When Gurubox sought a voice artist who could authentically emulate Craig Cash\'s soft-spoken Mancunian tone, they turned to me. My extensive experience in character voiceovers, including a variety of <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"character impressions\">character impressions</a>, made me the ideal choice. This project allowed me to showcase my ability to capture the nuances of Craig\'s distinctive narration style, adding a unique touch to their content.</p>\r\n', '<h2>Gurubox: A Hilarious Fishing Parody</h2>\r\n<p>Gurubox is a clever parody of the popular UK TV show Gogglebox, tailored for the angling community. In this series, anglers watch and humorously comment on fishing videos, mirroring the original show\'s format. By providing a spot-on Craig Cash impression for the narration, I helped Gurubox deliver an authentic and entertaining experience that resonated with their audience.</p>\r\n', 'craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover.jpg', 'OmVuCVXsWM4', 'Craig Cash Impression for Gurubox â€“ Gogglebox Fishing Parody', '<h2>Need a Character Voice?</h2>  \r\n<p>If youâ€™re looking for a spot-on impression or a unique character voice, <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceovers\">check out my character work here</a>. Need something bespoke? <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"eMail Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a></p>\r\n', 'April 24', '1', 'craig-cash-gogglebox-voiceover', '3', '', 'Gogglebox Craig Cash for Gurubox', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(963, 'masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins', 'Butlins Voice of God - The Masked Singer', '<p>Powerful Voice of God for Butlins - The Masked Singer Live Show</p>', 'Voice of God, Events', 'Powerful Voice of God for Butlinsâ€™ Masked Singer Show! Live event intros, promos & award ceremonies. Need a pro VO? Letâ€™s talk with a great voiceover', '<h2>Bringing the Voice of God to Butlins</h2>  \r\n<p>When it comes to a commanding yet engaging Voice of God, Iâ€™m often the go-to. Butlins needed a strong and dynamic voice for their live stage version of <em>The Masked Singer</em>, and having voiced countless live events, awards shows, and even <a href=\"saturday-night-takeaway-voice\" title=\"Ant & Decâ€™s Saturday Night Takeaway Voice\">Ant & Decâ€™s Saturday Night Takeaway Tour</a>, I was the perfect fit. This is a genre I love working in, and itâ€™s always a buzz to set the stage with my voice.</p>\r\n', '<h2>The Masked Singer Comes to Butlins</h2>  \r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.butlins.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Butlins Official Website\">Butlins</a> is known for bringing top-tier entertainment to families, and this live adaptation of <em>The Masked Singer</em> is no exception. As their long-time Voice of God, I not only introduced the show with authority but also provided the promo voice, setting the excitement for the audience. Whether hyping up a crowd or creating that signature grand introduction, my voice helped make the experience truly immersive.</p>', 'masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins.jpg', 'e0vZ9cxdilo', 'Voice of God for Butlins - The Masked Singer Live Show', '<h2>Need a Professional Voice of God?</h2>  \r\n<p>From live shows to award ceremonies, if you need a Voice of God that commands attention, letâ€™s chat! I provide powerful, engaging, and professional voiceovers for events of all sizes. <a href=\"contact-guy\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact Guy\">Get in touch today!</a></p>', '', '1', 'masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins', '5', '', 'Voice of God for <em>The Masked Singer</em> LIVE', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(966, 'seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover', 'Seabrooks Sponsorship - In for a Penny', '<p>Energetic and Quirky Voiceover for Seabrook Crisps â€“ In for a Penny on ITV</p>', 'ITV', 'Energetic & quirky voiceover for Seabrook Crispsâ€™ sponsorship of In for a Penny on ITV! Saturday night fun with Stephen Mulhern. Need a VO? Get in touch!', '<h2>Bringing the Energy for Seabrook Crisps</h2>\r\n<p>When it comes to lively, engaging voiceovers, Iâ€™m often called upon to deliver just the right tone. For this campaign, Seabrook Crisps needed an energetic and quirky voice to match the fun of In for a Penny on ITV. Given my experience in promo voices and high-energy reads, I was the perfect fit. The session was a blastâ€”fast-paced, full of laughs, and exactly the kind of gig I love!\r\n</p>', '<br><h2>A Perfect Match for a Saturday Night Favourite</h2>\r\n<p>Seabrook Crisps, known for their bold flavours and iconic ridges, were the proud sponsors of In for a Penny with Stephen Mulhern. The sponsorship bumpers aired during the show, grabbing viewersâ€™ attention with a voiceover that was as playful as the game show itself. The agency wanted something punchy and memorable, and I delivered just thatâ€”setting the tone for a Saturday night of fun!</p>', 'seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover.jpg', 'QKDoDngvBjU', 'Seabrooks Sponsor Voice â€“ In for a Penny Promo', '<br><h2>Need a High-Energy Voiceover?</h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re looking for a voiceover artist who can bring energy, character, and engagement to your brand, get in touch! Whether it\'s TV, radio, or online content, I provide dynamic reads that connect with audiences. Drop me a message and letâ€™s make something amazing!\r\n</p>', 'April 24', '1', 'seabrooks-in-for-a-penny-sponsor-voiceover', '5', '', ' In for a Penny and Seabrooks - fun voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(967, 'britains-got-talent-competition-voice', 'Britain\'s Got Talent - Competition Voice', '<p>Powerful Voiceover for Britain\'s Got Talent 2025 Competition</p>\r\n', 'BGT competition, ITV voiceover, Universal Orlando', 'Engaging voiceover for Britain\'s Got Talent 2025 competition spot! Promoting Â£60k cash & Universal Orlando trip. Need a powerful VO? Let\'s collaborate!', '<h2>Delivering Impactful Voiceovers for Major ITV Competitions</h2>\r\n<p>When it comes to high-stakes competition promotions, a commanding voice is essential. My extensive experience with ITV\'s competition segments, including <a href=\"this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice\" title=\"This Morning\'s Spin to Win\">This Morning\'s Spin to Win</a> and <em>Loose Women</em>, has honed my ability to deliver powerful and engaging voiceovers. This expertise made me the ideal choice for Britain\'s Got Talent 2025\'s latest competition spot, where a strong and captivating delivery is paramount.</p>\r\n', '<h2>Britain\'s Got Talent 2025: Win Â£60,000 and a Trip to Universal Orlando</h2>\r\n<p>This year\'s Britain\'s Got Talent competition offers viewers a chance to win an incredible prize: Â£60,000 in cash and a holiday to <a href=\"https://www.universalorlando.com/web/en/gb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Universal Orlando Resort\">Universal Orlando Resort</a>. As the voice behind this exciting promotion, I had the pleasure of bringing energy and enthusiasm to the spot, enticing viewers to participate in this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. Collaborating with such prestigious brands as ITV and Universal Studios underscores the significance of this competition.</p>\r\n', 'britains-got-talent-competition-voice.jpg', '4yTnVRDXZfQ', 'Dynamic Voiceover for Britain\'s Got Talent 2025 Competition', '<h2>Need a Powerful Voice for Your Next Project?</h2>\r\n<p>If you\'re seeking a voiceover that commands attention and elevates your brand, let\'s connect! With a proven track record in delivering impactful voiceovers for major television competitions and promotions, I\'m ready to bring that same energy to your project. <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"eMail Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a></p>', 'March 25', '1', 'britains-got-talent-competition-voice', '5', '', 'Voiceover for BGT 2025 Competition!', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(968, 'microsoft-cloud-explainer-video', 'Microsoft Cloud Explainer Voiceover', '<p>Explainer Voiceover for Microsoft â€“ Advertising the Cloud</p>', 'explainer voice, Microsoft voiceover, cloud video', 'Natural, conversational voiceover for Microsoftâ€™s Cloud explainer video. Clear, trustworthy delivery that drives tech engagement. Need a VO? Letâ€™s talk!', '<h2><strong>Trusted Voice for Conversational Explainer Videos</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>Explainer videos need to feel natural, confident, and easy to follow â€“ and thatâ€™s exactly where I come in. My work with <strong>Microsoft</strong> on a video advertising their Cloud services is a perfect example of my <a href=\"explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceovers\">conversational explainer style</a>. Iâ€™ve also delivered the iconic <a href=\"apple-voice-style\" title=\"Apple Voice Style\">Apple-style voiceovers</a>, showcasing my ability to sound clear, calm, and genuinely human â€“ ideal for tech brands who want to connect with real people.</p>\r\n', '<h2><strong>Microsoft Cloud â€“ Explaining the Future</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>While the video itself is from a few years back, it still stands as a strong piece in my portfolio. The brief? A <strong>natural and engaging voiceover</strong> that could break down Microsoftâ€™s Cloud offering for a broad audience. No jargon overload. No robotic tone. Just a real, human delivery that helps people understand the tech. Thatâ€™s where my voice really fits.</p>\r\n', 'microsoft-cloud-explainer-video.jpg', 'LRvWnpX_c9g', 'Microsoft Cloud Explainer Voiceover â€“ Natural & Trusted', '<h2><strong>Need a Conversational Explainer Voice?</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>If youâ€™re creating a video that needs to sound natural, clear, and relatable, I can help. For bookings and availability, <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a> today.</p>\r\n', 'Jan 2018', '1', 'microsoft-cloud-explainer-video', '3', '', 'Explainer Video Voice for Microsoft', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(969, 'samsung-national-radio-commercial', 'Samsung NEO QLED Radio Voice', '<p>Samsung NEO QLED â€“ Hard Sell National Radio Voiceover</p>', 'Samsung radio, hard sell, NEO QLED', 'Hard sell voiceover for Samsung NEO QLED national radio ad. A bold, punchy delivery aired UK-wide. Want the same impact for your brand? Letâ€™s talk!', '<h2><strong>Trusted Voice for High-Impact National Campaigns</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>When a brand like <strong>Samsung</strong> needs a bold, punchy voice for a nationwide ad campaign, you bring the energy. I was chosen to voice their <strong>NEO QLED TV radio ads</strong> across all major UK stations â€“ and they returned again this year. </p>\r\n', '<h2><strong>National Radio Campaign for Samsung NEO QLED</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>My  hard sell delivery was the perfect fit for this high-octane, football-season push. Powerful, punchy, and driving the message home.<br>The campaign ran UK-wide and promoted the stunning <strong>Samsung NEO QLED TV</strong> range â€“ timed perfectly with the football season. From match-day drama to immersive sound and screen tech, the ads demanded a voice that could match the energy. </p>\r\n', 'samsung-national-radio-commercial.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/1821515328&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/samsung-neo-qled-tv-national-radio-ad\" title=\"Samsung Neo QLED TV - National Radio Ad\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Samsung Neo QLED TV - National Radio Ad</a></div>', 'Samsung NEO QLED Radio Voice â€“ Hard Sell Campaign Voiceover', '<h2><strong>Need a Hard Sell Radio Voice?</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>Whether itâ€™s for tech, retail, sport or high-profile national campaigns, I bring the impact. Letâ€™s work together on your next project. <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a>.</p>\r\n', 'April 24', '2', 'samsung-national-radio-commercial', '3', '', 'Samsung NEO QLED â€“ Hard sell voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(970, 'vernon-kay-ultra-ultra-marathon-challenge-uk-trailer-voice', 'British Trailer Voice for BBC R2', '<p>British Trailer Voice for Vernon Kayâ€™s Ultra Marathon Challenge Promo</p>\r\n', 'trailer voice, BBC Radio promo, Vernon Kay', 'British trailer-style voiceover for Vernon Kayâ€™s Ultra Marathon promo on BBC Radio 2. A bold voice for Children in Need. Need a trailer voice? Letâ€™s talk!', '<h2><strong>British Trailer Voice for National BBC Campaign</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>When the BBC needed a strong, cinematic voice to promote <strong>Vernon Kayâ€™s Ultra Ultra Marathon Challenge</strong> for <em>Children in Need</em>, they called me. My signature <a href=\"penarium-game-trailer-voice\" title=\"UK Trailer Voice for Penarium\">British movie trailer voice</a> style gave the promo the dramatic weight it needed, broadcast across <strong>BBC Radio 2</strong> all day, every day. It was bold, powerful and packed with energy â€“ just like the challenge itself.</p>\r\n', '<h2><strong>Children in Need â€“ Vernonâ€™s 115-Mile Ultra Challenge</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>Vernon Kay ran from Leicester to Bolton, covering over <strong>115 miles in four days</strong> to raise money for BBC Children in Need. The promo followed his progress and inspired the public, helping raise a staggering <strong>Â£6 million</strong>. The trailer-style delivery brought a sense of scale and urgency to the challenge, turning heads across the UK.</p>\r\n<p>Check out similar <a href=\"good-game-empire-trailer-voice\" title=\"Good Game Empire Trailer Voice\">trailer-style voiceovers</a> Iâ€™ve done here.</p>\r\n', 'vernon-kay-ultra-ultra-marathon-challenge-uk-trailer-voice.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"166\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/1821517554&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/vernon-kay-ultra-ultra-marathon-challenge-promo\" title=\"Vernon Kay - Ultra Ultra Marathon Challenge Promo\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Vernon Kay - Ultra Ultra Marathon Challenge Promo</a></div>', 'Vernon Kay Ultra Marathon â€“ British Trailer Voice for BBC R2', '<h2><strong>Need a British Trailer Voice?</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>Whether itâ€™s for a game, charity campaign, or cinematic promo, my <strong>UK trailer voice</strong> delivers drama and impact. <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy direct now\">Get in touch</a> to discuss your next campaign.</p>\r\n', '', '2', 'vernon-kay-ultra-ultra-marathon-challenge-uk-trailer-voice', '5', '', 'Trailer voice - BBCâ€™s Ultra Marathon', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(971, 'thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-winston', 'Winston - \'Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go\'', '<p>Voice of Winston in \'Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go\'</p>\r\n', 'Winston voice actor, Thomas & Friends UK, character voiceover', 'British voice of Winston in \'Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go\'. Guy Harris also voices Salty & Troublesome Tanker 2 in the UK version. Hear his character work!', '<h2><strong>Giving Winston His Voice in the UK Adaptation</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>In the colourful reboot <em><a href=\"https://ttte.fandom.com/wiki/Thomas_%26_Friends:_All_Engines_Go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go Wiki\">Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go</a></em>, I voice <strong>Winston</strong> â€“ the quirky red track inspection car and trusted companion to Sir Topham Hat. Known for his offbeat personality, Winston is a brilliant character to play, offering moments of comic relief and warmth in equal measure.</p>  \r\n<p>I was asked to voice for the UK version of the show, bringing British charm, energy and clarity to Winston. It\'s a role of which it\'s just the sort of voice work I love doing.</p>\r\n', '<h2><strong>More Engines, More Fun</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>Winston isnâ€™t the only character I voice in <em>All Engines Go</em>. I also play <strong>Salty</strong> â€“ the sea-loving dockside diesel â€“ and <strong>Troublesome Tanker 2</strong>. You can read more about my role as Salty <a href=\"thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-salty\" title=\"Voice of Salty in Thomas & Friends\">here</a>.</p>  \r\n<p>Being part of such a globally recognised brand is a joy â€“ and voicing multiple characters highlights the versatility needed in animation work. Want to hear more of my character voiceovers? Check out my full range <a href=\"character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover Portfolio\">here</a>.</p>\r\n', 'thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-winston.jpg', '1lgoATPu4k4', 'Voice of Winston â€“ Thomas & Friends: All Engines Go | Guy', '<h2><strong>Need a Character Voice?</strong></h2>  \r\n<p>If youâ€™re looking for a British voice actor who can bring animated characters to life â€“ quirky, gruff, cheerful or cheeky â€“ Iâ€™d love to help. <a href=\"mailto:guy@Voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Website Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy directly\">Get in touch</a> and letâ€™s chat about your next project.</p>\r\n', 'March 25', '1', 'Thomas the tank engine voice of winston', '3', 'Thomas the tank engine voices\",\"Voice of Winston\",\"Voiceover characters', 'Voice of Winston in All Engines Go', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '');
INSERT INTO `messages2` (`id`, `url`, `page_title`, `info`, `search_terms`, `page_desc`, `text1`, `text2`, `image`, `video`, `meta_title`, `bottomtext`, `date`, `whatvideo`, `alt`, `rating`, `twitter`, `hometext`, `santa`, `ntext1`, `ntext2`, `ntext3`, `ntext4`, `nimage1`, `nimage2`, `nimage3`, `nimage4`) VALUES
(972, 'ai-guy-human-vs-ai-voiceover', 'Human First! GuyAi vs Human Voice!', '<p>AI voice technology has its place. But if you want personality, nuance and a bit of sparkle, thereâ€™s still no substitute for a real voice actor. </p>', 'artificial intelligence, AI voiceover, voice clone, synthetic voice, GuyAi', 'AI voice can work, but nothing beats the real thing. Guy Harris offers both â€“ but for quality and impact, it\'s Human First. Book the voice that delivers.', '<h2><strong>Yes, I Have an AI Voice</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Itâ€™s true... Iâ€™ve trained an AI version of my voice. Itâ€™s available 24/7, doesnâ€™t drink tea, and never forgets a line. Saving Money? Yeah it\'s ok for explainer videos, internal comms, or projects with tight budgets and tighter deadlines. Itâ€™s quick, flexible, and ideal for when time or cost is the biggest concern. However donâ€™t expect it to improvise a punchline or lift a line off the page. For certain tasks and projects, it gets the job done. Just know what youâ€™re getting.</p>\r\n', '<h2><strong>But Hereâ€™s the Catchâ€¦</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Youâ€™ll spend time typing, editing, tweaking, and second-guessing. You might save money, but youâ€™ll pay in faff. And by the time you\'ve got it sounding â€œokayâ€, I couldâ€™ve given you a perfect human read, probably before your AI version even finished rendering. With me, thereâ€™s no guesswork. No robotic tone. Just 25 years experience, instinct, and a voice that knows exactly how to land your message first time. Just because AI is new, doesn\'t mean it\'s better.</p>\r\n', 'guy-ai-voiceoverguy.jpg', '<iframe width=\"100%\" height=\"300\" scrolling=\"no\" frameborder=\"no\" allow=\"autoplay\" src=\"https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/2096818659&color=%23ff5500&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&show_teaser=true&visual=true\"></iframe><div style=\"font-size: 10px; color: #cccccc;line-break: anywhere;word-break: normal;overflow: hidden;white-space: nowrap;text-overflow: ellipsis; font-family: Interstate,Lucida Grande,Lucida Sans Unicode,Lucida Sans,Garuda,Verdana,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-weight: 100;\"><a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy\" title=\"VoiceoverGuy\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">VoiceoverGuy</a> Â· <a href=\"https://soundcloud.com/voiceoverguy/guy-harris-ai-voice-demo-2025\" title=\"Guy Harris - AI Voice Demo 2025\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"color: #cccccc; text-decoration: none;\">Guy Harris - AI Voice Demo 2025</a></div>', 'AI Voice vs Real Voice | Human First Voiceovers â€“ Guy Harris', '<h2><strong>Letâ€™s Talk â€“ Human or AI?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you still want to use the AI version of me, Iâ€™ll point you to it. But if youâ€™re serious about quality, Iâ€™ll give you a voiceover that sings. No setup, no tweaking. Just done.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Voiceover%20Enquiry%20â€“%20Human%20First\">ðŸ“© Drop me a message</a> and letâ€™s bring it to life the right way.</p>', 'May 2025', '2', 'Guy Harris real vs AI voiceover comparison', '5', '', 'AI is clever â€“ but the real voice still wins.', '', '<br><h2><strong>When to Use AI (and When Not To)</strong></h2>\r\n<p>âœ… Internal training? Yeah it\'s ok. <br>\r\nâœ… Placeholder voice for a pitch? Go for it. <br>\r\nâŒ Emotional storytelling? <br>\r\nâŒ Brand films? <br>\r\nâŒ That big-budget pitch youâ€™ve worked on for 6 months? Donâ€™t.</p>\r\n<p>When it matters, choose <strong>Human First</strong>.</p>', '<br><h2><strong>Real Voice. Real Results.</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Voiceover is more than reading lines. Itâ€™s about delivering nuance, rhythm, warmth and intent. Itâ€™s knowing when to pause. When to punch. When to pull back. Thatâ€™s the difference a human makes. Thatâ€™s the difference I make. With every read, I bring decades of experience, instinct, and storytelling to the mic, something no synthetic voice can truly replicate. If your message matters, your voice should too. Let me make it sound exactly right.</p>', '', '', 'guy-ai-voiceoverguy-robots.jpg', 'guy-ai-voiceoverguy-robots-trash-studio.jpg', '', ''),
(973, 'nuby-commentator-voice', 'Midnight Mayhem! Nubyâ€™s Milk Race', '<p>Parents, you know the scene: the baby stirs, panic sets in, and the race begins. Nuby turned this real-life pressure cooker into an actual raceâ€¦ and called me in to commentate.</p>', 'sport narration, parody commentator', 'Highâ€‘energy commentator voiceover by Guyâ€¯Harris for Nubyâ€™s Milk Race ad â€” think adrenalin meets bedtime bottle. Need commentary that pops?', '<h2><strong>The Milk Race â€“ Comedy Meets Commentary</strong></h2>\r\n<p><span class=\"isblack\">Nuby UK</span> needed a commentator-style voiceover to bring humour and energy to a scenario every parent knows too well, prepping a bottle at 3am before the screaming begins. Fast, frantic, and genuinely fun to voice. Think Formula 1 meets nursery night shift.</p>\r\n<p>So I delivered a sharp, energetic read that captured the tension and comedy of a baby bottle sprint.</p>\r\n<p>ðŸŽ¥ Watch the full video over at <a href=\"https://uk.nuby.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Nuby UK Website\">Nuby UK</a>.</p>', '<br><h2><strong>Like This Style? Here Are More Commentary Voiceovers</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If you loved the tone of the Milk Race, you might enjoy these:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/qatar-drone-race-psg-voiceover\" title=\"Drone Race Commentary Voice\">Qatar Drone Race â€“ PSG Style Commentary</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/just-eat-uefa-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Just Eat UEFA Voiceover\">Just Eat x UEFA â€“ Football Commentary Voice</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/etisalat-celebrating-victory-football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Etisalat Victory Voiceover\">Etisalat â€“ Celebrating Victory with Commentary</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Each one has its own energy, tailored tone, and paceâ€”but all tap into that high-adrenaline feel.</p>', 'nuby-commentator-voice.jpg', 'tjedCHV32ZY', 'Nuby Baby Bottle Football Commentator Voice â€“ Guy Harris VO', '<h2><strong>Need a Commentator Voice?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Whether itâ€™s sport, parody, or a playful take on everyday chaosâ€”I can deliver a high-energy commentator-style voice to suit your brand. From football finals to feeding frenzies, Iâ€™ve got it covered.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Commentary%20Voiceover%20Enquiry\">ðŸ“© Drop me a message</a> and letâ€™s make some noise.</p>', 'March 25', '1', 'nuby-commentator-voice', '3', '', 'nuby commentator voice', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(974, 'voice-of-venom', 'The Voice of Venom', '<p>What happens when a voiceover artist watches Venom 1 & 2 back-to-back? He ends up trying to summon a gravelly alien symbiote voice from the depths of his stomach. Spoiler: I didâ€¦ and it worked.</p>', 'dark, gritty , villain, Marvel', 'I recreated the voice of Venom using only my vocal cords. No effects, no AI. Watch it now and explore more of my gritty, monstrous character voice work.', '<h2><strong>The Voice That Growls From the Shadows</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Tom Hardyâ€™s performance as Venom is iconicâ€”not just visually, but vocally. The voice of Venom is deep, textured, and almost otherworldly. I was hooked. So, I set myself a challenge: could I recreate that voice?</p>\r\n<p>Venomâ€™s just one of many characters living in my head. From goblins and wise old wizards to pirates, gameshow hosts, and Santa himselfâ€”Iâ€™ve got a full voice cast ready to go. </p>', '<h2><strong>Learning the Venom Voice â€“ My Process</strong></h2>\r\n<p>I didnâ€™t study scripts or use fancy software. I simply watched. I listened. I mimicked. Itâ€™s all about getting the <em>weight</em> of the voice right. That dark resonance comes from way downâ€”past the chest, somewhere near your lunch. I reached deep and channelled that monstrous tone, layering in menace and rhythm. Just me and a mic.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover\">Visit my Character Voiceover page</a> to dive into my portfolio of playful, powerful, and peculiar performances.</p>', 'Voice of Venom.jpg', 'Qnr7JE3WeI8', 'Venom Voice Impression | Deep Gritty Character Voice', '<h2><strong>Need a Voice Thatâ€™s Not of This World?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™re looking for a voice thatâ€™s dark, gritty, and instantly unforgettable, Iâ€™d love to help bring your project to life. Whether itâ€™s for a villain, a trailer, or a unique campaignâ€¦ Iâ€™ve got the voice. Get in touch today.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Voiceover%20Enquiry%20â€“%20Venom%20Style\">ðŸ“© Contact Me Here</a></p>', 'June 25', '1', 'Marvel Voice of Venom', '3', '', 'My take on Venom â€“ challenge accepted!', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(975, 'hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover', 'Promo Voiceover - Patrick Stewart Style', '<p>Sometimes a voiceover brief lands in your inbox and you *know* itâ€™s going to be fun. <em>Hide the Corpse</em> was one of those. A darkly hilarious indie game, a theatrical script, and a creative challenge to blend Patrick Stewart-style gravitas with Matt Berryâ€™s glorious eccentricity.</p>', 'Patrick Stewart, Matt Berry', 'A deadpan promo for a delightfully absurd game. Guy Harris channels Patrick Stewart with a twist of Matt Berry. Bold, funny, and unmistakably British.', '<h2><strong>Bringing the Promo to Life â€“ Patrick Stewart Meets Berry</strong></h2>\r\n<p>For this one, I leaned into a deep, commanding presence â€” blending <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\">Patrick Stewartâ€™s style</a> with a dash of Matt Berry flair to match the gameâ€™s absurd humour. The result? An over-the-top but oddly grounded narration where the mission is literallyâ€¦ in the title.</p>\r\n<p>Itâ€™s that contrast â€” formal delivery, ridiculous premise â€” where voiceovers shine. And itâ€™s a joy when clients trust you to go full drama *for the silliest possible reason*.</p>\r\n<p>ðŸŽ® You can check out <em>Hide the Corpse</em> on <a href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3405120/Hide_The_Corpse/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Hide the Corpse on Steam\">Steam</a>.</p>', '<h2><strong>30K+ Views and Laughs All Round</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The promo racked up over 30,000 views on YouTube via the gameâ€™s official channel, proving this offbeat blend of gravitas and comedy landed well with audiences.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://realcast.io/htc/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Hide the Corpse creators\">Realcast</a> absolutely nailed the tone â€” and I\'m grateful they trusted me to bring a little theatrical absurdity to the mic.</p>\r\n<p>If you\'re after something similarly bold and British, check out other scripts I\'ve voiced in this tone:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/minecraft-backpack-patrick-stewart-style-voiceover\">Minecraft Backpack â€“ Stewart-style for gamers</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/nfl-cbs-sports-king-henry-voice-patrick-stewart\">NFL & CBS â€“ Epic narration for King Henry</a></li>\r\n  <li><a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/lending-crowd-patrick-stewart-voiceover\">Lending Crowd â€“ Confident, polished delivery</a></li>\r\n</ul>', 'hide-the-corpse-promo-voiceover.jpg', 'I0LcSnCasGY', 'Hide the Corpse Voiceover â€“ Patrick Stewart Meets Matt Berry', '<h2><strong>Need a Voice with Drama and Comedy?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Whether itâ€™s for a promo, trailer, or in-game narration, I can deliver a voice that balances theatrical flair with comic timing. From deep and commanding to quirky and playful, Iâ€™ll make sure your project stands out â€” and sticks in peopleâ€™s minds.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Voiceover%20Enquiry%20â€“%20Hide%20the%20Corpse%20Style\">ðŸ“© Get in touch</a> and letâ€™s create something memorable.</p>', '2016-02-01', '1', 'Patrick Stewart parody voice â€“ Hide the Corpse promo', '3', 'keywork1\", \"keywork2\", \"keywork3', 'Hide the Corpse â€“ Patrick meets Berry!', '', '<h2><strong>Looking for a Dramatic Voice with Comic Timing?</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If your project needs **voiceover with contrast** â€” a narrator who can sell the serious with a twinkle in his eye â€” Iâ€™d love to help.</p>\r\n<p>This style works brilliantly for:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n  <li>Game trailers and spoof promos</li>\r\n  <li>Dramatic parodies and over-the-top explainer videos</li>\r\n  <li>Brand campaigns with humour and edge</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>ðŸŽ§ Want more examples? Donâ€™t miss the original <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/patrick-stewart-money-supermartket-voice\">MoneySuperMarket Patrick Stewart tribute</a>.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=Hide%20The%20Corpse%20Voiceover\">ðŸ“© Get in touch</a> and letâ€™s make your project memorable.</p>', '', '', '', 'character-voiceovers.jpg', 'x', '', ''),
(977, 'attenborough-script-generator', 'David Attenborough Script Generator', '', 'David Attenborough Script Generator', '', '', '', 'attenborough-script-generator.jpg', '', '', '', '', '1', '', '6', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
