(979, 'playmobil-pirate-voice', 'British Male Voice for Playmobil Pirate Ad', '<p>\r\nNeed a fun and fearless pirate voice? I brought the high seas to life in this Playmobil promo! A swashbuckling performance with a playful twist, ideal for ads, toys, games, and more.\r\n</p>', 'playmobil, pirate voiceover, character, british', 'Playmobil Pirate Voice TV Ads voiced by Guy Harris â€“ UK-based British male voiceover artist known for energetic, characterful delivery.  the voice of a Pirate', '<h2>ðŸ¦œ Aye, itâ€™s a Playmobil Pirate!</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nAhoy there! Playmobil wanted a bold, characterful pirate voice for their swashbuckling sea adventure, and I was more than happy to step aboard. This high-energy read needed a blend of classic pirate charm with a cheeky modern twist.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWatch the clip below and youâ€™ll hear my signature <a href=\"/pirate-voiceover\" title=\"Pirate Voiceover\">pirate voice</a> in action â€“ perfect for childrenâ€™s promos, games, and animations.\r\n</p>', '<h2>âš“ What made this project so fun?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nPlaymobil gave me creative freedom to let the pirate character truly shine. Think rumbling sea shanties, exaggerated \"Arrrr!\"s, and a sprinkle of comedy â€“ the kind of performance that makes a toy advert memorable.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIf youâ€™re after something similar, whether itâ€™s for toys, YouTube ads, or character games, my <a href=\"/character-voiceover\" title=\"Character Voiceover\">character voiceover</a> work is where I thrive.\r\n</p>', 'pirate-voice.jpg', 'cGd--zjAH6g', 'Playmobil Pirate Voice â€“ British Male Voiceover | Guy Harris', '<h2>ðŸŽ™ï¸ Ready to set sail?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIf youâ€™re looking for a confident, cheeky pirate voice that brings your story to life â€“ get in touch! Whether itâ€™s for toys, games, promos or online content, Iâ€™m ready when you are.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Pirate Enquiry\">ðŸ“§ Get in touch</a> and letâ€™s bring your character to life.\r\n</p>', '2009-01-01', '1', 'Playmobil Pirate Voice â€“ British Male Character Voiceover', '5', 'playmobil\", \"pirate voice\", voice of a pirate', 'Playmobilâ€™s pirate TV ads', '', '<br><h2>ðŸ´â€â˜ ï¸ Booking a pirate voice has never been easier</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIf you need a lively, fun, and unmistakably British pirate voice, you\'re in the right port. With over 100k scripts voiced, Iâ€™ve helped countless brands and creators find the perfect tone.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nExplore more on my <a href=\"/commercial-voiceover\" title=\"Commercial Voiceover\">commercial voice page</a>, or take a listen to my work with <a href=\"lego-minifigures-pirate\" title=\"Lego Minifigures Pirate\">Lego Minifigures Pirate</a> for another playful Pirate read.\r\n</p>', '', '', '', 'pirate-voice-og.jpg', '', '', ''),
(981, 'gb-news-competition-voice', 'GB News Competition Voice', '<p>\r\nIâ€™m the voice behind the Great British Giveaway on GB News â€“ that booming, unmistakable announcer voice bringing the prize excitement to TV and radio every week. Itâ€™s the classic Voice of God delivery â€“ bold, clear, and full of authority.\r\n</p>', 'voice of god british', 'Guy Harris is the voice of GB News competitions â€“ delivering urgent, upbeat reads for TV promos with a tone of authority, trust and excitement. Hear samples.', '<h2>ðŸ“£ The Voice of the Great British Giveaway</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIf youâ€™ve watched <strong>GB News</strong> recently, chances are youâ€™ve heard my Voice of God announcing the latest prize bundles. From cars and cash to luxury getaways â€“ I deliver the energy and impact needed to make each competition unmissable.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis style isnâ€™t just for TV â€“ my <a href=\"/voice-of-god\" title=\"Voice of God Announcer\">Voice of God work</a> spans radio, live events, and streaming platforms too.\r\n</p>', '<h2>ðŸŽ¤ As heard on stage and screen</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nThis isnâ€™t my first competition voice gig. Youâ€™ll also hear me bringing that same commanding tone to <a href=\"/this-morning-spin-to-win-gameshow-voice\" title=\"This Morning Gameshow Voice\">ITV\'s This Morning</a>, where the tone is a touch more playful and game show-like.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nYou may also recognise me from the <a href=\"/britains-got-talent-competition-voice\" title=\"Britainâ€™s Got Talent Competition Voice\">Britainâ€™s Got Talent 2025 promos</a> or as the tour voice of <a href=\"/saturday-night-takeaway-voice\" title=\"Saturday Night Takeaway Tour Voice\">Ant & Decâ€™s Saturday Night Takeaway Live</a>.\r\n</p>', 'gb-news-competition-voice.jpg', '5jEcPyu2S5s', 'GB News Competition Voiceover â€“ Fast, Clear Voice of God style', '<h2>ðŸ“º Need this Voice for your next big moment?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIf youâ€™re looking for an authoritative Voice of God style for your competition, event or brand â€“ whether itâ€™s for TV, radio or on stage â€“ Iâ€™d love to help.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Voice of God Enquiry\">ðŸ“§ Get in touch</a> and letâ€™s make your next giveaway or event sound epic.\r\n</p>', '2025-10-09', '1', 'GB News Competition Voiceover â€“ Voice of God', '5', 'GB News\", \"Competition voice\", \"Voice of God', 'GB Newsâ€™ Great British Giveaway! Voice', '', '<h2>ðŸŽ­ Bringing excitement to live audiences too</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nMy <a href=\"/masked-singer-voice-of-god-butlins\" title=\"Masked Singer Butlins Voice\">Masked Singer Butlins</a> Voice of God performance is another great example of how this powerful style can energise a crowd. Itâ€™s big, bold, and designed to keep audiences engaged.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe Voice of God isnâ€™t just for TV competitions â€“ it works perfectly for corporate events, awards shows, and tour intros</a> too.\r\n</p>', '', '', '', 'voice-of-god-voice.jpg', '', '', ''),
(982, 'why-use-voiceoverguy', 'Why Clients Choose VoiceoverGuy', '<p>\r\nFinding the right voice shouldnâ€™t feel like a gamble. Most clients arrive here after dealing with late deliveries, messy audio, or someone who disappears the moment the script changes. I built my career on the opposite: fast turnaround, clear communication, and broadcast-quality audio every single time.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAfter 25 years and more than 200,000 voiceovers â€“ from <a href=\"/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Voiceover Studio\">studio sessions</a> to <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice\">Attenborough style narration</a> â€“ one thing has stayed the same: your job gets a lot easier when your voice artist actually shows up, takes direction, and delivers exactly what you need.\r\n</p>', 'voiceover reliability, professional voice artist, fast turnaround voiceover, broadcast quality voice, UK male voiceover, hire voiceover artist', 'Discover why brands trust Guy Harris for reliable, fast, broadcast-quality voiceovers. 25 yearsâ€™ experience, 200,000+ projects, and clients who return year afte', '<h2>ðŸš§ The Problem Most People Arrive With</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nVoiceovers should make your project better, not more stressful. But many clients land here after dealing with unreliable voices, missed deadlines, or audio recorded in what sounds suspiciously like a cupboard.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nYou need someone who can hit the read, follow direction, and deliver quickly â€“ whether itâ€™s for a <a href=\"/gameshow-host\" title=\"Gameshow Host Voice\">gameshow-style delivery</a> or a simple corporate read â€“ all without the drama.\r\n</p>', '<<h2>âš¡ A Voice You Donâ€™t Have to Chase</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIâ€™m in the studio every day â€“ this isnâ€™t a hobby or a side gig. If you need a same-day turnaround, a script change, or an extra take, Iâ€™m ready. Everything is recorded in a fully treated professional booth using broadcast-grade equipment.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nMy job is simple: make <em>your</em> job easier â€“ whether itâ€™s a <a href=\"/explainer-video-voice\" title=\"Explainer Video Voiceover\">clean explainer</a>, a <a href=\"/narration-voice\" title=\"Narration Voice\">solid narrative read</a>, or a punchier <a href=\"/movie-trailer-voice\" title=\"Trailer Voice\">trailer-style voiceover</a>.\r\n</p>', 'male-voiceover-in-booth.jpg', 'TqkdBK8mBW8', 'Why Use VoiceoverGuy? | 25 Years of Trusted UK Voiceovers', '<p>\r\nIf you need a voice thatâ€™s fast, reliable, easy to direct, and delivers broadcast-quality audio every single timeâ€¦ youâ€™ve found the right Guy.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWhy not hear my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice\">Attenborough style</a> or my <a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa voice</a> to get a feel for what I can do?\r\n</p>', 'Nov 25', '1', 'why-use-voiceoverguy', '3', 'voiceoverguy\", \"male voiceover\", \"voiceovers made easy', 'Why do thousands of projects land in my studio every year?', '', '<h2>ðŸŽ™ï¸ 25 Years, 200,000+ Voiceovers</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nOver the last quarter of a century, Iâ€™ve voiced just about everything â€“ radio ads, TV promos, games, characters, eLearning, explainers, in-store messaging, on-hold, the lot.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThat includes <a href=\"/voiceover-cartoons\" title=\"Cartoon Voiceovers\">cartoon characters</a>, <a href=\"/pirate-voice\" title=\"Pirate Voiceover\">pirate voices</a>, <a href=\"/football-commentator-voice\" title=\"Football Commentator Voice\">sports commentator reads</a>, and even <a href=\"/pathe-news-voice\" title=\"Pathe News Voice\">authentic PathÃ© News style narration</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSome clients have been with me for over <strong>20 years</strong> because they know theyâ€™ll always get consistent quality, reliability, and a read that works.\r\n</p>', '<h2>ðŸ‘Œ Easy to Work With</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nNo fuss. No ego. No disappearing act. If a wrong script is sent, we fix it. If you want alternatives, Iâ€™ll record them. Need a character voice like <a href=\"/santa-voice\" title=\"Santa Voiceover\">Santa</a>, <a href=\"/halloween-voice\" title=\"Halloween Voice\">a spooky Halloween read</a>, or my <a href=\"/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voice\">David Attenborough impression</a>? I switch instantly.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nWorking with me should feel like ticking a box on your to-do list â€“ not adding another one.\r\n</p>', '<h2>ðŸ’¼ Premiumâ€¦ But Worth It</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nYes, youâ€™ll find cheaper voices on Fiverr â€“ but you wonâ€™t get the same consistency, speed, experience, or broadcast level audio. What youâ€™re paying for isnâ€™t just the voice.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nYouâ€™re paying for peace of mind that your project â€“ whether itâ€™s a <a href=\"/voice-of-god\" title=\"Voice of God Announcer\">Voice of God announcement</a> or a national radio campaign â€“ will be delivered properly, on time, every time.\r\n</p>', '<h2>ðŸŒ Trusted by Big Brands</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIâ€™ve voiced for Apple, Disney, ITV, BBC, Lego, and thousands of smaller businesses who needed a professional sound. Whether itâ€™s a <a href=\"/voiceover-studio\" title=\"Voiceover Studio\">studio-recorded read</a> or a full character performance, I bring the same care, quality, and attention.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nBig brands, small brands, agencies â€“ they come back because they know exactly what theyâ€™re getting.\r\n</p>', 'male-voiceover-talking-bad.jpg', 'male-voiceover-on-stage.jpg', 'male-voiceover-in-wild.jpg', 'male-voiceover-in-character.jpg'),
(983, 'vintage-cash-cow-voiceover', 'Vintage Cash Cow Voiceover â€“ Calm, Trusted, Human', '<p>\r\nTrust matters when youâ€™re asking people to part with something valuable. Thatâ€™s why Vintage Cash Cow chose a calm, natural human voice to front their TV advertising.\r\n</p>', 'vintage cash cow voiceover, tv advert voiceover uk, trusted brand voice', 'Guy Harris is the voice of Vintage Cash Cow, delivering a calm, trusted voiceover for a hassle-free way to sell your valuables.', '<h2>A Voice That Reassures, Not Sells</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nVintage Cash Cow offers a genuinely hassle-free way to sell vintage items, jewellery and valuables. The message is simple, but the tone is crucial. This isnâ€™t a shouty sales pitch â€” itâ€™s about reassurance, clarity and trust.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe TV advert voiceover needed to feel understated and natural, allowing viewers to feel comfortable rather than pressured. A human read, delivered calmly and confidently, helps reinforce the brandâ€™s promise from the very first second â€” something a professional <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/commercial-voiceover\">commercial voiceover</a> is uniquely placed to do.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Why Human Voiceover Still Matters for TV Advertising</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nFor television advertising, especially in finance or valuables-based services, credibility is everything. A real voice brings warmth, timing and emotional intelligence that helps viewers relax and listen.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nSubtle pauses, gentle emphasis and an authentic delivery all contribute to building trust. Itâ€™s the kind of performance that doesnâ€™t draw attention to itself â€” it simply feels right. This is exactly why brands still choose an experienced <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/apple-voice-style\">British male voiceover</a> for major TV campaigns.\r\n</p>', 'vintage-cash-cow-tv-voiceover.jpg', '2SSgZGK1S9U', 'Vintage Cash Cow Voiceover â€“ The Sound of Trust', '<h2>The Sound of a Hassle-Free Promise</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nVintage Cash Cowâ€™s advertising works because the voice supports the message rather than overpowering it. The performance is confident but never pushy, reassuring without being patronising.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis style of delivery is often described as a â€œvoice of trustâ€ â€” the same qualities found in a classic <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/voice-of-god\">Voice of God voiceover</a>, but dialled back for modern audiences.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIf youâ€™re looking for a similar tone for TV, radio or online campaigns, a professional human voice can make all the difference.\r\n</p>', '2026-01-15', '1', 'Vintage Cash Cow TV Advert Voiceover â€“ Calm and Trusted Delivery', '3', 'vintage cash cow\",\"VoiceoverGuy tv ad\",\"Guy Harris vintage cash cow', 'Vintage Cash Cow needed a voice that felt reassuring, honest and human', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(984, 'ai', 'AI Voices vs Human Voiceovers â€“ Whatâ€™s the Real Difference?', '<p>\r\nAI voices are impressive technology. Human voices are trusted storytellers. And that difference still matters more than ever.\r\n</p>', 'ai voiceover, ai voices, human voiceover, ai vs human voice, british voiceover, professional voiceover', 'AI voices are fast and cheap, but human voiceovers bring emotion, timing, trust and creativity. Hereâ€™s why real voices still matter.', '<h2>AI Voices Are Fast â€“ But Speed Isnâ€™t Everything</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nAI voices have come a long way in a short space of time. Theyâ€™re fast, scalable, and can produce large volumes of audio at very low cost. For basic information delivery or internal content, they absolutely have their place.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nBut voiceovers arenâ€™t just about reading words out loud. Theyâ€™re about tone, intent, pacing, and understanding the <em>why</em> behind a script. And thatâ€™s where AI still falls short.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAudiences can hear the difference. They might not always be able to explain it, but they can feel it â€” especially in advertising, storytelling, brand messaging and anything emotional or persuasive.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Why Human Voiceovers Still Win</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nA human voiceover reacts to a script rather than simply reading it. We interpret meaning, emphasise the right words, adjust timing instinctively, and respond to feedback creatively.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nReal voices bring warmth, credibility and trust. They can be playful, authoritative, reassuring or dramatic â€” often all within the same read. And crucially, they adapt in real time to direction, context and brand tone.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nAI can imitate sound. Humans deliver intention. When your message matters, that difference is huge.\r\n</p>', 'ai-voices-vs-human-voiceover.jpg', '', 'AI Voices vs Human Voiceovers | Why Humans Still Win', '<h2>AI vs Human Voiceovers â€“ The Bottom Line</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nAI voices are improving quickly and theyâ€™re not going away. Used sensibly, they can be useful for drafts, internal content or high-volume projects where emotion isnâ€™t the priority.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nBut when a voice needs to persuade, reassure, entertain or build trust, a real human performance still delivers something AI simply canâ€™t replicate. Subtle timing, emotional intelligence and creative instinct are what make audiences listen.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIn short: AI voices can speak. Human voiceovers communicate. And for brands that care about how theyâ€™re heard, that distinction still matters.\r\n</p>', '2025-10-09', '1', '', '0', 'ai voiceover\",\"ai voices\",\"human voiceover', 'AI voices are everywhere right now. But...', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(985, 'beccas-bunce-voice-of-ringo', 'Beccaâ€™s Bunch Voiceover â€“ Ringo the Turtle', '<p>\r\nIn 2018, I voiced Ringo the turtle in <em>Beccaâ€™s Bunch</em>, a preschool animation series featuring handcrafted puppet characters and gentle, character-led storytelling.\r\n</p>', 'beccas bunch voiceover, animation voiceover, character voiceover', 'Guy Harris voices Ringo the turtle in Beccaâ€™s Bunch, a preschool animation broadcast on Channel 5, featuring handcrafted puppets and gentle storytelling.', '<h2>Voicing Ringo in Beccaâ€™s Bunch</h2>\r\n<p>\r\n<em>Beccaâ€™s Bunch</em> is a preschool television series that originally aired on Channel 5 in the UK. The show follows Becca and her group of friends as they explore everyday adventures in Wagtail Woods, with a strong focus on kindness, curiosity and problem-solving.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nRingo is a friendly turtle who works as a bus driver, often popping up throughout the series as a familiar and reassuring presence. Although the show hasnâ€™t been recommissioned for further series, there were a substantial number of episodes produced, and Ringo appeared regularly across them.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Character Voiceover for Childrenâ€™s Television</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nVoicing characters for childrenâ€™s television requires a balance of warmth, clarity and personality. Ringoâ€™s voice needed to feel friendly and dependable, without overpowering the gentle tone of the series.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThis kind of work sits firmly within my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover\">character voiceover</a> work, alongside other long-running childrenâ€™s TV projects.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nIâ€™ve also voiced multiple characters in <em>Thomas &amp; Friends</em>, including Winston, Salty and Troublesome Tanker 2, roles that similarly rely on clear characterisation and consistent delivery across episodes. You can read more about that work on my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/thomas-the-tank-engine-voice-of-winston\">Thomas &amp; Friends voiceover page</a>.\r\n</p>', 'beccas-bunce-voice-of-ringo.jpg', 'HeWhEx_QAh0', 'Beccaâ€™s Bunch Voiceover â€“ Ringo the Turtle', '<h2>Looking for a Character Voice?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIf youâ€™re producing animation, childrenâ€™s content or character-led projects and need a reliable, experienced voice, Iâ€™m always happy to chat.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nYou can get in touch directly via my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy\">contact page</a>.\r\n</p>', '2018-09-24', '1', 'Beccaâ€™s Bunch Voiceover â€“ Ringo the Turtle Character', '3', 'becca bunch ringo voice\", \"animation voiceovers\", \"cockney voice for beccas bunch animation', 'Ringo the turtle in Beccaâ€™s Bunch', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(986, 'draw-slasher-voice', 'Draw Slasher Game Voiceover', '<p>\r\nIn 2016, I provided the voiceover for the Draw Slasher game trailer, as well as voicing characters and creating in-game vocal sounds throughout the game.\r\n</p>', 'draw slasher voiceover, game trailer voiceover, character voiceover', 'Guy Harris voiced the trailer, characters and in-game sounds for Draw Slasher, an action-packed indie game released on Steam in 2016.', '<h2>Voicing Draw Slasher</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nDraw Slasher is a fast-paced, action-packed indie game featuring hand-drawn animation and a distinctive visual style. Players control Hanzo, a not-so-high ninja on a mission to rescue his family from the Pirate Monkey Zombiesâ„¢.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe gameâ€™s mechanics are built around drawing mouse gestures to slash, jump, dash and unleash Ninjutsu techniques, creating a frantic and highly physical gameplay experience.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nI voiced the official trailer for Draw Slasher, along with character voices and a wide range of in-game vocal sounds â€” a style of performance that sits firmly within my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/character-voiceover\">character voiceover</a> work.\r\n</p>', '<h2>Game Trailer and Character Voiceover</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nGame trailers require a very specific style of delivery. The voice needs to match the pace and energy of gameplay while remaining clear, engaging and memorable within a short runtime.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThat balance of performance and timing is especially important in <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/clash-of-clans-goblins-voiceover\">character-led voiceover</a> projects, where the voice becomes part of the gameplay experience rather than simply narrating it.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nDraw Slasher was released on Steam in October 2016 and supports Windows, Mac and Linux platforms, bringing its distinctive visual style and energetic sound design to a wide audience.\r\n</p>', 'draw-slasher-game-voiceover.jpg', 'qiji_6gsI0A', 'Draw Slasher Game Voiceover â€“ Trailer & Characters', '<h2>Need a Voice for a Game or Trailer?</h2>\r\n<p>\r\nIf youâ€™re developing a game, trailer or interactive project and need character voices, vocal effects or narration, Iâ€™d be happy to help.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nYou can get in touch directly via my <a href=\"https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/contact-guy\">contact page</a>.\r\n</p>', '2016-10-13', '1', 'Draw Slasher Game Voiceover â€“ Trailer and Character Voices', '0', 'draw slasher voiceover\",\"game trailer voiceover\",\"character voiceover', 'Draw Slasher trailer, characters and sound effects', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
(987, 'radiator-warehouse-rock-star-voiceover', 'Radiator Warehouse â€“ Radiators That Rock Voiceover', '<p>Rockâ€‘star energy meets radiator heat â€” Guy Harris delivers the voiceover for Radiator Warehouseâ€™s â€œRadiators That Rockâ€ campaign.</p>', 'radiator warehouse voiceover, radiators that rock, heating commercials', 'Guy Harris voices the bold â€œRadiators That Rockâ€ campaign for Radiator Warehouse â€” rockâ€‘star energy meets radiator heat. Feel the power in every line!', '<h2><strong>Heating Up the Airwaves with Style</strong></h2>\r\n<p>I was thrilled to be chosen as the voice behind the new bold radio and TV spot for <strong>Radiator Warehouse</strong>, creators of affordable designer radiators from just Â£43. Their tagline â€” â€œRadiators That Rock â€” Feel the Heat, Feel the Power!â€ â€” needed a voice to match the swagger, and we went full rockâ€‘star with it: strong, charismatic, and unmistakably powerful.</p>\r\n<p>For those who donâ€™t know, <em>The Radiator Warehouse</em> specialises in a wide range of highâ€‘quality radiators, towel rails and heating solutions with free UK delivery and excellent reviews from satisfied customers.</p>', '<h2><strong>Rock Concert Vibes for Radiators</strong></h2>\r\n<p>The brief was fun: make radiators feel like a rock anthem. From that opening line voiced with punch to the energetic delivery throughout, this ad blends personality with purpose â€” helping Radiator Warehouse stand out from the usual DIY heating ads. Whether itâ€™s flat panel radiators or vertical designs, theyâ€™ve got a style for every home. And in case youâ€™re wonderingâ€¦ yes, it *does* feel like standing front row with the amps cranked and your heater pulling centre stage. The heat is real, and so is the power!</p>', 'radiator-warehouse-voice.jpg', 'GmcfnTEeB_Y', 'Radiator Warehouse Voiceover â€“ Radiators That Rock', '<h2><strong>Letâ€™s Get Your Script Heard</strong></h2>\r\n<p>If youâ€™ve got a campaign that needs attitude, warmth, gravitas or energy, Iâ€™m here to help. Whether youâ€™re working on a commercial, trailer, explainer or broadcast ad, send across your script and Iâ€™ll happily provide a quote or demo read. <a href=\"mailto:guy@voiceoverguy.co.uk?subject=VoiceoverGuy Enquiry\" title=\"Email Guy direct now\">ðŸ“§ Get in touch</a> today!</p>', '2026-01-13', '1', 'radiator warehouse voiceover', '3', 'radiator warehouse voiceoverâ€, â€œradiators that rockâ€, â€œheating commercial voice', 'Radiator Warehouse voiceover â€” Radiators That Rock campaign.', '', '<h2><strong>Need a Voice That Rocksâ€¦ or Just Warms</strong></h2>\r\n<p>Whether itâ€™s a quirky commercial like this one, a corporate explainer, or even a bold character narration, Iâ€™ve got the delivery to match. From naturalâ€‘sounding reads to voices with edge and personality, my studio setup means fast turnaround and professional quality every time.</p>\r\n<p>Have a listen to some other styles on my <a href=\"/voiceover-news\" title=\"Voice Demos\">voice demos</a> page, or drop me a script via the <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact Guy\">contact page</a> and letâ€™s make your project sing.</p>', '', '', '', '', '', '', ''),
